rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "If you name a card that has both a mana ability and another activated ability, the mana ability can be activated but the other ability can\'t be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "Pithing Needle affects cards regardless of what zone they\'re in. This includes cards in hand, cards in the graveyard, and exiled cards. For example, a player can\'t cycle Eternal Dragon or return an Eternal Dragon from their graveyard to hand if Pithing Needle naming Eternal Dragon is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "You can name any card, even if that card doesn\'t normally have an activated ability. You can\'t name a token unless that token has the same name as a card."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Once Pithing Needle has left the battlefield, activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can be activated again.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form "[cost]: [effect]." Triggered abilities and static abilities of the named card work normally.\'}]', "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If Pariah’s Shield isn’t attached to a creature, all damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to you normally.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If Phytohydra blocks or is blocked by a creature with first strike or double strike, Phytohydra will get the counters during the first-strike combat damage step before it deals its own combat damage during the second combat damage step.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If another effect would prevent damage from being dealt to Phytohydra or replace it with something else, Phytohydra’s controller chooses which effect to apply first.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose an Aura and there isn’t a legal permanent for it to enchant, you put Copy Enchantment into your graveyard. It never enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose an Aura, you also choose a legal permanent for the Copy Enchantment copy of it to enchant. Copy Enchantment doesn’t target that permanent, however, so it can enter the battlefield attached to an untargetable creature.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If you don’t choose an enchantment, Copy Enchantment enters the battlefield without copying anything, and it sits there with a useless ability.'}, {'date': '2006-04-01', 'text': 'If this is copying a Genju, such as Genju of the Fields, and the land this enchants goes to the graveyard, you will return the Copy Enchantment to your hand.'}, {'date': '2006-07-01', 'text': 'Copies all copiable values, to include mana cost, so if you copy Dream Leash, for example, the converted mana cost of Copy Enchantment will be 5.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'Other creatures you control that are both green and white, including Voja, get +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'The token is named “Voja” and has creature type “Wolf.” This is different from most creature tokens, where the name and creature type are the same.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The “legend rule” means that creating a second Voja while one is already under your control will result in one of them being put into its owner’s graveyard (where it promptly ceases to exist). You choose which of the two remains on the battlefield and which is put into the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'Sacrificing a creature that’s both black and green will make both abilities trigger. You may put them on the stack in whichever order you want.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'Savra itself doesn’t let you sacrifice creatures, and you can’t sacrifice them spontaneously. You must have another spell or ability that lets you sacrifice creatures.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'These abilities trigger specifically when you “sacrifice” a creature. They won’t trigger when a creature is put into your graveyard for any other reason.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'The card is cast from your opponent’s hand, not yours.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'The spell is cast during the resolution of Mindleech Mass’s triggered ability. You may cast any nonland card in the player’s hand, not just an instant card. This doesn’t get around other prohibitions, such as “Cast this card only before attackers are declared.”'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'You choose modes, pay additional costs, choose targets, etc. for the spell as normal when casting it. Any X in the mana cost will be 0. Alternative costs can’t be paid.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'You control the spell and, if it’s an artifact, creature, or enchantment spell, you control the resulting permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'You may find any card with Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, or Forest on its type line. The land doesn’t need to be a basic land, so you can find a land such as Overgrown Tomb or Tropical Island.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "If you cast multiple Quickens on the same turn, they\'ll all apply to the very next sorcery spell you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose a sorcery card when Quicken resolves. Rather, this sets up a rule that is true for you until the turn ends or until you cast a sorcery card, even if you cast that sorcery at a time you normally could."}, {\'date\': \'2006-09-25\', \'text\': \'After Quicken resolves, you can Suspend a sorcery in your hand any time you can cast an instant. As soon as you actually cast a sorcery, you lose this capability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "The Mountain will remain a creature for the rest of the game. It doesn\'t have a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn\'t matter how long the permanent has been a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "As the replicate triggered ability resolves, you\'ll copy Shattering Spree for each time you paid its replicate cost, even if the original spell is no longer on the stack at that time (perhaps because it was countered)."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'The copies that replicate creates are created on the stack, so they\\\'re not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an artifact, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "While casting a spell with convoke, if you sacrifice Wild Cantor to add mana to your mana pool, Wild Cantor won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay that spell\'s costs. It can\'t be tapped to help cast that spell using convoke."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "Wurmweaver Coil can enchant only a green creature. It can\'t enter the battlefield attached to a nongreen creature, it can\'t be moved onto a nongreen creature, and if the creature it\'s attached to stops being green, the Aura is put into its owner\'s graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': \'Aetherplasm will return to your hand before any combat damage is assigned.\'}, {\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "If you want, you can return Aetherplasm to your hand and not put anything onto the battlefield. The attacking creature will still be considered blocked, so it won\'t be able to deal combat damage to you unless it has trample or a similar ability."}, {\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "The creature you put onto the battlefield from your hand is blocking the attacking creature, even if the block couldn\'t legally be declared (for example, if that creature enters the battlefield tapped, or it can\'t block, or the attacking creature has protection from it)."}, {\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "The creature you put onto the battlefield may be the Aetherplasm you just returned to your hand. This allows it to dodge abilities like Deathgazer\'s."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Although the creature that enters the battlefield is blocking, it was never declared as a blocking creature for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature blocks (such as Aetherplasm\'s ability, for example)."}]', "[{'date': '2006-02-01', 'text': 'Errata’d to make it clear that only the cards you own go into your hand, so if you somehow gain control of the Cloister, your opponent’s cards won’t go to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'Carom’s controller draws a card when Carom resolves, not when the damage is redirected.'}, {'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'If either target has left the battlefield before the damage would be dealt, that damage isn’t redirected.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'For the first ability, if the two target creatures aren’t controlled by the same player when the ability resolves, the ability does nothing. The player who controls the two creatures doesn’t have to be the same player who controlled them when the ability was activated, and that player doesn’t have to be Simic Guildmage’s controller.'}, {'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'For the first ability, the first target creature doesn’t need to have a +1/+1 counter on it. If it doesn’t, the ability does nothing.'}, {'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'For the second ability, only the Aura is targeted. When the ability resolves, you choose a permanent to move the Aura onto. It can’t be the permanent the Aura is already attached to, it must be controlled by the player who controls the permanent the Aura is attached to, and it must be able to be enchanted by the Aura. (It doesn’t matter who controls the Aura or who controls Simic Guildmage.) If no such permanent exists, the Aura doesn’t move.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'If Rakdos Pit Dragon loses double strike after first strike combat damage has been dealt, it won’t deal damage during the normal combat damage step.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'If an activated ability with {T} in its cost is granted to a creature by an effect (such as Hypervolt Grasp’s effect, for instance), Magewright’s Stone can untap that creature.'}, {'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'This looks for the {T} symbol. The phrase “tap an untapped creature you control” isn’t the same and doesn’t count.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'If the second ability is activated during the End step, the token won’t be exiled until the following turn’s End step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "Creatures with reach (such as Giant Spider) don\'t actually have flying, so they can\'t block this."}]', "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'If Narcomoeba is removed from your graveyard before its ability resolves, it won’t be put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'If Narcomoeba is revealed or looked at while moving from your library to your graveyard (such as with Mind Funeral), its ability will trigger when it’s put into your graveyard. It was still in your library while it was revealed or being looked at.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The affected creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its toughness."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The ability counts each Goblin you control, including Krenko itself, not just the tokens it creates.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Yeva’s ability applies to green creature cards in any zone, provided something is allowing you to cast them. For example, if the top card of your library is a green creature card and you control Garruk’s Horde, you can cast that card as though it had flash.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You still pay the costs for green creature cards you cast.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If the value chosen for X is larger than the number of cards left in your library, you\'ll lose the game the next time state-based actions are performed."}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Civic Saber’s bonus can range from +0/+0 (for a colorless creature) to +5/+0 (for a creature that’s all five colors).'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the equipped creature becomes a different number of colors, the bonus will change accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Pack Rat leaves the battlefield before its activated ability resolves, the token will still enter the battlefield as a copy of Pack Rat, using Pack Rat’s copiable values from when it was last on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Pack Rat’s first ability counts any creature you control with the creature type Rat, not just Pack Rats.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The token will copy Pack Rat’s two abilities. Its power and toughness will be equal to the number of Rats you control (not the number of Rats you controlled when the token entered the battlefield). It will also be able to create copies of itself.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The token won’t copy counters on Pack Rat, nor will it copy other effects that have changed Pack Rat’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Normally, this means the token will simply be a Pack Rat. But if any copy effects have affected that Pack Rat, they’re taken into account.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you control Sphere of Safety, your opponents can choose not to attack with a creature with an ability that says it attacks if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The two creatures can be controlled by the same opponent or by different opponents.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form “[cost]: [effect].” No one can activate any activated abilities, including mana abilities, of a detained permanent.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature is already attacking or blocking when it’s detained, it won’t be removed from combat. It will continue to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a noncreature permanent is detained and later turns into a creature, it won’t be able to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent’s activated ability is on the stack when that permanent is detained, the ability will be unaffected.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The static abilities of a detained permanent still apply. The triggered abilities of a detained permanent can still trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When a player leaves a multiplayer game, any continuous effects with durations that last until that player’s next turn or until a specific point in that turn will last until that turn would have begun. They neither expire immediately nor last indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Vigilance only matters when Armory Guard is being declared as an attacking creature. If Armory Guard is already attacking, losing control of your only Gate won’t cause Armory Guard to become tapped or to leave combat.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If Prime Speaker Zegana enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature you control, you won\'t consider that creature when determining the greatest power among creatures you control."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "The number of cards you draw equals Prime Speaker Zegana\'s power when the last ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'The value of X is the greatest power among creatures you control as Prime Speaker Zegana enters the battlefield. If you control no creatures at that time, X will be 0.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'An activated ability is written in the form “Cost: Effect.”'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If Illusionist’s Bracers somehow becomes equipped to a creature an opponent controls, and an activated ability (that isn’t a mana ability) of that creature is activated, you will control the copy of that ability.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If the ability has {X} in its cost, the value of X is copied.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If the ability is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If the cost of an activated ability requires Illusionist’s Bracers or the equipped creature to be sacrificed, the ability won’t be copied. At the time the ability is considered activated (after all costs are paid), Illusionist’s Bracers is no longer equipped to that creature.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the ability it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'A mana ability is an ability that (1) isn’t a loyalty ability, (2) doesn’t target, and (3) could put mana into a player’s mana pool when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Effects that would replace gaining life with another effect won’t apply because it’s impossible for players to gain life.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect says to set a player’s life total to a certain number and that number is higher than the player’s current life total, that part of the effect won’t do anything. (If the number is lower than the player’s current life total, the effect will work as normal.)'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Skullcrack targets only the player. If that player is an illegal target when Skullcrack tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that would cause a player to gain life or that would prevent damage still resolve, but the life-gain and damage-prevention parts have no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Homing Lightning has only one target. Other creatures with that name are not targeted. For example, a creature with hexproof will be dealt damage if it has the same name as the target creature.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The name of a creature token is the same as its creature types unless the token is a copy of another creature or the effect that created the token specifically gives it a different name. For example, a 1/1 Soldier creature token is named “Soldier.”'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If Forced Adaptation’s ability triggers but Forced Adaptation isn’t on the battlefield when the ability resolves, put a +1/+1 counter on the creature it was enchanting when it left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The creature that gets the +1/+1 counter is the creature enchanted by Forced Adaptation when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If removing two +1/+1 counters from Experiment One causes the amount of damage already marked on Experiment One to be equal to or greater than its toughness, it will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action before the regeneration shield is created.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield with +1/+1 counters on it, consider those counters when determining if evolve will trigger. For example, a 1/1 creature that enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it will cause the evolve ability of a 2/2 creature to trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If evolve triggers, the stat comparison will happen again when the ability tries to resolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, the ability will do nothing. If the creature that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before evolve tries to resolve, use its last known power and toughness to compare the stats.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield at the same time, evolve may trigger multiple times, although the stat comparison will take place each time one of those abilities tries to resolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and two 3/3 creatures enter the battlefield, evolve will trigger twice. The first ability will resolve and put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. When the second ability tries to resolve, neither the power nor the toughness of the new creature is greater than that of the creature with evolve, so that ability does nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When comparing the stats as the evolve ability resolves, it’s possible that the stat that’s greater changes from power to toughness or vice versa. If this happens, the ability will still resolve and you’ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and a 1/3 creature enters the battlefield under your control, it toughness is greater so evolve will trigger. In response, the 1/3 creature gets +2/-2. When the evolve trigger tries to resolve, its power is greater. You’ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When comparing the stats of the two creatures for evolve, you always compare power to power and toughness to toughness.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, check its power and toughness against the power and toughness of the creature with evolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, evolve won’t trigger at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If you are playing with the top card of your library revealed (due to Garruk’s Horde, for example), you’ll reveal each card before you draw it.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You won’t have to discard any card during the cleanup step of the turn you cast Enter the Infinite. You will have to discard down to your maximum hand size during the cleanup step of your next turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t control twenty or more artifacts at the beginning of your upkeep, Hellkite Tyrant’s last ability won’t trigger. If it does trigger, it will check again when it tries to resolve. If you don’t control twenty or more artifacts at that time, the ability will do nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Keymaster Rogue’s last ability isn’t optional. If Keymaster Rogue is the only creature you control when the ability resolves, you’ll have to return it to its owner’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Lord of the Void’s ability isn’t optional. If there is a creature card among the seven cards you exiled, you must put one onto the battlefield under your control.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Mortis Strider will return to its owner’s hand only if it is still in the graveyard when its ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Shadow Alley Denizen can be chosen as the target of its own ability.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The black creature that entered the battlefield can be chosen as the target of Shadow Alley Denizen’s ability, but it won’t be able to attack that turn unless it also has haste.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You choose the color when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'A creature with unleash can’t block if it has any +1/+1 counter on it, not just one put on it by the unleash ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Putting a +1/+1 counter on a creature with unleash that’s already blocking won’t remove it from combat. It will continue to block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The unleash ability applies no matter where the creature is entering the battlefield from.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You make the choice to have the creature with unleash enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter or not as it’s entering the battlefield. At that point, it’s too late for a player to respond to the creature spell by trying to counter it, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form “[cost]: [effect].” No one can activate any activated abilities, including mana abilities, of a detained permanent.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature is already attacking or blocking when it’s detained, it won’t be removed from combat. It will continue to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a noncreature permanent is detained and later turns into a creature, it won’t be able to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent’s activated ability is on the stack when that permanent is detained, the ability will be unaffected.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The static abilities of a detained permanent still apply. The triggered abilities of a detained permanent can still trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When a player leaves a multiplayer game, any continuous effects with durations that last until that player’s next turn or until a specific point in that turn will last until that turn would have begun. They neither expire immediately nor last indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when something “attacks and isn’t blocked” triggers in the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if (1) that creature is attacking and (2) no creatures are declared to block it. It will trigger even if that creature was put onto the battlefield attacking rather than having been declared as an attacker in the declare attackers step.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Assigning no combat damage isn’t the same as preventing that damage. Effects that make damage unpreventable will have no effect if no combat damage can be assigned.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'For a player’s life total to become 1, what actually happens is that the player loses (or in some rare cases, gains) the appropriate amount of life. For example, if the player’s life total is 4 when the last ability resolves, it will cause that player to lose 3 life. Other effects that interact with life loss (or gain) will interact with this effect accordingly.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If Master of Cruelties attacks alone, another creature entering the battlefield attacking will have no effect on it. Master of Cruelties continues to be an attacking creature. The other attacking creature will assign combat damage normally, regardless of whether Master of Cruelties’s last ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Master of Cruelties isn’t forced to attack, but if it does, it must do so alone. If you control another creature with an ability that says it must attack if able, that creature must attack and Master of Cruelties won’t be able to.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Master of Cruelties’s last ability won’t trigger if it attacks a planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Rootborn Defenses affects only creatures you control after populating at the time it resolves. The creature token you create will gain indestructible, but creatures you begin to control later in the turn will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Casting a spell with overload doesn’t change that spell’s mana cost. You just pay the overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its overload cost, too.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to pay its overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Note that if the spell with overload is dealing damage, protection from that spell’s color will still prevent that damage.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Overload doesn’t change when you can cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Controlling multiple Gates with the same name has no effect on your ability to win the game with Maze’s End. The excess Gates are simply ignored.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Putting a Gate onto the battlefield with Maze’s End doesn’t count as the one land you can play during your turn. If it’s your turn, you can play Maze’s End or a different land card from your hand after its ability has resolved.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Returning Maze’s End to its owner’s hand is part of the cost to activate its last ability. Once that ability is announced, players can’t respond to it until after you’ve paid its activation cost and returned Maze’s End to hand.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When the last ability of Maze’s End resolves, you’ll search for a Gate and put it onto the battlefield before checking to see if you win the game. This check will happen even if you don’t put a Gate onto the battlefield this way. This check will happen only as the ability resolves, not at other times.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Exiling the creature card with scavenge is part of the cost of activating the scavenge ability. Once the ability is activated and the cost is paid, it’s too late to stop the ability from being activated by trying to remove the creature card from the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Gate is not a basic land type.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The subtype Gate has no special rules significance, but other spells and abilities may refer to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield with +1/+1 counters on it, consider those counters when determining if evolve will trigger. For example, a 1/1 creature that enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it will cause the evolve ability of a 2/2 creature to trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If evolve triggers, the stat comparison will happen again when the ability tries to resolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, the ability will do nothing. If the creature that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before evolve tries to resolve, use its last known power and toughness to compare the stats.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield at the same time, evolve may trigger multiple times, although the stat comparison will take place each time one of those abilities tries to resolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and two 3/3 creatures enter the battlefield, evolve will trigger twice. The first ability will resolve and put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. When the second ability tries to resolve, neither the power nor the toughness of the new creature is greater than that of the creature with evolve, so that ability does nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When comparing the stats as the evolve ability resolves, it’s possible that the stat that’s greater changes from power to toughness or vice versa. If this happens, the ability will still resolve and you’ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and a 1/3 creature enters the battlefield under your control, it toughness is greater so evolve will trigger. In response, the 1/3 creature gets +2/-2. When the evolve trigger tries to resolve, its power is greater. You’ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When comparing the stats of the two creatures for evolve, you always compare power to power and toughness to toughness.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, check its power and toughness against the power and toughness of the creature with evolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, evolve won’t trigger at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Once a battalion ability has triggered, it doesn’t matter how many creatures are still attacking when that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The effects of battalion abilities vary from card to card. Read each card carefully.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The three attacking creatures don’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain from extort is based on the total amount of life lost, not necessarily the number of opponents you have. For example, if your opponent’s life total can’t change (perhaps because that player controls Platinum Emperion), you won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The extort ability doesn’t target any player.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You may pay {W/B} a maximum of one time for each extort triggered ability. You decide whether to pay when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Dredge lets you replace any card draw, not just the one during your draw step.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Once you decide to replace a draw using a card’s dredge ability, that card can’t be removed from your graveyard “in response.” (Replacement effects don’t use the stack.)'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You can’t use dredge unless you’re going to draw a card and the card with dredge is already in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Golgari Grave-Troll may become lethal if you return remove +1/+1 counters from it during that turn. In this case, it dies before you can resolve the activated ability that will regenerate it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you return Golgari Grave-Troll from your graveyard directly to the battlefield, its first ability counts itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Dredge lets you replace any card draw, not just the one during your draw step.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Once you decide to replace a draw using a card’s dredge ability, that card can’t be removed from your graveyard “in response.” (Replacement effects don’t use the stack.)'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You can’t use dredge unless you’re going to draw a card and the card with dredge is already in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can’t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The rules for convoke have changed slightly since it last appeared in an expansion. Previously, convoke reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under current rules, you tap creatures at the same time you pay the spell’s costs. Tapping a creature this way is simply another way to pay.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Chord of Calling (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{G}{G}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{G}{G}. If you tap two green creatures and two red creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}{G}.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'The declare blockers step is the last chance to cast Devouring Light before creatures deal their combat damage. However, a creature remains an attacking or blocking creature during the combat damage step and end of combat step. Devouring Light may be cast targeting such a creature during those steps, after the creature has dealt combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "You can tap untapped attacking or blocking creatures you control to help cast Devouring Light. This doesn\'t remove those creatures from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'A monocolored creature has exactly one color.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Face-down creatures and most artifact creatures are not monocolored.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If Mizzix\'s Mastery exiled multiple cards, you may cast the copies in any order. The last copy you cast will be the first one to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If the copy has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast one of the copies (perhaps because there are no legal targets available or you don\'t want to), the copy will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Mizzix\'s Mastery is still on the stack as it resolves. If you pay the overload cost, Mizzix\'s Mastery won\'t copy itself."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'The cards remain exiled no matter what happens to the copies.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'The copies are created and cast during the resolution of Mizzix\\\'s Mastery. You can\\\'t wait to cast them later in the turn. Timing restrictions based on the copy\\\'s type are ignored. Other restrictions (such as "Cast [this spell] only during combat") are not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell with overload, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'A creature with lifelink dealing combat damage is a single life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, the ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it causes your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from an attacking creature with lifelink or 4 life from Faith’s Fetters.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Gigantoplasm enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Effects that modify Gigantoplasm’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to Gigantoplasm no matter when they started applying. The same is true for counters that affect its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Gigantoplasm copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, etc.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'However, the effect of that ability isn’t copiable. That is, if Gigantoplasm is a copy of a creature with base power and toughness 2/2 and you activate its ability making it a 4/4 creature, another creature that becomes a copy of Gigantoplasm will have base power and toughness 2/2.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If Gigantoplasm isn’t a creature (perhaps because it copied a land that had temporarily become a creature), you can still activate the ability “{X}: This creature has base power and toughness X/X.” However, this ability won’t have any effect, and it won’t turn Gigantoplasm into a creature.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If Gigantoplasm somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, it can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0. The ability that Gigantoplasm gives itself doesn’t affect an {X} in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Gigantoplasm copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. Gigantoplasm isn’t a token, even if it’s copying one.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Gigantoplasm), then Gigantoplasm enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature was copying (plus any abilities it gained as part of the copy process, if applicable).'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The activated ability Gigantoplasm gives itself becomes part of its copiable values. Unless the ability is overwritten by another copy effect, a creature that’s a copy of Gigantoplasm will have that ability.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The activated ability overwrites all previous effects that set Gigantoplasm’s base power and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its base power and/or toughness that start to apply after the ability resolves (including ones created by subsequent activations of the ability) will overwrite the effect of the ability.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Gigantoplasm enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you choose the value of X before calculating the spell’s total cost. For example, if that spell’s mana cost is {X}{R}{G} and you’ve chosen red and green, you could choose 5 as the value of X and pay {3}{R}{G} to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast a spell, or if the cost to cast a spell is increased by an effect (such as the one created by Thalia, Guardian of Thraben’s ability), apply those increases before applying cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Seal of the Guildpact’s last ability can’t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic component of that cost.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Seal of the Guildpact’s last ability doesn’t change the mana cost or converted mana cost of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The cost reduction can apply to alternative costs such as evoke costs.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You must choose two different colors.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Because the first ability requires a target, it is not a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the target of any of Deathrite Shaman’s three abilities is an illegal target when that ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t add mana to your mana pool, no opponent will lose life, or you won’t gain life, as appropriate.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If a creature has both double strike and trample, the combat damage it assigned during the first combat damage step will be considered when determining how much damage can trample through in the second combat damage step. If each creature blocking it is destroyed during the first combat damage step, then all of the damage must be assigned to the defending player or planeswalker during the second combat damage step.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If either target of Domri’s second ability is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The second target of Domri’s second ability can be another creature you control, but it can’t be the same creature as the first target.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'When resolving Domri’s first ability, if the card you look at isn’t a creature card, or if it’s a creature card you don’t want to put into your hand, you simply put it back on top of your library. You don’t reveal it or say why you’re putting it back.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Fists of Ironwood tries to resolve, Fists of Ironwood won’t resolve and won’t enter the battlefield. You won’t create Saproling tokens.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The Saproling tokens aren’t created until after Fists of Ironwood is on the battlefield, so you can’t cast Fists of Ironwood on one of those tokens.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'You create the Saproling tokens, even if Fists of Ironwood enters the battlefield attached to another player’s creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The target player can discard either one land card or two cards which may or may not be lands. The player can discard one land and one other card or two land cards if they choose.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'Two Goblin Electromancers will make instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {2} less to cast, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Goblin Electromancer\'s effect reduces only generic mana in the spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If the chosen target is illegal when Lightning Helix tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t gain 3 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat. There\\\'s no such thing as an attacking creature outside of the combat phase.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the target player has no land cards in their library, all cards from that library will be revealed and put into their graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If Rest in Peace is destroyed by a spell, Rest in Peace will be exiled and then the spell will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a card is discarded while Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that function when a card is discarded (such as madness) still work, even though that card never reaches a graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of a discarded card (such as Chandra Ablaze\'s first ability) can find that card in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "While Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that trigger whenever a creature dies won\'t trigger because cards and tokens are never put into a player\'s graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to draw multiple cards, Niv-Mizzet\'s ability triggers that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If dealing 1 damage to a permanent or player causes you to draw a card, perhaps because Niv-Mizzet is enchanted by Curiosity, you\'ll continue this loop until the loop is interrupted, perhaps by a player losing the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If a card in your library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can find any number of creature cards, so long as their total mana value is 6 or less. For example, you could find eight creature cards with mana value 0 and three with mana value 2, but you couldn\'t find two with mana value 4."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Guttersnipe\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Guttersnipe\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have no other cards in hand, you’ll have to discard one of the creature cards you return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You may cast Macabre Waltz targeting one or zero creature cards. You’ll still discard a card, even if you target no creature cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "A spell cast using jump-start will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If a card with jump-start is put into your graveyard during your turn, you\'ll be able to cast it right away if it\'s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to pay an alternative cost rather than a spell\'s mana cost, you may pay that alternative cost when you jump-start a spell. You\'ll still discard a card as an additional cost to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions when casting a spell with jump-start, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using jump-start only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Any effects that applied to Lazav before it becomes a copy of another card will continue to apply once it\'s become a copy. The same is true of any counters that are on Lazav."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'Because Lazav isn\\\'t entering the battlefield when it becomes a copy of a card, any "When this enters the battlefield" or "This enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied card won\\\'t apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If the copied card has an ability that can be activated only once each turn, copying that card a second time will allow you to activate the new instance of that ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lazav copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "As Plaguecrafter\'s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature or planeswalker they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen permanents are sacrificed at the same time. Next, each player in the same order who couldn\'t sacrifice a permanent chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then the chosen cards are discarded at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Each player chooses a permanent to sacrifice from among the creatures and planeswalkers they control. You don\'t choose which type of permanent any other player has to sacrifice."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Plaguecrafter can be the creature its controller sacrifices for its own ability. Don\'t be like Plaguecrafter; always wear personal protective equipment when performing dangerous work."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If Midnight Reaper dies at the same time as one or more other nontoken creatures you control, Midnight Reaper\'s ability triggers for each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Midnight Reaper\'s ability triggers when it dies if it\'s not a token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If you cast Resurgence when it\'s not a main phase (perhaps with Omnispell Adept\'s ability), creatures you control gain first strike and vigilance, but there\'s no additional combat phase or main phase. If you cast it during an opponent\'s main phase, there are additional combat and main phases, but that player attacks during that combat phase, not you."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Resurgence affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures that come under your control later in the turn won\'t gain first strike and vigilance."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "A split card\'s characteristics are a combination of its two halves while it is not on the stack. For example, Assault // Battery has a mana value of 5 while it is in your library. If an effect allows you to search your library for a card with mana value 4 or less, you can\'t find Assault // Battery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one of those names, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard a split card, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of sorcery cards in your graveyard, Assault // Battery counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell with certain characteristics, consider only the characteristics of the half you\'re casting. For example, if an effect allows you to cast a sorcery spell with mana value 2 or less from among cards in your graveyard, you could cast Assault this way, but not Battery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that\'s half of a split card, the copy copies that same half. For example, if you copy Assault, the copy is also Assault, not Battery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Split cards have two card faces on a single card. The characteristics of the half you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "To cast a split card, choose one of its halves to cast. There\'s no way to cast both halves of this split card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Murmuring Mystic\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'A spell cast using jump-start will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “As [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[This creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a card with jump-start is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to pay an alternative cost rather than a spell’s mana cost, you may pay that alternative cost when you jump-start a spell. You’ll still discard a card as an additional cost to cast it.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the copied creature is copying something else, the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the copied creature is itself a token, the token created by Quasiduplicate copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what is printed on the creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using jump-start only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'A spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for Sinister Sabotage. The spell won’t be countered when Sinister Sabotage resolves, but you’ll still surveil 1.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Some spells that instruct you to surveil require targets. You can’t cast a spell without choosing legal targets. If all of those targets become illegal, the spell doesn’t resolve and you won’t surveil.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you’ll surveil last. For others, you’ll surveil and then perform other actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Although Wojek Bodyguard can’t attack alone, other attacking creatures don’t have to attack the same player or planeswalker. For example, Wojek Bodyguard could attack an opponent and another creature could attack a planeswalker that opponent controls. Similarly, other blocking creatures don’t have to block the same creature that Wojek Bodyguard blocks.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If an effect says that Wojek Bodyguard attacks or blocks if able and you control another creature able to attack or block, you must attack or block with Wojek Bodyguard and another creature.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the target creature’s power is no longer less than the attacking creature’s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn’t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you control more than one Wojek Bodyguard, they can attack or block together, even if no other creatures attack or block.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Wojek Bodyguard can attack or block with a creature controlled by your teammate, even if no other creatures you control are attacking or blocking.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature’s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Once Wojek Bodyguard has attacked or blocked, it will remain in combat even if you no longer control another attacking or blocking creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Aurelia’s last ability resolves before attackers are chosen.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the target creature’s power is no longer less than the attacking creature’s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn’t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature’s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Once Aurelia’s last ability has resolved, the creature keeps whatever bonuses it got from that ability even if its colors change.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The target creature gains trample and vigilance if it’s both red and white. It gets +2/+0 only once, even if it’s both red and white, and even if it’s neither red nor white.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Worldsoul Colossus (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{W}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{W}. If you tap two green creatures and two white creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You can tap an untapped creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn to convoke a spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because the beginning of combat step is before attackers are declared, you can attack with Arclight Phoenix during the same combat it returns to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Connive’s effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn’t expire if the creature’s power becomes greater after Connive has resolved.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'No player may take actions between the time you surveil and the time you return a creature card to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The creature card you return with Concoct may be one that you just surveilled into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you’ll surveil last. For others, you’ll surveil and then perform other actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Creatures that are going to die after getting -1/-1 will still be on the battlefield while you surveil. They won’t be put into their owners’ graveyards until after Mephitic Vapors is entirely finished resolving. If any of their abilities trigger on surveilling, those abilities will trigger but won’t resolve until after the creatures have left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Mephitic Vapors affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won’t get -1/-1.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you’ll surveil last. For others, you’ll surveil and then perform other actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Expansion can copy any instant or sorcery spell with an appropriate converted mana cost, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the converted mana cost of that spell.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If one of Explosion’s two targets becomes illegal, the other is affected as appropriate.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast, the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can). The same is true of spells that distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Banefire does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you copy a spell, you control the copy. It will resolve before the original spell does.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Finality affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won’t get -4/-4.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Finality doesn’t target the creature to receive +1/+1 counters. You can cast it even if you control no creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If Tajic and other creatures you control would be dealt lethal noncombat damage at the same time, the damage that would be dealt to your other creatures is prevented.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the target creature’s power is no longer less than the attacking creature’s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn’t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature’s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," Niv-Mizzet\\\'s first triggered ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, Niv-Mizzet\'s first triggered ability triggers that many times. You choose targets for those abilities after you\'ve drawn all of the cards."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Niv-Mizzet\'s second triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered. This causes its first triggered ability to trigger, and that also resolves before the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Players can cast spells and activate abilities after Niv-Mizzet\'s second triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does. Notably, the card you draw may be able to counter that spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If an effect changes under whose control a token would be created, that effect applies before Divine Visitation’s effect applies. If an effect changes under whose control a token would enter the battlefield, that effect applies after Divine Visitation’s effect is able to be applied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If you create a noncreature token that will be a creature as it enters the battlefield, perhaps because of an effect such as that of March of the Machines, Divine Visitation’s effect doesn’t apply to that token’s creation. (This is because Divine Visitation’s effect modifies how the tokens are created, and March of the Machines’s effect doesn\'t apply until you consider how the tokens are entering the battlefield.)"}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'The token’s characteristics are entirely replaced by a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying and vigilance. It doesn’t have any abilities the token would have been created with. Anything else specified in the effect creating the token (such as tapped, attacking, “That token gains haste,” or “Exile that token at end of combat”) still applies.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts this land onto the battlefield tapped, you may pay 2 life, but it still enters tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Unlike most dual lands, this land has two basic land types. It\'s not basic, so cards such as District Guide can\'t find it, but it does have the appropriate land types for effects such as that of Drowned Catacomb (from the Ixalan set)."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If any exiled cards you own are face down, they have no characteristics. If they’re normally instants or sorceries, they won’t be counted.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The ability that defines Crackling Drake’s power works in all zones.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is no longer less than the attacking creature\'s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn\'t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If the token can\'t attack for any reason (such as becoming tapped), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature\'s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the target creature’s power is no longer less than the attacking creature’s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn’t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Truefire Captain is dealt damage, you lose the game before its triggered ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature’s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Truefire Captain’s last ability will trigger even if it is dealt lethal damage. For example, if it’s dealt damage by a 7/7 creature it’s blocking, its ability will trigger and Truefire Captain will deal 7 damage to the target player.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If the target creature’s power is no longer less than the attacking creature’s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn’t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature’s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Creeping Chill causes the opposing team to lose 6 life and you gain 3 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The land card you put on top of your library may be one that you just put into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you’ll surveil last. For others, you’ll surveil and then perform other actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'A land\\\'s copiable values are those printed on it, as modified by other copy effects. Counters and other effects aren\\\'t copied. Notably, if you copy a land that is also a creature because of a temporary effect (such as Celestial Colonnade), Thespian\\\'s Stage will become just the "unanimated" land.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'No enters-the-battlefield abilities of the land Thespian\\\'s Stage is copying will trigger. Thespian\\\'s Stage was already on the battlefield. Similarly, no "as this land enters the battlefield" or "this land enters the battlefield with" effects, such as that of Dark Depths, will apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "The copy effect created by the last activated ability doesn\'t have a duration. It will last until Thespian\'s Stage leaves the battlefield or another copy effect overwrites it. The permanent will no longer have the first ability of Thespian\'s Stage."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Thespian\'s Stage doesn\'t become untapped when it becomes a copy, even if the target land is untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "A card\'s spectacle cost is the same no matter how much life your opponents lost or how many opponents lost life."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play a card exiled this way, it remains in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if an opponent loses life and later that turn leaves the game, you can cast a spell for its spectacle cost. (If a player leaves the game during their turn, that turn continues without an active player.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Light Up the Stage doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Spectacle doesn\'t change when you can cast the card. For example, you can\'t cast a sorcery with spectacle during an opponent\'s turn unless another effect allows you to do so, even if that player has lost life this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as a spectacle cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "A face-down creature has no name, so it can\'t share a name with anything. This includes other creatures with no name."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If the entering creature is put into your graveyard while Guardian Project\'s ability is on the stack, that same card will be a creature card in your graveyard that shares a name with the creature that was on the battlefield, so you won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If the entering creature leaves the battlefield and returns while Guardian Project\'s ability is on the stack, that same card will be a new creature you control that shares a name with the creature that was on the battlefield, so you won\'t draw a card. However, Guardian Project\'s ability may trigger for the new creature and you may draw a card as that ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Whether the entering creature shares a name with a creature you control or a creature card in your graveyard is checked both as that creature enters and as Guardian Project\'s ability resolves. If the entering creature isn\'t the first of its name as it enters, the ability doesn\'t trigger at all; if its name is shared as the ability resolves, you don\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "A noncreature card that happens to be entering the battlefield as a creature will have riot (for example, Rusted Relic while you control three other artifacts). Similarly, a creature card entering the battlefield as a noncreature permanent won\'t have riot (for example, Thassa, God of the Sea while your other permanents contribute only four to your devotion to blue)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target a creature spell you control. When that spell or ability resolves, the creature spell won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If a creature entering the battlefield has riot but can\'t have a +1/+1 counter put onto it, it gains haste."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield with two instances of riot, you may choose to have it get two +1/+1 counters, one +1/+1 counter and haste, or two instances of haste. Multiple instances of haste on the same creature are redundant, but we\'re not going to tell the Gruul how to live their lives."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If a nontoken, noncreature permanent becomes a creature after it\'s already on the battlefield, it will have riot but it will be too late for the replacement effect to have any effect."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If you choose for the creature to gain haste, it gains haste indefinitely. It won\'t lose it as the turn ends or as another player gains control of it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with riot has entered the battlefield, it keeps its +1/+1 counter or haste even if it loses riot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Riot is a replacement effect. Players can\'t respond to your choice of +1/+1 counter or haste, and they can\'t take actions while the creature is on the battlefield without one or the other."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If Rhythm of the Wild leaves the battlefield at the same time that a nontoken creature enters the battlefield (most likely because that creature has a replacement effect, such as that of Rescuer Sphinx), that creature still gets a +1/+1 counter or haste.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Addendum abilities of instant spells apply while the spell is resolving, not immediately after casting it. If the spell is countered, you don\'t get the addendum bonus. For example, if you cast Sphinx\'s Insight during your main phase, you gain 2 life during its resolution, after you draw two cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If a spell with an addendum ability is copied, the copy won\'t give you the addendum bonus. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Unbreakable Formation affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain indestructible or vigilance and they won\'t get a +1/+1 counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t cause this creature to become unblocked."}]', "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'A card’s spectacle cost is the same no matter how much life your opponents lost or how many opponents lost life.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if an opponent loses life and later that turn leaves the game, you can cast a spell for its spectacle cost. (If a player leaves the game during their turn, that turn continues without an active player.)'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Spectacle doesn’t change when you can cast the card. For example, you can’t cast a sorcery with spectacle during an opponent’s turn unless another effect allows you to do so, even if that player has lost life this turn.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as a spectacle cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'A card’s spectacle cost is the same no matter how much life your opponents lost or how many opponents lost life.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if an opponent loses life and later that turn leaves the game, you can cast a spell for its spectacle cost. (If a player leaves the game during their turn, that turn continues without an active player.)'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Spectacle doesn’t change when you can cast the card. For example, you can’t cast a sorcery with spectacle during an opponent’s turn unless another effect allows you to do so, even if that player has lost life this turn.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as a spectacle cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'A creature attacks alone if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step (including creatures controlled by your teammates, if applicable). For example, Angelic Exaltation’s ability won’t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Angelic Exaltation’s ability begins to resolve. It won’t change later in the turn if the number of creatures you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Abilities that create replacement effects, such as a permanent entering the battlefield tapped or with counters on it, can’t be targeted. Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” are also replacement effects and can’t be targeted.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Activated abilities are written in the form “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as equip, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'An activated mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool as it resolves, doesn’t have a target, and isn’t a loyalty ability. A triggered mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool and triggers on an activated mana ability.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If the copied creature is a token, the token that’s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is a Mirror Image), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If you counter a delayed triggered ability that triggered at the beginning of the “next” occurrence of a specified step or phase, that ability won’t trigger again the following time that phase or step occurs.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as afterlife, are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at” in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Activating Tin Street Dodger’s ability after it has become blocked by a creature without defender won’t cause it to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Addendum abilities of instant spells apply while the spell is resolving, not immediately after casting it. If the spell is countered, you don’t get the addendum bonus. For example, if you cast Sphinx’s Insight during your main phase, you gain 2 life during its resolution, after you draw two cards.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If a spell with an addendum ability is copied, the copy won’t give you the addendum bonus. This is because the copy wasn’t cast at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Advisors that you haven’t controlled continuously since your turn began may be tapped to pay for the second ability of Persistent Petitioners.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'It’s not possible to tap one Persistent Petitioners to activate both its first and second ability, or to activate its second ability and that of another Persistent Petitioners. This means that if you tap four Persistent Petitioners, the target player loses the top twelve cards of their library, not the top forty-eight.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'The last ability of Persistent Petitioners lets you ignore the “four-of” rule. It doesn’t let you ignore format legality. For example, during a Ravnica Allegiance Limited event, you can’t add Persistent Petitioners from your personal collection, no matter how much they ask.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when counters are put on a permanent will trigger if that permanent somehow enters the battlefield with those counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'If a creature somehow loses all of its +1/+1 counters, it can adapt again and get more +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Sharktocrab\'s triggered ability can target a creature that\'s already tapped. That creature won\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "You can always activate an ability that will cause a creature to adapt. As that ability resolves, if the creature has a +1/+1 counter on it for any reason, you simply won\'t put any +1/+1 counters on it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker or put onto the battlefield attacking during this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat. Similarly, a “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker or put onto the battlefield blocking during this combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'As Eyes Everywhere’s last ability resolves, Eyes Everywhere must be on the battlefield and the target nonland permanent must be a legal target. If either of these things isn’t true, the ability does nothing.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the effect giving you control of the target nonland permanent ends.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'The effect of Eyes Everywhere’s last ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn’t expire if Eyes Everywhere leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Because blockers are chosen all at once, you can’t block with a creature with afterlife, wait for it to die, then block with the resulting Spirit tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Because it may have targets, the ability of Priest of Forgotten Gods isn’t a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to, even if no targets were chosen.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'You can activate the ability of Priest of Forgotten Gods without choosing any targets if you wish. You’ll still add {B}{B} and draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'You may target players who can’t sacrifice a creature. Those players still lose 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Cindervines can be the target of its own activated ability. The ability won’t resolve since it won’t have a legal target, and no player will be dealt damage, but this does allow you to sacrifice Cindervines without another enchantment to target if you want to.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Cindervines’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Cindervines’s activated ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. No player is dealt damage. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller is dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If Sunder Shaman gains menace, it can’t be blocked at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If Vindictive Vampire dies at the same time as one or more other creatures you control, Vindictive Vampire’s ability triggers for each of those other creatures.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that creatures you control are dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before Vindictive Vampire’s triggered ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Vindictive Vampire’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'To double a player’s life total, that player gains as much life as needed so that their life total is twice the number it was before. If their life total was negative, that player loses as much life as needed so that their life total is twice as far below 0 as it was before. Other effects interact with this life gain or loss accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If a creature entering the battlefield has riot but can’t have a +1/+1 counter put onto it, it gains haste.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If you choose for the creature to gain haste, it gains haste indefinitely. It won’t lose it as the turn ends or as another player gains control of it.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Riot is a replacement effect. Players can’t respond to your choice of +1/+1 counter or haste, and they can’t take actions while the creature is on the battlefield without one or the other.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'If a creature somehow loses all of its +1/+1 counters, it can adapt again and get more +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Pteramander\'s activated ability can\'t reduce itself to less than {U} to activate."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "You can always activate an ability that will cause a creature to adapt. As that ability resolves, if the creature has a +1/+1 counter on it for any reason, you simply won\'t put any +1/+1 counters on it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Kaya’s last ability causes you to gain life equal to the number of cards the target player owns in exile, even if an effect causes her to deal more or less than that amount of damage to that player.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Tokens that aren’t a copy of something else don’t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a converted mana cost of 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Thrash tries to resolve, the creature you control won’t deal damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Titanic Brawl resolves, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If you can’t target any opponent with Rakdos Firewheeler’s ability, the ability doesn’t go on the stack. You can’t have it deal 2 damage to any creature or planeswalker. On the other hand, if you do choose legal targets but either target is illegal when the ability tries to resolve, the other is still affected as appropriate.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ill-Gotten Inheritance’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater is checked only after your opponent has sacrificed a creature. If a creature you own with power 4 or greater was exiled until the sacrificed creature left the battlefield, that creature will return to the battlefield before the check, so it will count. However, any abilities that trigger on the sacrificed creature’s death won’t have resolved yet when you check what creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'You can still gain 4 life even if the target opponent can’t sacrifice a creature.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'You gain only 4 life, even if you control more than one creature with power 4 or greater.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'You can’t cast Bedazzle without a target nonbasic land and a target opponent or planeswalker. If one of the targets is illegal when Bedazzle tries to resolve, the other is still affected as appropriate.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "A creature with 0 toughness doesn\'t die immediately. Rather, the creature dies the next time a player would receive priority. This means that any creatures whose toughness becomes 0 as Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield ability resolves will remain on the battlefield until just after the delayed triggered ability has been created."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Creatures that die while Massacre Girl\'s triggered ability is still on the stack won\'t cause its delayed triggered ability to trigger since that delayed triggered ability hasn\'t been created yet."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If more than one creature dies at once, Massacre Girl\'s delayed triggered ability triggers that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield triggered ability and its delayed triggered ability each affect only creatures on the battlefield at the time that those abilities resolve. Creatures that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn won\'t get -1/-1 unless the delayed triggered ability triggers and resolves again later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Once Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter whether Massacre Girl remains on the battlefield. The delayed triggered ability will be created as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. "}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Makeshift Battalion and the other attacking creatures don\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Once Makeshift Battalion\'s ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter how many creatures are still attacking when that ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A legendary permanent that is put into a graveyard because of the “legend rule” isn’t sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent is sacrificed to pay a cost of a spell or ability, Mayhem Devil’s ability will resolve before that spell or ability. Conversely, if a permanent is sacrificed during the resolution of a spell or ability, that spell or ability will finish resolving before Mayhem Devil’s ability is put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you sacrifice Mayhem Devil, its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Mayhem Devil itself doesn’t allow any player to sacrifice any permanents. Its ability triggers whenever a player sacrifices a permanent because some other spell, ability, or cost instructed the player to do so.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You control Mayhem Devil’s triggered ability and choose the target, no matter who sacrificed the permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text, such as equip. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected by Karn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a casual game, a card you choose from outside the game comes from your personal collection. In a tournament event, a card you choose from outside the game must come from your sideboard. You may look at your sideboard at any time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Karn’s first ability affects only artifacts on the battlefield. Activated abilities that work in other zones can still be activated.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Karn’s last ability can’t get a face-down card in exile, even if you know it’s an artifact card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'A “color pair” is exactly two colors. There are ten color pairs in Magic: white-blue, white-black, blue-black, blue-red, black-red, black-green, red-green, red-white, green-white, and green-blue.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the top ten cards of your library don\'t contain all ten color pairs, you choose as many cards as you can and put those cards into your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'After you draw a card as Nicol Bolas’s first loyalty ability resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s somehow an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a permanent they control or chooses a card in hand without revealing that card. Then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Finally, all of the chosen cards are exiled simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a loyalty ability of a planeswalker references the card it’s printed on by name, treat Nicol Bolas’s instance of that ability as though it referenced Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God by name instead. For instance, if Nahiri, Storm of Stone is on the battlefield, Nicol Bolas deals the damage if you activate the ability he gained from her.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an ability of a planeswalker exiles cards and another loyalty ability of that planeswalker references the exiled cards, those abilities are linked. If Nicol Bolas gains both abilities, the instances he has are similarly linked. Cards exiled by any other abilities Nicol Bolas has (such as his own first loyalty ability) won’t be seen by those linked abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If any abilities trigger as you draw a card while resolving Nicol Bolas’s first loyalty ability, those abilities don’t resolve until after your opponents have exiled a card or permanent.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, if one player on a team loses the game, the entire team loses the game, even if the other player controls a legendary creature or planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Nicol Bolas doesn’t gain any static or triggered abilities of other planeswalkers or any activated abilities they may have that aren’t loyalty abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Nicol Bolas doesn’t remove loyalty abilities from the other planeswalkers.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'While Nicol Bolas may end up with an astonishing number of loyalty abilities, you can still activate only one loyalty ability of Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God each turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Although the new creature is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example, such as those of Trusted Pegasus and Makeshift Battalion).'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect exiles the God and immediately returns it to the battlefield, its last ability triggers but will have no effect. However, if an effect exiles it and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, the God’s ability may return that card its owner’s library first. If it does, the effect that exiled it won’t return it later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods leaves the graveyard or exile while its last ability is on the stack, it will remain in its new zone, even if that zone is a graveyard or exile.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods would die and it’s your commander in the Commander variant, you may put it into the command zone instead. If you save your commander this way, it doesn’t die and you won’t put it into your library. The same is true if it would be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the God’s owner has two or fewer cards in their library, the God is put on the bottom of their library as its last ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the new creature has an ability that triggers at the beginning of the end step, that ability will trigger and resolve even if the creature is returned to your hand during the end step before that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the new creature leaves the battlefield before the end step, most likely because it died in combat, that card remains in its current zone. It won’t return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you control another player’s God when it dies, you decide whether to put that card into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you put another player’s God onto the battlefield under your control, it will be exiled as you leave the game. If you were still the controller of that God, you would control its triggered ability but you have left the game; that ability won’t resolve and the card remains in exile. Similarly, if you lose the game at the same time that another player’s God that you put onto the battlefield is destroyed, it remains in its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose which player or planeswalker the new creature is attacking. It doesn’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Ilharg is attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Any counters that are put on Gideon remain on him while he’s not a creature, even if they have no effect on a noncreature planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an Equipment becomes attached to Gideon while he’s a creature, it’ll become unattached during the next upkeep that isn’t yours. The same is true of any Auras that become attached to Gideon that can’t enchant a noncreature planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect causes Gideon to lose all abilities during your turn, he’s still a Human Soldier creature and a Gideon planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon during your turn, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he has indestructible, if Gideon has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose which ability the target creature gains as Gideon’s first loyalty ability resolves, not as you activate it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when Spark Double enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Spark Double somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another permanent, it can’t become a copy of that permanent. You may choose only a creature or planeswalker that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If it copies a planeswalker, Spark Double enters with the appropriate number of loyalty counters as printed on the card plus one. If it copies a creature, Spark Double enters with a +1/+1 counter on it, plus any counters that will be put on it from abilities it copied and other abilities of other objects.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is a token, Spark Double copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Spark Double doesn’t become a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is copying something else (for example, if the chosen permanent is another Spark Double), then Spark Double enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen permanent copied.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is affected by a type-changing effect, Spark Double may enter the battlefield with different permanent types than the copied permanent currently has. Use the characteristics of Spark Double as it enters the battlefield, not of the copied permanent, to determine whether it enters with an additional counter on it. Notably, if Spark Double copies a Gideon planeswalker that’s a creature because its loyalty ability caused it to become a planeswalker creature, Spark Double enters as a noncreature planeswalker and doesn’t get a +1/+1 counter. On the other hand, if Spark Double copies Gideon Blackblade during your turn, Spark Double enters as a planeswalker creature and gets both kinds of counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spark Double copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spark Double isn’t legendary if it copies a legendary permanent, and this exception is copiable. If something else copies Spark Double later, that copy also won’t be legendary. If you control two or more permanents with the same name but only one is legendary, the “legend rule” doesn’t apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Arboreal Grazer’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you’ve already played your land for the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'As Liliana’s last ability resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s somehow an opponent’s turn, that opponent) makes all of their choices for it, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the unchosen permanents are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'As Liliana’s second loyalty ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses two creatures they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time. If any player can choose only one creature, that player does so.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Liliana dies at the same time as one or more creatures you control, her first ability triggers for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Liliana somehow becomes a creature and dies, her first ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The permanent types are artifact, creature, enchantment, land, and planeswalker. Supertypes, like legendary, aren’t permanent types.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'While making choices for Liliana’s last ability, if a permanent has more than one permanent type, it can count for any of them. For example, you could choose an artifact creature as the artifact you’re sparing, another creature as the creature, and an enchantment creature as the enchantment. Similarly, you could choose an enchantment creature as both the creature and the enchantment that you’re sparing, even if you control another creature and/or another enchantment.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Burning Prophet’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Bleeding Edge, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Kasmina’s Transmutation becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Kasmina’s Transmutation overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Kasmina’s Transmutation becomes attached to a creature will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Rising Populace and another creature you control die simultaneously (perhaps because they were both dealt lethal damage in combat), Rising Populace won’t be on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves. It can’t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on it.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a planeswalker that’s also a creature dies, Rising Populace’s ability triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect allows opponents to cast spells any time they could cast an instant (for example, if your opponent also controls a Teferi, Time Raveler and activates his +1 loyalty ability), the restriction of Teferi’s first ability takes precedence over that permission.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may activate Teferi’s last ability without choosing any target. You’ll just draw a card. However, if you do choose a target and the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Teferi’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of the two target creatures you control is an illegal target as Band Together resolves, the other will still deal damage equal to its power.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the last target creature is an illegal target as Band Together resolves, or if both of the first targets are illegal targets, no creature deals or is dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Players can’t normally play a land card from a graveyard. If a player finds a way to do so, Tomik’s last ability takes precedence over that permission.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tomik’s middle ability is similar to hexproof, but effects that interact with hexproof don’t count these lands or land cards as having hexproof.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If Loaming Shaman’s triggered ability targets a player but doesn’t target any cards in that player’s graveyard, that player just shuffles their library.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target cards become illegal targets, the target player shuffles their library. If the target player becomes an illegal target, Loaming Shaman’s ability has no effect.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Fungal Rebirth checks only whether a creature died this turn. It doesn\'t give you additional Saprolings if more than one creature died."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a creature died this turn, you get Saproling tokens in addition to the permanent card being returned to your hand.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Because Bruvac is legendary, it’s unlikely that one player will control two. However, if that happens, each opponent mills four times as many cards as originally instructed. If they control three, their opponents mill eight times as many, and so on.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If a player is instructed to put a card into their graveyard without using the word “mill,” Bruvac’s ability doesn’t apply.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Many cards printed before the Core Set 2021 release have received errata to instruct a player to mill cards rather than to put the top cards of their library into their graveyard. Use the Oracle™ card reference at Gatherer.Wizards.com to determine whether a specific card has received such errata. As a rule of thumb, if an effect instructs a player to look at or reveal a card before it’s put into its owner’s graveyard, it’s unlikely to have received errata.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of Cyclonic Rift, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Chord of Calling (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{G}{G}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{G}{G}. If you tap two green creatures and two red creatures, you\'ll have to pay {1}{G}."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If you choose the last mode, you draw two cards and discard two cards all while Izzet Charm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Bladebrand tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Loyalty abilities of planeswalkers are activated abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Faith\'s Fetters doesn\'t stop static abilities, triggered abilities, or mana abilities from working. A mana ability is an ability that produces mana, not an ability that costs mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Faith\'s Fetters tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an opponent lost life and subsequently lost the game, Rakdos\'s first ability is satisfied, and its last ability counts that loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If there are additional costs to cast a creature spell, such as a kicker cost or the commander tax, apply those increases before applying cost reductions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Rakdos can be put onto the battlefield by another spell or ability even if no opponent has lost life that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Rakdos\'s last ability can\'t reduce the colored mana requirement of a creature spell you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Rakdos\'s last ability cares about the total life lost, not necessarily what an opponent\'s life total is compared to what it was at the beginning of the turn. For example, if an opponent loses 5 life and then gains 10 life in a turn, creature spells you cast will cost {5} less to cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Rakdos\'s last ability won\'t reduce the cost to cast Rakdos itself. It applies only to creature spells you cast once Rakdos is on the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Effects that modify or replace the cost to cast a spell (such as flashback or casting a spell without paying its mana cost due to suspend) don’t affect the spell’s mana value, so they won’t change whether Lavinia’s first ability restricts that spell from being cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an effect allows a player to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, that player can’t choose to cast it and pay its mana cost unless another rule or effect allows that player to cast it that way. However, if that spell also has additional costs that require mana, paying that mana will stop Lavinia’s last ability from triggering.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may cast spells that they know Lavinia will counter. Any abilities that trigger when spells are cast will trigger and resolve if appropriate, and any effects that count spells cast will count those spells if appropriate.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Farseek can find any land with any of the listed land types, including nonbasic ones, even if that land is a Forest in addition to one or more of those types.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Fblthp’s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Fblthp’s last ability triggers only if it’s on the battlefield when it becomes the target of a spell.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an effect exiles Fblthp from your library and then lets you cast that card, it’s cast from exile, not from your library.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the spell that targets Fblthp has no other targets, it won’t resolve (because it no longer has a legal target after Fblthp has gotten totally lost in your library).'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'There’s normally no way to cast Fblthp from your library or to have it enter the battlefield from your library. You’ll have to use other effects to find Fblthp for the bonus card draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Repeal tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you target a card that was cast with flashback with Remand, the card will still be exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Remand can target a spell that can’t be countered. That spell won’t be countered or returned to its owner’s hand, but you’ll draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You decide on resolution if you are tapping or untapping, and which kind of permanent you are affecting.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Any choices made as a spell resolves won\'t have been made yet once it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately as the copy resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the mana value of that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was cast, the division can\'t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can). The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you copy a spell, you control the copy. It will resolve before the original spell does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Izzet Guildmage\'s abilities can copy any instant or sorcery spell with an appropriate mana value, not just one with targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "The controller of a copy can\'t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'The copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "As the replicate triggered ability resolves, you\'ll copy Shattering Spree for each time you paid its replicate cost, even if the original spell is no longer on the stack at that time (perhaps because it was countered)."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'The copies that replicate creates are created on the stack, so they\\\'re not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If Assemble the Legion isn\'t on the battlefield when its ability resolves, use the number of muster counters it had when it was last on the battlefield to determine how many Soldier tokens to create."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If the spell or ability that targets Petrahydrox has no other targets, it won\'t resolve (because it no longer has a legal target after Petrahydrox has returned to its owner\'s hand)."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Petrahydrox\'s ability resolves before the spell or ability that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell or ability is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Petrahydrox\'s ability triggers only if it\'s on the battlefield when it becomes the target of a spell or ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice Teysa itself to help pay for its first ability, but Teysa dying won\'t cause its second ability to trigger. Any other white and black creatures you sacrifice to pay for the first ability will cause the second ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2024-01-12', 'text': 'If equipped creature becomes tapped, untapped creatures you control will immediately lose the +0/+2 bonus. This may cause nonlethal damage already dealt to them that turn to become lethal. The Paruns would want you to be careful.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Mizzix\' Meisterstück", \'text\': "Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl, die ein Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei ist, aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte. Du kannst die Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Schicke Mizzix\' Meisterstück ins Exil.\\nÜberlast {5}{R}{R}{R}", \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3844575b-67a0-4a5e-9630-17f11394f9eb\', \'multiverseId\': 645550}, \'multiverseid\': 645550}, {\'name\': \'Poder de Mízzix\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta objetivo que sea un instantáneo o conjuro de tu cementerio. Por cada carta exiliada de esta manera, cópiala. Puedes lanzar la copia sin pagar su coste de maná. Exilia el Poder de Mízzix.\\nSobrecarga {5}{R}{R}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82115aaf-aa80-4134-a52d-371daf5ad3d2\', \'multiverseId\': 645664}, \'multiverseid\': 645664}, {\'name\': \'Maîtrise de Mizzix\', \'text\': "Exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière, copiez-la, et vous pouvez lancer la copie sans payer son coût de mana. Exilez la Maîtrise de Mizzix.\\nSurcharge {5}{R}{R}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0bb6cf4-1b8a-49fd-b03a-d28b5efde986\', \'multiverseId\': 645778}, \'multiverseid\': 645778}, {\'name\': \'Talento di Mizzix\', \'text\': \'Esilia una carta bersaglio che è un istantaneo o una stregoneria dal tuo cimitero. Per ogni carta esiliata in questo modo, copiala e puoi lanciare la copia senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Esilia il Talento di Mizzix.\\nSovraccarico {5}{R}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6abe74-134a-40f8-a411-e6e5fe1a4de8\', \'multiverseId\': 645892}, \'multiverseid\': 645892}, {\'name\': \'ミジックスの熟達\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。これにより追放されたカードをコピーする。そのコピーをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。ミジックスの熟達を追放する。\\n超過{5}{R}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d69d28-165b-4077-85c1-b30985227361\', \'multiverseId\': 646006}, \'multiverseid\': 646006}, {\'name\': \'Maestria de Mizzix\', \'text\': \'Exile o card alvo de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço de seu cemitério. Para cada card exilado desta forma, copie-o. Você pode conjurar a cópia sem pagar seu custo de mana. Exile Maestria de Mizzix.\\nSobrecarga {5}{R}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d606811-e120-4351-a880-70e59804fce6\', \'multiverseId\': 646120}, \'multiverseid\': 646120}, {\'name\': \'米捷兹的精研\', \'text\': \'将目标在你坟墓场中且为瞬间或法术的牌放逐。对每张以此法放逐的牌而言，将其复制，你可以施放该复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。放逐米捷兹的精研。\\n超载{5}{R}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab843e81-3500-46c2-897e-0054843b7b75\', \'multiverseId\': 646234}, \'multiverseid\': 646234}]', '[{\'name\': "Mizzix\' Meisterstück", \'text\': \'Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl, die ein Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei ist, aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte. Du kannst die Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Schicke Mizzix\\\' Meisterstück ins Exil.\\nÜberlast {5}{R}{R}{R} (Du kannst diesen Zauber für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, ersetze im Text „eine … deiner Wahl" durch „jede …")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e98a0ea1-2d49-4f00-8fe7-b18278d94a78\', \'multiverseId\': 643416}, \'multiverseid\': 643416}, {\'name\': \'Poder de Mízzix\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta objetivo que sea un instantáneo o conjuro de tu cementerio. Por cada carta exiliada de esta manera, cópiala. Puedes lanzar la copia sin pagar su coste de maná. Exilia el Poder de Mízzix.\\nSobrecarga {5}{R}{R}{R}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de sobrecarga. Si lo haces, cambia "la carta objetivo" en su texto por "cada carta".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963d6990-159a-4c53-89d1-abbf34b7b488\', \'multiverseId\': 643707}, \'multiverseid\': 643707}, {\'name\': \'Maîtrise de Mizzix\', \'text\': "Exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière, copiez-la, et vous pouvez lancer la copie sans payer son coût de mana. Exilez la Maîtrise de Mizzix.\\nSurcharge {5}{R}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, remplacez « ciblé(e) » par « chaque » dans son texte.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643998&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ded1ba-2512-440c-88d0-fff948c730de\', \'multiverseId\': 643998}, \'multiverseid\': 643998}, {\'name\': \'Talento di Mizzix\', \'text\': \'Esilia una carta bersaglio che è un istantaneo o una stregoneria dal tuo cimitero. Per ogni carta esiliata in questo modo, copiala e puoi lanciare la copia senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Esilia il Talento di Mizzix.\\nSovraccarico {5}{R}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di sovraccarico. Se lo fai, cambiane il testo sostituendo "una carta bersaglio" con "ogni carta".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aaa852b-18c3-47cf-9206-5a01c0fbd055\', \'multiverseId\': 644289}, \'multiverseid\': 644289}, {\'name\': \'ミジックスの熟達\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。これにより追放されたカードをコピーする。そのコピーをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。ミジックスの熟達を追放する。\\n超過{5}{R}{R}{R}（あなたはこの呪文を超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、対象は取らず、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるすべてのカードを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'188655a0-bd31-4b99-8bb4-8ca38c58c64e\', \'multiverseId\': 644580}, \'multiverseid\': 644580}, {\'name\': \'Maestria de Mizzix\', \'text\': \'Exile o card alvo de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço de seu cemitério. Para cada card exilado desta forma, copie-o. Você pode conjurar a cópia sem pagar seu custo de mana. Exile Maestria de Mizzix.\\nSobrecarga {5}{R}{R}{R} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de sobrecarga. Se fizer isso, substitua "o card alvo" em seu texto por "cada card".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edbc5e5f-d3ea-4cd9-8dd8-617d89858124\', \'multiverseId\': 644871}, \'multiverseid\': 644871}, {\'name\': \'米捷兹的精研\', \'text\': \'将目标在你坟墓场中且为瞬间或法术的牌放逐。对每张以此法放逐的牌而言，将其复制，你可以施放该复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。放逐米捷兹的精研。\\n超载{5}{R}{R}{R}（你可以支付此咒语的超载费用来施放它。若你如此作，则将其叙述中的「目标」更改为「每张」。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ab5cc67-e589-4a63-a6aa-8871562f4c10\', \'multiverseId\': 645162}, \'multiverseid\': 645162}]', "[{'name': 'Abfallstöberer', 'text': 'Verteidiger\\n{T}: Lege eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': 'Für den einen ist es Unrat, für den anderen der größte Schatzhaufen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643560&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddf8f017-0df2-44a8-81f2-3cdc164930d9', 'multiverseId': 643560}, 'multiverseid': 643560}, {'name': 'Cargabasura', 'text': 'Defensor.\\n{T}: Pon la carta objetivo de un cementerio en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': 'La basura de un hombre es la carga de otro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643851&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc805931-763a-4405-896e-11b9f1e08bf4', 'multiverseId': 643851}, 'multiverseid': 643851}, {'name': 'Ramasseur de ferrailles', 'text': 'Défenseur\\n{T} : Mettez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact — golem', 'flavor': 'Les déchets des uns font le bonheur des autres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644142&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caef9e5a-0210-44f0-9495-0d14a5347a88', 'multiverseId': 644142}, 'multiverseid': 644142}, {'name': 'Setacciarifiuti', 'text': 'Difensore\\n{T}: Metti in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': 'I rifiuti di un uomo sono il bottino di un altro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644433&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1eabb97-92e3-469e-81be-2d4e9385eceb', 'multiverseId': 644433}, 'multiverseid': 644433}, {'name': 'ごみ引きずり', 'text': '防衛\\n{T}：墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': '誰かのゴミは、別の誰かのだから。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644724&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1103f7f6-543c-49ee-be6f-ffc8d1aee81a', 'multiverseId': 644724}, 'multiverseid': 644724}, {'name': 'Catador de Lixo', 'text': 'Defensor\\n{T}: Coloque o card alvo de um cemitério no fundo do grimório de seu dono.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': 'O lixo de um é o luxo do outro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645015&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22eca66e-d025-430b-af9b-acae9f1c15c3', 'multiverseId': 645015}, 'multiverseid': 645015}, {'name': '垃圾回收机', 'text': '守军\\n{T}：将目标牌从任一坟墓场置于其拥有者的牌库底。', 'type': '神器生物 — 魔像', 'flavor': '某人的垃圾，可能是别人的回收机。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645306&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85af21d0-bbba-43fd-a674-4088b261e3b4', 'multiverseId': 645306}, 'multiverseid': 645306}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ablöschen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {2}.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn sie richtig heraufbeschworen wird, umschließt die Plasmakugel den Zauber des Angreifers mit einem satten Schlürfen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643354&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0332b1ff-c5c6-4663-850d-ebdd7708b23e\', \'multiverseId\': 643354}, \'multiverseid\': 643354}, {\'name\': \'Aplacar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {2}.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si se invoca bien, el glóbulo de plasma absorbe el hechizo ofensivo con un satisfactorio ruido de succión".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c1d2cb1-4104-4454-910b-a86c0ebfac52\', \'multiverseId\': 643645}, \'multiverseid\': 643645}, {\'name\': \'Étanchement\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {2}.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsqu\'elle est invoquée correctement, la perle de plasma confine le sort offensif dans un délicieux bruit de succion. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643936&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4226c7ec-0800-466d-a78c-5f7cd4d3041a\', \'multiverseId\': 643936}, \'multiverseid\': 643936}, {\'name\': \'Smorzare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {2}.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se evocato correttamente, il globulo di plasma assorbe la magia offensiva con un gradevole risucchio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7c2cb8-f4a5-472c-99d5-93decb2c9c67\', \'multiverseId\': 644227}, \'multiverseid\': 644227}, {\'name\': \'火消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「適切に発動すれば、プラズマの球が攻撃的な呪文をごくりと包み込むわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eee7fb5-c892-4357-8a80-88a27a3318e7\', \'multiverseId\': 644518}, \'multiverseid\': 644518}, {\'name\': \'Arrefecer\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2}.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando invocado adequadamente, o glóbulo de plasma encerra a mágica ofensiva com um slurp bastante agradável."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14199dc5-38b3-4ab6-8843-3cf16b768155\', \'multiverseId\': 644809}, \'multiverseid\': 644809}, {\'name\': \'熄咒\', \'text\': \'除非目标咒语的操控者支付{2}，否则反击之。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如能恰当召唤，电浆球应会完全包裹攻击咒语，你还能听到一声饱嗝。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a40cf1d-2de4-4917-a27f-19f5ec643618\', \'multiverseId\': 645100}, \'multiverseid\': 645100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akkord des Rufes\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643432&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12014028-fa7d-41bc-8d56-2e232f01903f\', \'multiverseId\': 643432}, \'multiverseid\': 643432}, {\'name\': \'Acorde de llamada\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura con valor de maná de X o menos, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f547ae4-d3a0-4141-937f-41e5f8a1c3e0\', \'multiverseId\': 643723}, \'multiverseid\': 643723}, {\'name\': "Corde d\'adjuration", \'text\': \'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644014&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'758fe6f8-59fa-4449-af92-abbfc75293a7\', \'multiverseId\': 644014}, \'multiverseid\': 644014}, {\'name\': \'Corda della Convocazione\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d725a3f-127b-4c84-bf98-b73c6b3bc4f4\', \'multiverseId\': 644305}, \'multiverseid\': 644305}, {\'name\': \'召喚の調べ\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから、マナ総量がＸ以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c55c68-27b4-427f-9b61-72ee953ff71c\', \'multiverseId\': 644596}, \'multiverseid\': 644596}, {\'name\': \'Acorde do Chamado\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nProcure em seu grimório um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1acecb71-ae83-499e-89da-e8163b9b1d22\', \'multiverseId\': 644887}, \'multiverseid\': 644887}, {\'name\': \'和声召集\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n从你牌库中搜寻一张法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509d9f10-dc6d-4150-9f3b-f826c361480c\', \'multiverseId\': 645178}, \'multiverseid\': 645178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akkord des Rufes\', \'text\': \'Einberufen\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259e81e8-4e47-4c99-83b0-990db1b6606d\', \'multiverseId\': 645556}, \'multiverseid\': 645556}, {\'name\': \'Acorde de llamada\', \'text\': \'Convocar.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura con valor de maná de X o menos, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255849e8-a5f2-4711-b592-d9c4b3cea9c5\', \'multiverseId\': 645670}, \'multiverseid\': 645670}, {\'name\': "Corde d\'adjuration", \'text\': \'Convocation\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645784&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf2617f-d764-43e8-9cef-e8f4d9d80c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 645784}, \'multiverseid\': 645784}, {\'name\': \'Corda della Convocazione\', \'text\': \'Convocazione\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e05ff5-dace-4252-a855-5bafa6ffffbf\', \'multiverseId\': 645898}, \'multiverseid\': 645898}, {\'name\': \'召喚の調べ\', \'text\': \'召集\\nあなたのライブラリーから、マナ総量がＸ以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'197107fa-dd1a-47a1-a581-212d4847b860\', \'multiverseId\': 646012}, \'multiverseid\': 646012}, {\'name\': \'Acorde do Chamado\', \'text\': \'Convocar\\nProcure em seu grimório um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a13fd82-59c2-4896-b93f-85b8856576c1\', \'multiverseId\': 646126}, \'multiverseid\': 646126}, {\'name\': \'和声召集\', \'text\': \'召集\\n从你牌库中搜寻一张法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35eb2a3b-0beb-4934-9bb6-b3109934a9ef\', \'multiverseId\': 646240}, \'multiverseid\': 646240}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anschwellende Volksmenge\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderer Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Anschwellende Volksmenge.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'Trauer ist ein Schmelztiegel, der unsere Entschlossenheit festigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be24ed85-e3c1-42fa-9a92-56eeb11a5816\', \'multiverseId\': 643323}, \'multiverseid\': 643323}, {\'name\': \'Pueblo indignado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura o planeswalker que controlas muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Pueblo indignado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'El dolor es un crisol donde se templa la resolución.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef0e844-2028-404d-b46f-89a9e619e4ee\', \'multiverseId\': 643614}, \'multiverseid\': 643614}, {\'name\': \'Soulèvement de la population\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature ou qu\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Soulèvement de la population.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain\', \'flavor\': \'Le chagrin est un creuset où se forge la détermination.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c95813-c288-48f5-8629-a3dae04faed0\', \'multiverseId\': 643905}, \'multiverseid\': 643905}, {\'name\': \'Popolazione in Rivolta\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura o un altro planeswalker che controlli muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Popolazione in Rivolta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Il dolore è un crogiolo in cui si tempra la determinazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aabf46c0-3561-4770-9b53-2ffd82ab1210\', \'multiverseId\': 644196}, \'multiverseid\': 644196}, {\'name\': \'立ち上がる民衆\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしていてこれでない１体が死亡するたび、立ち上がる民衆の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': \'悲しみというるつぼが、決意を煮詰めてゆく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7182915a-6ce6-4f82-8755-41161c47221c\', \'multiverseId\': 644487}, \'multiverseid\': 644487}, {\'name\': \'Levante Popular\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura ou planeswalker que você controla morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Levante Popular.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'O luto é um crisol em que se tempera a determinação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6a9485-693e-4278-9dc4-f02b0859d1e4\', \'multiverseId\': 644778}, \'multiverseid\': 644778}, {\'name\': \'起义民众\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物或鹏洛客死去时，在起义民众上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类\', \'flavor\': \'悲痛恰是锤炼决心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0f3b845-ebb0-4595-a0a2-c51190a2902d\', \'multiverseId\': 645069}, \'multiverseid\': 645069}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aristokratin des Kartells\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine andere Kreatur: Die Aristokratin des Kartells erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor einer Farbe, die du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Leben dient jetzt einem höheren Zweck: Es gewährleistet das Fortbestehen meines eigenen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'513d3c89-ba94-48ec-864d-7668bec95a02\', \'multiverseId\': 643468}, \'multiverseid\': 643468}, {\'name\': \'Aristócrata del cártel\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar otra criatura: La Aristócrata del cártel gana protección contra el color de tu elección hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu vida sirve ahora a un propósito más elevado: asegurar la continuidad de la mía".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e5f349e-5e0b-4d8c-9ef8-5c1467b76402\', \'multiverseId\': 643759}, \'multiverseid\': 643759}, {\'name\': \'Aristocrate du cartel\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une autre créature : L\'Aristocrate du cartel acquiert la protection contre la couleur de votre choix jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'« Désormais, ta vie sert un but supérieur : assurer le prolongement de la mienne. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f1b9a4-6814-47ff-8e04-feede6f26176\', \'multiverseId\': 644050}, \'multiverseid\': 644050}, {\'name\': \'Aristocratica del Consorzio\', \'text\': "Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: L\'Aristocratica del Consorzio ha protezione da un colore a tua scelta fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua vita ora serve uno scopo più alto: assicurare la continuazione della mia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d0be6b3-fc2c-4d16-ae2b-b93c0a6ac330\', \'multiverseId\': 644341}, \'multiverseid\': 644341}, {\'name\': \'カルテルの貴種\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：色１色を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、カルテルの貴種はプロテクション（その選ばれた色）を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の命にはより高尚な役目が生まれた。私の命を永らえさせるというな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832b3861-a632-48e4-a2c7-8b0db7b51347\', \'multiverseId\': 644632}, \'multiverseid\': 644632}, {\'name\': \'Aristocrata do Cartel\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique outra criatura: Aristocrata do Cartel ganha proteção contra a cor de sua escolha até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua vida serve a um propósito maior agora: garantir a continuidade da minha."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f253e7-8e6f-447d-9306-10605b984943\', \'multiverseId\': 644923}, \'multiverseid\': 644923}, {\'name\': \'联会豪族\', \'text\': \'牺牲另一个生物：选择一种颜色。联会豪族获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「你的生命现在有更高的目的：确保我的生命得以延续。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1db297d-34f1-47c2-8006-bb43acc91f85\', \'multiverseId\': 645214}, \'multiverseid\': 645214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aristokratin des Kartells\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine andere Kreatur: Die Aristokratin des Kartells erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor einer Farbe, die du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Leben dient jetzt einem höheren Zweck: Es gewährleistet das Fortbestehen meines eigenen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d62f56fe-3b02-427f-9f32-ee6dafa928fa\', \'multiverseId\': 645570}, \'multiverseid\': 645570}, {\'name\': \'Aristócrata del cártel\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar otra criatura: La Aristócrata del cártel gana protección contra el color de tu elección hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu vida sirve ahora a un propósito más elevado: asegurar la continuidad de la mía".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68fa6bc2-2bfd-4da4-a9f2-f2d6db3615cc\', \'multiverseId\': 645684}, \'multiverseid\': 645684}, {\'name\': \'Aristocrate du cartel\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une autre créature : L\'Aristocrate du cartel acquiert la protection contre la couleur de votre choix jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'« Désormais, ta vie sert un but supérieur : assurer le prolongement de la mienne. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e53d8b8-800f-4c2e-8d96-f385a596c6aa\', \'multiverseId\': 645798}, \'multiverseid\': 645798}, {\'name\': \'Aristocratica del Consorzio\', \'text\': "Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: L\'Aristocratica del Consorzio ha protezione da un colore a tua scelta fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua vita ora serve uno scopo più alto: assicurare la continuazione della mia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e65881-b9ef-4c21-a05e-648d4f4d4a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 645912}, \'multiverseid\': 645912}, {\'name\': \'カルテルの貴種\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：色１色を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、カルテルの貴種はプロテクション（その選ばれた色）を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の命にはより高尚な役目が生まれた。私の命を永らえさせるというな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b8f8ed-e43c-455a-bca3-3132f1272c87\', \'multiverseId\': 646026}, \'multiverseid\': 646026}, {\'name\': \'Aristocrata do Cartel\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique outra criatura: Aristocrata do Cartel ganha proteção contra a cor de sua escolha até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua vida serve a um propósito maior agora: garantir a continuidade da minha."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ff034f-4246-46bb-bf9c-f7a0bba7d43e\', \'multiverseId\': 646140}, \'multiverseid\': 646140}, {\'name\': \'联会豪族\', \'text\': \'牺牲另一个生物：选择一种颜色。联会豪族获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「你的生命现在有更高的目的：确保我的生命得以延续。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9020c663-744f-4e5a-8024-562e899bda3d\', \'multiverseId\': 646254}, \'multiverseid\': 646254}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armschienen des Illusionisten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Fähigkeit der ausgerüsteten Kreatur aktiviert wird und falls es keine Manafähigkeit ist, kopiere diese Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist leicht, sich für einen Gott zu halten, wenn man doppelt so mächtig ist wie alle anderen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f42aa4c-2f4c-4095-8166-41d17b5ab6ad\', \'multiverseId\': 643558}, \'multiverseid\': 643558}, {\'name\': \'Brazales del ilusionista\', \'text\': \'Siempre que se active una habilidad de la criatura equipada, si no es una habilidad de maná, copia esa habilidad. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Es fácil creerse un dios cuando se es el doble de poderoso que todos los demás.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78570505-c794-4038-aab9-bd5703dfc5f3\', \'multiverseId\': 643849}, \'multiverseid\': 643849}, {\'name\': "Bracelets de l\'illusionniste", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une capacité de la créature équipée est activée, si ce n\'est pas une capacité de mana, copiez cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nÉquipement {3}", \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Il est facile de se prendre pour un dieu quand on est deux fois plus puissant que quiconque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d59f21d-80ff-4ec8-85a6-0829b6f2d0e6\', \'multiverseId\': 644140}, \'multiverseid\': 644140}, {\'name\': "Bracciali dell\'Illusionista", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta viene attivata un\'abilità della creatura equipaggiata, se non è un\'abilità di mana, copia quell\'abilità. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nEquipaggiare {3}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'È facile convincersi di essere un dio, quando sei due volte più forte di tutti gli altri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d60caed0-4145-4ade-90b2-f16ff5ce7f89\', \'multiverseId\': 644431}, \'multiverseid\': 644431}, {\'name\': \'幻術師の篭手\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーの能力１つが起動されるたび、それがマナ能力でない場合、その能力をコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'他の誰よりも倍の力を持っていれば、自分が神だと信じるようになるのも無理はない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b20600-c44c-4e2d-a7cc-c8c3899097f9\', \'multiverseId\': 644722}, \'multiverseid\': 644722}, {\'name\': \'Bracelete do Ilusionista\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma habilidade da criatura equipada for ativada, se não for uma habilidade de mana, copie aquela habilidade. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'É fácil acreditar que você é um deus quando se é duas vezes mais poderoso que todos os outros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cbca94a-01b8-4a2c-a8d3-70f5d0775c11\', \'multiverseId\': 645013}, \'multiverseid\': 645013}, {\'name\': \'幻影师护臂\', \'text\': \'每当起动佩带此武具之生物的异能时，若它不是法术力异能，则复制该异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': \'如果你比其他人强两倍，就很容易被当成神。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aab6961-585b-4d13-af52-6f62e9271d64\', \'multiverseId\': 645304}, \'multiverseid\': 645304}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armschienen des Illusionisten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Fähigkeit der ausgerüsteten Kreatur aktiviert wird und falls es keine Manafähigkeit ist, kopiere jene Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist leicht, sich für einen Gott zu halten, wenn man doppelt so mächtig ist wie alle anderen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dcccaba-3039-490b-9bf8-5724b51eba2e\', \'multiverseId\': 645603}, \'multiverseid\': 645603}, {\'name\': \'Brazales del ilusionista\', \'text\': \'Siempre que se active una habilidad de la criatura equipada, si no es una habilidad de maná, copia esa habilidad. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Es fácil creerse un dios cuando se es el doble de poderoso que todos los demás.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a780d17-c7a4-4545-9795-2b9cb5cb88b9\', \'multiverseId\': 645717}, \'multiverseid\': 645717}, {\'name\': "Bracelets de l\'illusionniste", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une capacité de la créature équipée est activée, si ce n\'est pas une capacité de mana, copiez cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nÉquipement {3}", \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Il est facile de se prendre pour un dieu quand on est deux fois plus puissant que quiconque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97300a3b-4803-441f-b798-f831ad867711\', \'multiverseId\': 645831}, \'multiverseid\': 645831}, {\'name\': "Bracciali dell\'Illusionista", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta viene attivata un\'abilità della creatura equipaggiata, se non è un\'abilità di mana, copia quell\'abilità. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nEquipaggiare {3}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'È facile convincersi di essere un dio, quando sei due volte più forte di tutti gli altri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d180e76f-3b3a-497e-b8e9-a11991a9a331\', \'multiverseId\': 645945}, \'multiverseid\': 645945}, {\'name\': \'幻術師の篭手\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーの能力１つが起動されるたび、それがマナ能力でない場合、その能力をコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'他の誰よりも倍の力を持っていれば、自分が神だと信じるようになるのも無理はない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe872fa7-337b-465e-9ecb-b25a0e7f6237\', \'multiverseId\': 646059}, \'multiverseid\': 646059}, {\'name\': \'Bracelete do Ilusionista\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma habilidade da criatura equipada for ativada, se não for uma habilidade de mana, copie aquela habilidade. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'É fácil acreditar que você é um deus quando se é duas vezes mais poderoso que todos os outros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cfcb09d-7799-464d-ae02-cb9778347175\', \'multiverseId\': 646173}, \'multiverseid\': 646173}, {\'name\': \'幻影师护臂\', \'text\': \'每当起动佩带此武具之生物的异能时，若它不是法术力异能，则复制该异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': \'如果你比其他人强两倍，就很容易被当成神。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'226ffce0-f3bc-4d6c-8ee5-5fe4afd65735\', \'multiverseId\': 646287}, \'multiverseid\': 646287}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufhebung\', \'text\': \'Bringe ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Verbrechen kann nicht wieder rückgängig gemacht werden. Du hingegen schon."\\n—Agosto, Imperator der Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643358&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce9a0bb-3541-4837-b251-739df3deb426\', \'multiverseId\': 643358}, \'multiverseid\': 643358}, {\'name\': \'Revocar\', \'text\': \'Regresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra con valor de maná de X a la mano de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu acción no puede ser deshecha. Sin embargo, tu sí puedes serlo".\\n—Agosto, imperator azorio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a748ce29-e071-48d1-b7a7-3c9dd233f02d\', \'multiverseId\': 643649}, \'multiverseid\': 643649}, {\'name\': \'Abrogation\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez un permanent non-terrain ciblé ayant une valeur de mana de X dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce qui est fait est fait. Ce qui existe peut être annulé. »\\n—Agosto, imperator d\'Azorius", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3bdcfd-bc0b-40bb-8298-62c6364eee83\', \'multiverseId\': 643940}, \'multiverseid\': 643940}, {\'name\': \'Abrogare\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio con valore di mana X in mano al suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che hai fatto non può più essere disfatto. Tu, invece, sì."\\n—Agosto, imperatore Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5737ce4a-1a0a-4ee1-8db6-53981be0ad8c\', \'multiverseId\': 644231}, \'multiverseid\': 644231}, {\'name\': \'撤廃\', \'text\': \'マナ総量がＸであり土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の行いは無かったことにはできぬ。しかし、お前をそうすることは可能だ。」\\n――アゾリウスの将軍、アゴスト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80cf1624-abe0-4144-b3d8-d868f133ac80\', \'multiverseId\': 644522}, \'multiverseid\': 644522}, {\'name\': \'Revogar\', \'text\': \'Devolva a permanente alvo não de terreno com valor de mana igual a X para a mão de seu dono.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é possível desfazer o que você fez. Mas é possível desfazer você."\\n— Agosto, imperator Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceadbaca-8e82-401a-8048-417d6455a471\', \'multiverseId\': 644813}, \'multiverseid\': 644813}, {\'name\': \'撤回\', \'text\': \'将目标法术力值为X的非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你的约定不能毁弃。但你，倒是可以。」\\n～俄佐立将军阿果托\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f26bfe32-21af-4109-bf99-fc354288537e\', \'multiverseId\': 645104}, \'multiverseid\': 645104}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auflodern\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die grenzenlose Wut der ersten Gruul wurde durch ein riesiges Feuer am Anbeginn der Zeit gespeist. Dieselbe Flamme brennt auch in dir."\\n—Kroshkar, Gruul-Schamane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643401&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'064692fa-8044-4d15-aadc-6a16191944c7\', \'multiverseId\': 643401}, \'multiverseid\': 643401}, {\'name\': \'Arder de rabia\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"En una gran hoguera en el albor de los tiempos, los primeros gruul encendieron su ira. La misma llama arde en ti".\\n—Kroshkar, chamán gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ae78af-6444-48a5-b19a-9e05bcd9cf9f\', \'multiverseId\': 643692}, \'multiverseid\': 643692}, {\'name\': \'Pleins feux\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« À l\'aube des temps, le premier Gruul a attisé sa rage dans un grand feu de joie. Cette même flamme brûle en vous. »\\n—Kroshkar, shamane gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643983&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aefe578e-8400-4061-bb55-5b7e426be7f9\', \'multiverseId\': 643983}, \'multiverseid\': 643983}, {\'name\': \'Avvampare\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Da un grande rogo all\\\'alba dei tempi, i primi Gruul accesero la loro furia. La stessa fiamma brucia dentro di te."\\n—Kroshkar, sciamano Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9efa045-6a98-4fd2-a5ac-89bc074b3286\', \'multiverseId\': 644274}, \'multiverseid\': 644274}, {\'name\': \'燃えさかる炎\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「太古の昔の大かがり火で、最初のグルールは怒りを燃え立たせた。お前の中には同じ炎が燃えている。」\\n――グルールのシャーマン、クロシュカー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c07e15-e7a3-4321-be58-084f2341e119\', \'multiverseId\': 644565}, \'multiverseid\': 644565}, {\'name\': \'Ira Ardente\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Da grande fogueira da aurora dos tempos, os primeiros Gruul inflamaram a própria fúria. A mesma chama arde em você."\\n— Kroshkar, xamã Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8006cd87-9ab5-4925-92a7-0d468bc2ac16\', \'multiverseId\': 644856}, \'multiverseid\': 644856}, {\'name\': \'怒火冲天\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「古鲁人血液中的怒火，从先人在创世之初升起第一簇盛大篝火起就开始燃烧，一直延续至今。这股怒火同样也在你的体内燃烧。」\\n～古鲁祭师克许卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba4f94ec-c10c-4d70-b692-50e93c1f31af\', \'multiverseId\': 645147}, \'multiverseid\': 645147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auflösender Schleim\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch, eine aktivierte Fähigkeit oder eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl. (Manafähigkeiten können nicht als Ziel gewählt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Technisch gesehen ist es ein Schlammwesen, aber seine Lebensspanne dauert nur Sekunden. In dieser kurzen Zeit hat es allerdings einen großen Appetit auf Magie."\\n—Notizen von Simic-Forschern\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cac8b90c-9634-4d42-8d66-2079ddfa19ad\', \'multiverseId\': 643535}, \'multiverseid\': 643535}, {\'name\': \'Babanuladora\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo, habilidad activada o habilidad disparada objetivo. (Las habilidades de maná no pueden hacerse objetivo.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Técnicamente es un cieno, pero su vida se mide solo en segundos. En ese breve tiempo, su apetito por la magia es extraordinario".\\n—Notas de investigación simic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'163ce7c4-5191-4027-8b12-9b0f962160b4\', \'multiverseId\': 643826}, \'multiverseid\': 643826}, {\'name\': \'Vide gluant\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez une cible, sort, capacité activée ou capacité déclenchée. (Les capacités de mana ne peuvent pas être ciblées.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Techniquement, c\'est un limon, mais son espérance de vie n\'est que de quelques secondes. Mais durant sa courte vie, son appétit magique est illimité. »\\n—Notes de recherche des Simic", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cff75d3-af3f-4397-9776-fc8e19e37120\', \'multiverseId\': 644117}, \'multiverseid\': 644117}, {\'name\': \'Sviscisvuota\', \'text\': "Neutralizza una magia, un\'abilità attivata o un\'abilità innescata bersaglio. (Le abilità di mana non possono essere bersagliate.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tecnicamente è una melma, ma la sua vita dura pochi secondi. In quel breve tempo, la sua fame di magia è straordinaria."\\n—Note di ricerca dei Simic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cac9b9e-5171-4452-8895-d1f00f5a4ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 644408}, \'multiverseid\': 644408}, {\'name\': \'虚空粘\', \'text\': \'呪文や起動型能力や誘発型能力のうち１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。（マナ能力は対象にできない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「理論的にはこれは軟泥だが、その寿命は数秒しかない。その短い時間の中での魔法に対する欲求は常軌を逸している。」\\n――シミックの研究メモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'863c84d3-1fc5-4412-9729-a238d8440fd8\', \'multiverseId\': 644699}, \'multiverseid\': 644699}, {\'name\': \'Gosmanuladora\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica, a habilidade ativada ou a habilidade desencadeada alvo. (As habilidades de mana não podem ser alvo.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Tecnicamente é um lodo, mas sua expectativa de vida é de apenas alguns segundos. É um período curto, mas seu apetite por mágicas é extraordinário."\\n— anotações de pesquisa Simic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41665c13-ffa2-49a3-9e90-e92691cb897d\', \'multiverseId\': 644990}, \'multiverseid\': 644990}, {\'name\': \'虚空黏泞\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语，起动式异能或触发式异能。（其目标不能是法术力异能。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「技术上来说，它是个流浆，但生命史仅维持数秒。在如此短暂生涯里，它对魔法的胃口大得惊人。」\\n～析米克研究纪录\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'655e288b-b9fb-47d6-bbcc-d3540e48d4ec\', \'multiverseId\': 645281}, \'multiverseid\': 645281}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auflösender Schleim\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch, eine aktivierte oder eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Technisch gesehen ist es ein Schlammwesen, aber seine Lebensspanne dauert nur Sekunden. In dieser kurzen Zeit hat es allerdings einen großen Appetit auf Magie."\\n—Notizen von Simic-Forschern\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645599&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2cff24f-7b75-4ee8-9b89-8f5c4695ac28\', \'multiverseId\': 645599}, \'multiverseid\': 645599}, {\'name\': \'Babanuladora\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo, habilidad activada o habilidad disparada objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Técnicamente es un cieno, pero su vida se mide solo en segundos. En ese breve tiempo, su apetito por la magia es extraordinario".\\n—Notas de investigación simic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db75146d-23f9-47dd-b5c1-44b63d490c86\', \'multiverseId\': 645713}, \'multiverseid\': 645713}, {\'name\': \'Vide gluant\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé, la capacité activée ciblée ou la capacité déclenchée ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Techniquement, c\'est un limon, mais son espérance de vie n\'est que de quelques secondes. Mais durant sa courte vie, son appétit magique est illimité. »\\n—Notes de recherche des Simic", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8343f69-71b4-4f39-9b8a-22af67a1775c\', \'multiverseId\': 645827}, \'multiverseid\': 645827}, {\'name\': \'Sviscisvuota\', \'text\': "Neutralizza una magia, un\'abilità attivata o un\'abilità innescata bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tecnicamente è una melma, ma la sua vita dura pochi secondi. In quel breve tempo, la sua fame di magia è straordinaria."\\n—Note di ricerca dei Simic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9de0d3-2f55-4d40-8cfc-94aa87db0df1\', \'multiverseId\': 645941}, \'multiverseid\': 645941}, {\'name\': \'虚空粘\', \'text\': \'呪文や起動型能力や誘発型能力のうち１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「理論的にはこれは軟泥だが、その寿命は数秒しかない。その短い時間の中での魔法に対する欲求は常軌を逸している。」\\n――シミックの研究メモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3748e62-ed67-4bda-8535-ead62fc5b5f7\', \'multiverseId\': 646055}, \'multiverseid\': 646055}, {\'name\': \'Gosmanuladora\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica, a habilidade ativada ou a habilidade desencadeada alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Tecnicamente é um lodo, mas sua expectativa de vida é de apenas alguns segundos. É um período curto, mas seu apetite por mágicas é extraordinário."\\n— anotações de pesquisa Simic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94b0968-2d9d-4d8f-87ac-2f40e3ac9131\', \'multiverseId\': 646169}, \'multiverseid\': 646169}, {\'name\': \'虚空黏泞\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语，起动式异能或触发式异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「技术上来说，它是个流浆，但生命史仅维持数秒。在如此短暂生涯里，它对魔法的胃口大得惊人。」\\n～析米克研究纪录\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce42162a-6ae6-422a-a5a8-caf9a68f2f25\', \'multiverseId\': 646283}, \'multiverseid\': 646283}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufmarsch der Legion\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du eine Musterungsmarke auf den Aufmarsch der Legion. Erzeuge dann für jede Musterungsmarke auf dem Aufmarsch der Legion einen 1/1 roten und weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein mit Eile.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceda0c51-cfee-4be1-bbc6-584aa879a7fa\', \'multiverseId\': 643461}, \'multiverseid\': 643461}, {\'name\': \'Reunir a la Legión\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador de reunión sobre Reunir a la Legión. Luego crea una ficha de criatura Soldado roja y blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de prisa por cada contador de reunión sobre Reunir a la Legión.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a344857-548d-443a-83bd-e1efa23179d7\', \'multiverseId\': 643752}, \'multiverseid\': 643752}, {\'name\': \'Rassemblez la légion !\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur « rassemblement » sur Rassemblez la légion . Créez ensuite un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge et blanche Soldat avec la célérité pour chaque marqueur « rassemblement » sur Rassemblez la légion .\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644043&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89facc6d-7841-4456-8621-f7cf5c8807e9\', \'multiverseId\': 644043}, \'multiverseid\': 644043}, {\'name\': \'Radunare la Legione\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino adunata su Radunare la Legione. Poi crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca e rossa con rapidità per ogni segnalino adunata su Radunare la Legione.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d5d6ac6-44c7-458d-b214-093b160d6ec0\', \'multiverseId\': 644334}, \'multiverseid\': 644334}, {\'name\': \'軍勢の集結\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、軍勢の集結の上に召集カウンター１個を置く。その後、軍勢の集結の上にある召集カウンター１個につき１体の、速攻を持つ赤白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b016675-ca4f-403a-b6ff-ee41dd47b110\', \'multiverseId\': 644625}, \'multiverseid\': 644625}, {\'name\': \'Reunir a Legião\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador de reunião em Reunir a Legião. Depois, crie uma ficha de criatura Soldado vermelha e branca 1/1 com ímpeto para cada marcador de reunião em Reunir a Legião.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea97a172-d7f2-420b-93ef-f74cf6fb943d\', \'multiverseId\': 644916}, \'multiverseid\': 644916}, {\'name\': \'召集战团\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，在召集战团上放置一个召集指示物。然后召集战团上每有一个召集指示物，便派出一个1/1，红白双色，具敏捷异能的士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'095bacb1-80e0-40bf-86a8-875d4975f714\', \'multiverseId\': 645207}, \'multiverseid\': 645207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auftreiben // Aufreiben // Auftreiben // Aufreiben\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei // Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Auftreiben // Aufreiben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fb09c3e-d716-4322-b7e5-6b276f84ccf0\', \'multiverseId\': 643543}, \'multiverseid\': 643543}, {\'name\': \'Descubrir // Destino // Descubrir // Destino\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro // Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Descubrir // Destino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edacb6c1-bc8d-44c4-845a-c940eece143b\', \'multiverseId\': 643834}, \'multiverseid\': 643834}, {\'name\': \'Décèlement // Dessein // Décèlement // Dessein\', \'text\': "Renvoyez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel // Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Décèlement // Dessein\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f1d5007-6353-427e-a831-5be4cecea824\', \'multiverseId\': 644125}, \'multiverseid\': 644125}, {\'name\': \'Trovare // Troncare // Trovare // Troncare\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano fino a due carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria // Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Trovare // Troncare\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d55c1495-88fe-4872-8030-700ba0b72664\', \'multiverseId\': 644416}, \'multiverseid\': 644416}, {\'name\': \'採取 // 最終 // 採取 // 最終\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とする。それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー // ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'採取 // 最終\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be10e2f9-9013-474d-9918-559c6579e6f9\', \'multiverseId\': 644707}, \'multiverseid\': 644707}, {\'name\': \'Sentir // Sentido // Sentir // Sentido\', \'text\': \'Devolva até dois cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço // Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Sentir // Sentido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a8940d6-59c6-44c7-8caa-de1aeceec110\', \'multiverseId\': 644998}, \'multiverseid\': 644998}, {\'name\': \'究探 // 究终 // 究探 // 究终\', \'text\': \'将至多两张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术 // 法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'究探 // 究终\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f0839b9-7152-41fb-a147-342fae6ba860\', \'multiverseId\': 645289}, \'multiverseid\': 645289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufzuchttümpel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.)\\nSowie der Aufzuchttümpel ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt er getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Insel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b989965-dec5-4049-aa8d-78ad9720a410\', \'multiverseId\': 643573}, \'multiverseid\': 643573}, {\'name\': \'Estanque reproductor\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.)\\nEn cuanto el Estanque reproductor entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, entra al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque isla\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0734610-205a-4548-a303-356e74c743ca\', \'multiverseId\': 643864}, \'multiverseid\': 643864}, {\'name\': "Bassin d\'élevage", \'text\': "({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.)\\nAu moment où le Bassin d\'élevage arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, il arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.", \'type\': \'Terrain — forêt et île\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ab8e0dc-2d55-4be1-9a07-6b4cc5fb034b\', \'multiverseId\': 644155}, \'multiverseid\': 644155}, {\'name\': \'Pozza Prolifica\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.)\\nMentre la Pozza Prolifica entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Isola\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39d6437c-c5c7-407d-9632-d6f512ca6e42\', \'multiverseId\': 644446}, \'multiverseid\': 644446}, {\'name\': \'繁殖池\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。）\\n繁殖池が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・島\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad7a80e3-e0ec-46f0-9387-3c547c1c73d4\', \'multiverseId\': 644737}, \'multiverseid\': 644737}, {\'name\': \'Charco da Procriação\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.)\\nConforme Charco da Procriação entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ele entrará no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Ilha\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6085d0c-7097-4799-8566-d628defe4eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 645028}, \'multiverseid\': 645028}, {\'name\': \'滋生之池\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}或{U}。）\\n于滋生之池进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则滋生之池须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'地 — 树林／海岛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67752edf-076f-420e-b16c-bd4b4c232726\', \'multiverseId\': 645319}, \'multiverseid\': 645319}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufzuchttümpel\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Aufzuchttümpel ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt er getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Insel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f57a1e0-1bba-42f4-ace9-908ea3e440a4\', \'multiverseId\': 645610}, \'multiverseid\': 645610}, {\'name\': "Bassin d\'élevage", \'text\': "Au moment où le Bassin d\'élevage arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, il arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.", \'type\': \'Terrain — forêt et île\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d01489-9965-431c-9ee3-c667eef95218\', \'multiverseId\': 645838}, \'multiverseid\': 645838}, {\'name\': \'Pozza Prolifica\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Pozza Prolifica entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Isola\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a2b71f-f4dd-446c-b33b-7c23c920fdd5\', \'multiverseId\': 645952}, \'multiverseid\': 645952}, {\'name\': \'繁殖池\', \'text\': \'繁殖池が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・島\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80653ba5-202d-491f-9d2b-0088c4827b66\', \'multiverseId\': 646066}, \'multiverseid\': 646066}, {\'name\': \'Charco da Procriação\', \'text\': \'Conforme Charco da Procriação entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ele entrará no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Ilha\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f01b47f8-44f5-4a82-8682-2cb51119b313\', \'multiverseId\': 646180}, \'multiverseid\': 646180}, {\'name\': \'滋生之池\', \'text\': \'于滋生之池进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则滋生之池须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'地 — 树林／海岛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3466d33f-71c0-411e-8d76-a4f7492f751f\', \'multiverseId\': 646294}, \'multiverseid\': 646294}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augen im Himmel\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und führe dann Bevölkern durch. (Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Kreaturenspielsteins ist, den du kontrollierst.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere geflügelten Freunde werden sich um alles kümmern, wo Wurzel und Zweig nicht hinreichen."\\n—Zunak, Selesnija-Stratege\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643315&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816c99e0-a9a1-430d-80b4-655e01940281\', \'multiverseId\': 643315}, \'multiverseid\': 643315}, {\'name\': \'Ojos en el cielo\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar, luego repuebla. (Crea una ficha que es una copia de una ficha de criatura que controlas.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"De aquello que no alcancen raíces ni ramas se encargarán nuestros amigos alados".\\n—Zúnak, estratega selesnya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1279f1d-2caa-478f-a0a9-42573e79a426\', \'multiverseId\': 643606}, \'multiverseid\': 643606}, {\'name\': \'Yeux des cieux\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol, puis peuplez. (Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un jeton de créature que vous contrôlez.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nos amis ailés s\'occuperont de ce qui est hors d\'atteinte des racines et des branches. »\\n—Zunak, stratège de Selesnya", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2142e006-b707-49bf-b1f7-c0cab1c68444\', \'multiverseId\': 643897}, \'multiverseid\': 643897}, {\'name\': \'Occhi nel Cielo\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Uccello 1/1 bianca con volare, poi popola. (Crea una pedina che è una copia di una pedina creatura che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I nostri amici alati si occuperanno di ciò che radici e rami non possono raggiungere."\\n—Zunak, stratega di Selesnya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d78b32f-3002-423a-93f3-6db5dfb142ff\', \'multiverseId\': 644188}, \'multiverseid\': 644188}, {\'name\': \'天空の目\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、居住を行う。（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・トークン１体のコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「根と枝が届かない奴は、翼をもった我々の友が相手をしてくれるだろう。」\\n――セレズニアの軍師、ズーナーク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f2c3870-c280-46f9-b94f-d0826a71d9b9\', \'multiverseId\': 644479}, \'multiverseid\': 644479}, {\'name\': \'Olhos nos Céus\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Ave branca 1/1 com voar e depois povoe. (Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia de uma ficha de criatura que você controla.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossos amigos alados se encarregarão do que as raízes e galhos não puderem atingir."\\n— Zunak, estrategista Selesnya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce081d8e-4949-4384-8748-543b666fe22d\', \'multiverseId\': 644770}, \'multiverseid\': 644770}, {\'name\': \'苍穹之眼\', \'text\': \'派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物，然后殖民。（派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为由你操控的某衍生生物之复制品。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「根须和枝杈无法触及之处，长翅膀的朋友会替我们照看。」\\n～瑟雷尼亚战术家祖奈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f33311cb-71a3-4d52-a595-2152797b121e\', \'multiverseId\': 645061}, \'multiverseid\': 645061}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augen überall\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wendest du Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{5}{U}: Tausche die Kontrolle über Augen überall und ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie können sogar meine Gedanken sehen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643341&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'288b6bf8-6e7b-4ae2-bfa6-a34418b5c6ab\', \'multiverseId\': 643341}, \'multiverseid\': 643341}, {\'name\': \'Ojos por todas partes\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, adivina 1.\\n{5}{U}: Intercambia el control de los Ojos por todas partes por el del permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Tienen ojos dentro de mi cabeza!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'005aa289-7643-4b03-973f-c7f1961f158f\', \'multiverseId\': 643632}, \'multiverseid\': 643632}, {\'name\': \'Des yeux partout\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, regard 1.\\n{5}{U} : Échangez le contrôle de Des yeux partout contre celui d\'un permanent non-terrain ciblé. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils ont des yeux dans ma tête ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d96e43fa-939c-4651-8b2f-0832fa6bf4c1\', \'multiverseId\': 643923}, \'multiverseid\': 643923}, {\'name\': \'Occhi Ovunque\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, profetizza 1.\\n{5}{U}: Scambia il controllo di Occhi Ovunque e di un permanente non terra bersaglio. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"È come se avessero gli occhi puntati sul mio cervello!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667b35fb-7912-4c66-a7eb-5da85e52fc92\', \'multiverseId\': 644214}, \'multiverseid\': 644214}, {\'name\': \'一面の視線\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、占術１を行う。\\n{5}{U}：土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それと一面の視線のコントロールを交換する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺の頭の中に目を入れやがった！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91a7f424-ac42-4c48-820b-0a905dd83181\', \'multiverseId\': 644505}, \'multiverseid\': 644505}, {\'name\': \'Olhos por Toda Parte\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, use vidência 1.\\n{5}{U}: Permute o controle de Olhos por Toda Parte e da permanente alvo não de terreno. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles têm olhos dentro da minha cabeça!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79705fdf-df44-418a-9e54-7b5841905e51\', \'multiverseId\': 644796}, \'multiverseid\': 644796}, {\'name\': \'全城有眼\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，占卜1。\\n{5}{U}：交换全城有眼与目标非地永久物的操控权。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「就连我的脑袋里都有他们的眼睛！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01d2370e-96f3-4a4f-a5f5-159abb069270\', \'multiverseId\': 645087}, \'multiverseid\': 645087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aurelia, Verfechterin des Rechts\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nMentor (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, deren Stärke niedriger ist.)\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug bestimmst du bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält die Kreatur +2/+0 und sie verursacht Trampelschaden, falls sie rot ist, und erhält Wachsamkeit, falls sie weiß ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'137060b9-2d48-4739-99e7-e4ae56121782\', \'multiverseId\': 643462}, \'multiverseid\': 643462}, {\'name\': \'Aurelia, parangón de la justicia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMentor. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura atacante objetivo con menor fuerza.)\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, elige hasta una criatura objetivo que controlas. Hasta el final del turno, esa criatura obtiene +2/+0, gana la habilidad de arrollar si es roja y gana la habilidad de vigilancia si es blanca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf40f17-3487-47ff-9eb1-687ba3e5e945\', \'multiverseId\': 643753}, \'multiverseid\': 643753}, {\'name\': \'Aurélia, archétype de justice\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMentor (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature attaquante ciblée de force inférieure.)\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, choisissez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, cette créature gagne +2/+0, acquiert le piétinement si elle est rouge, et acquiert la vigilance si elle est blanche.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644044&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c00afe5-82fd-4c05-ac6a-9f0f04a51a73\', \'multiverseId\': 644044}, \'multiverseid\': 644044}, {\'name\': \'Aurelia, Esempio di Giustizia\', \'text\': "Volare\\nMentore (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura attaccante bersaglio con forza inferiore.)\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Fino alla fine del turno, quella creatura prende +2/+0, ha travolgere se è rossa e ha cautela se è bianca.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b20a2b7-9012-4b94-8273-c7a4a14a8053\', \'multiverseId\': 644335}, \'multiverseid\': 644335}, {\'name\': \'正義の模範、オレリア\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n教導（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、パワーがこれよりも小さい攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受け、それが赤であるならトランプルを得、それが白であるなら警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ab26a2e-50d9-4f08-80d7-5d485d7fd8a8\', \'multiverseId\': 644626}, \'multiverseid\': 644626}, {\'name\': \'Aurélia, Exemplo da Justiça\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nMentor (Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura atacante alvo com poder inferior.)\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, escolha até uma criatura alvo que você controla. Até o final do turno, aquela criatura recebe +2/+0 e ganha atropelar, se for vermelha, e vigilância, se for branca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e48c0e85-eafd-4481-af13-30adb5e21d5b\', \'multiverseId\': 644917}, \'multiverseid\': 644917}, {\'name\': \'正义模范欧瑞梨\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n训导（每当此生物攻击时，在目标进行攻击且力量小于它的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，选择至多一个目标由你操控的生物。直到回合结束，该生物得+2/+0，若它是红色，则获得践踏异能，且若它是白色，则获得警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1bb7563-3e6d-4c28-988b-5ec208c6a6fa\', \'multiverseId\': 645208}, \'multiverseid\': 645208}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aurelia, Verfechterin des Rechts\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nMentor\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug bestimmst du bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält die Kreatur +2/+0 und sie verursacht Trampelschaden, falls sie rot ist, und erhält Wachsamkeit, falls sie weiß ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f20ce0de-25d2-431b-ab35-4031d91c0ed6\', \'multiverseId\': 645567}, \'multiverseid\': 645567}, {\'name\': \'Aurelia, parangón de la justicia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMentor.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, elige hasta una criatura objetivo que controlas. Hasta el final del turno, esa criatura obtiene +2/+0, gana la habilidad de arrollar si es roja y gana la habilidad de vigilancia si es blanca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f933be42-8aba-4479-b289-2e6c738f0e12\', \'multiverseId\': 645681}, \'multiverseid\': 645681}, {\'name\': \'Aurélia, archétype de justice\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMentor\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, choisissez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, cette créature gagne +2/+0, acquiert le piétinement si elle est rouge, et acquiert la vigilance si elle est blanche.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645795&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'677d0874-47ce-402d-b3a3-01e1da3778a7\', \'multiverseId\': 645795}, \'multiverseid\': 645795}, {\'name\': \'Aurelia, Esempio di Giustizia\', \'text\': "Volare\\nMentore\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Fino alla fine del turno, quella creatura prende +2/+0, ha travolgere se è rossa e ha cautela se è bianca.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f02ea1b-fe3d-4cbd-9553-6bc06f3895f7\', \'multiverseId\': 645909}, \'multiverseid\': 645909}, {\'name\': \'正義の模範、オレリア\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n教導\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受け、それが赤であるならトランプルを得、それが白であるなら警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cf04bc7-560b-4b36-91f6-6bf9f3d1586a\', \'multiverseId\': 646023}, \'multiverseid\': 646023}, {\'name\': \'Aurélia, Exemplo da Justiça\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nMentor\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, escolha até uma criatura alvo que você controla. Até o final do turno, aquela criatura recebe +2/+0 e ganha atropelar, se for vermelha, e vigilância, se for branca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'412613a0-c9ed-4881-a20b-369ef7014a36\', \'multiverseId\': 646137}, \'multiverseid\': 646137}, {\'name\': \'正义模范欧瑞梨\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n训导\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，选择至多一个目标由你操控的生物。直到回合结束，该生物得+2/+0，若它是红色，则获得践踏异能，且若它是白色，则获得警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e494db-9b01-4f9d-ba3f-0768b46fec5e\', \'multiverseId\': 646251}, \'multiverseid\': 646251}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aurelia, Verfechterin des Rechts\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nMentor\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug bestimmst du bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält die Kreatur +2/+0 und sie verursacht Trampelschaden, falls sie rot ist, und erhält Wachsamkeit, falls sie weiß ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646389&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a5fc80b-5090-48bc-add1-7fb888c5433c\', \'multiverseId\': 646389}, \'multiverseid\': 646389}, {\'name\': \'Aurelia, parangón de la justicia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMentor.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, elige hasta una criatura objetivo que controlas. Hasta el final del turno, esa criatura obtiene +2/+0, gana la habilidad de arrollar si es roja y gana la habilidad de vigilancia si es blanca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'515a0437-950d-4700-9e2a-4f750a55ab97\', \'multiverseId\': 646417}, \'multiverseid\': 646417}, {\'name\': \'Aurélia, archétype de justice\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMentor\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, choisissez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, cette créature gagne +2/+0, acquiert le piétinement si elle est rouge, et acquiert la vigilance si elle est blanche.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d74a12c-d3b5-4438-9fa2-ebb486fa5cc1\', \'multiverseId\': 646445}, \'multiverseid\': 646445}, {\'name\': \'Aurelia, Esempio di Giustizia\', \'text\': "Volare\\nMentore\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Fino alla fine del turno, quella creatura prende +2/+0, ha travolgere se è rossa e ha cautela se è bianca.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54471bd4-d14c-49f5-9a71-68a8bcc0bc0a\', \'multiverseId\': 646473}, \'multiverseid\': 646473}, {\'name\': \'正義の模範、オレリア\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n教導\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受け、それが赤であるならトランプルを得、それが白であるなら警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'112414fd-c322-4501-b14d-bfcf12e26649\', \'multiverseId\': 646501}, \'multiverseid\': 646501}, {\'name\': \'Aurélia, Exemplo da Justiça\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nMentor\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, escolha até uma criatura alvo que você controla. Até o final do turno, aquela criatura recebe +2/+0 e ganha atropelar, se for vermelha, e vigilância, se for branca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664c272b-6f11-4b21-874c-88123ea1ad90\', \'multiverseId\': 646529}, \'multiverseid\': 646529}, {\'name\': \'正义模范欧瑞梨\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n训导\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，选择至多一个目标由你操控的生物。直到回合结束，该生物得+2/+0，若它是红色，则获得践踏异能，且若它是白色，则获得警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4cf8f9-d77f-4d87-aeab-80cfe47c58ef\', \'multiverseId\': 646557}, \'multiverseid\': 646557}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausweiden\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast recht. Ich bin sicher, deine Freunde von der Legion suchen nach dir. Und sobald wir in jedem Distrikt ein Stück von dir versteckt haben, können sie noch lange weitersuchen."\\n—Ivrelya, Dimir-Meisterspionin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643372&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2295bed9-0153-4f2f-820a-35ea9227fbbd\', \'multiverseId\': 643372}, \'multiverseid\': 643372}, {\'name\': \'Destripar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sí, seguro que tus amigos de la Legión te están buscando. Cuando hayamos escondido una parte de ti en cada distrito, podrán buscarte durante mucho más tiempo".\\n—Ivrelya, maestra de espías dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14be3cdf-3b36-4417-94b4-10946a503940\', \'multiverseId\': 643663}, \'multiverseid\': 643663}, {\'name\': \'Éviscération\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana de X.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu as raison. Je suis sûre que tes amis de la Légion te cherchent. Et une fois que nous aurons caché une partie de ton corps dans chaque circonscription, ils continueront à te chercher longtemps. »\\n—Ivrelya, maîtresse-espionne de Dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f4aa41-75e2-4b75-9d1c-bd66b658a6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 643954}, \'multiverseid\': 643954}, {\'name\': \'Sbudellare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con valore di mana X.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai ragione. I tuoi amici della Legione sicuramente ti stanno cercando. E quando avremo nascosto un pezzo di te in ogni distretto, continueranno a cercare a lungo."\\n—Ivrelya, capospia Dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99c41c5b-352c-4bfe-bde0-e430a5e446cd\', \'multiverseId\': 644245}, \'multiverseid\': 644245}, {\'name\': \'腹わた抜き\', \'text\': \'マナ総量がＸであるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ああ、そうね。軍団のお仲間さんはあなたを必死こいて探しているわ。あなたを各地区にばらまいたら、それを根気よく集めてくれるわよ。」\\n――ディミーアの密偵長、イヴレーリャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038a7b5c-2269-4c38-91d2-3cdd0d7007eb\', \'multiverseId\': 644536}, \'multiverseid\': 644536}, {\'name\': \'Estripar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com valor de mana igual a X.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Tem razão. Com certeza os seus amigos da Legião estão procurando você. E quando a gente tiver escondido um pedaço seu em cada distrito eles vão continuar procurando por um bom tempo."\\n— Ivrelya, espiã-mestre Dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c02b62-b6b4-44f2-a3da-577daf83d970\', \'multiverseId\': 644827}, \'multiverseid\': 644827}, {\'name\': \'开膛剖腹\', \'text\': \'消灭目标法术力值为X的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「没错，你的教团战友一定都在找寻你的下落。待把你分散藏到各区之后，他们就有得好找了。」\\n～底密尔间谍大师依蕾娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e938e11f-5f13-49e4-9641-aff4520df5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 645118}, \'multiverseid\': 645118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Eintreiberin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Azorius-Eintreiberin ins Spiel kommt, inhaftiere eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann jene Kreatur nicht angreifen oder blocken und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast das Recht zu schweigen. Vor allem, weil ich deiner Ausflüchte müde werde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643303&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ce26da0-72d9-4a58-9953-365edbade75d\', \'multiverseId\': 643303}, \'multiverseid\': 643303}, {\'name\': \'Encarceladora azoria\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Encarceladora azoria entre al campo de batalla, detén la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esa criatura no puede atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tienes derecho a guardar silencio. Más que nada porque me cansan tus excusas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b181319-1af4-4837-9768-c1ec52e733d9\', \'multiverseId\': 643594}, \'multiverseid\': 643594}, {\'name\': "Courtière d\'Azorius", \'text\': "Quand la Courtière d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, détenez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Vous avez le droit de garder le silence. Essentiellement parce que je suis lasse d\'entendre vos excuses. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c606d51e-3175-4f4e-bcd9-9adc30759c32\', \'multiverseId\': 643885}, \'multiverseid\': 643885}, {\'name\': \'Polizia Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando la Polizia Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, trattieni una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quella creatura non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai il diritto di rimanere in silenzio. Principalmente perché le chiacchiere mi annoiano."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ab8261c-9b79-46d9-84ac-b8efd91e69ca\', \'multiverseId\': 644176}, \'multiverseid\': 644176}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの拘引者\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの拘引者が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを留置する。（次のあなたのターンまで、そのクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたには黙秘権があります。言い訳をうだうだ聞かされたくないので。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435a9990-5421-4a09-84b9-5c05eb5d00ee\', \'multiverseId\': 644467}, \'multiverseid\': 644467}, {\'name\': \'Encarceradora Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando Encarceradora Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, detenha a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. (Até o seu próximo turno, aquela criatura não pode atacar nem bloquear e as habilidades ativadas dela não podem ser ativadas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Você tem o direito de permanecer em silêncio. Principalmente porque cansei de suas desculpas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4cea7cc-a07c-4bf9-b8f3-c89d9fb81703\', \'multiverseId\': 644758}, \'multiverseid\': 644758}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立逮捕人\', \'text\': \'当俄佐立逮捕人进战场时，拘留目标由对手操控的生物。（直到你的下一个回合，该生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「你有权保持缄默。主要是因为我懒得听你找藉口。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51690c54-6526-4f9a-b450-ca8adc11dd83\', \'multiverseId\': 645049}, \'multiverseid\': 645049}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Azorius-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Betritt den Senat, die Welt der Justiz, wo einst Ravnicas Grundstein gelegt wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95fa6c63-4975-4e94-8224-a672bf07a6ab\', \'multiverseId\': 643570}, \'multiverseid\': 643570}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Azorio\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete al Senado, la sede de la justicia y base de la sociedad de Rávnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b661e6b-5866-4018-a052-4adaff7b0e19\', \'multiverseId\': 643861}, \'multiverseid\': 643861}, {\'name\': "Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain — porte\', \'flavor\': \'Entrez au Sénat, siège de la justice et fondation de la société ravnicane.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a479b26-8236-46fe-9cdd-d2f90de2b5de\', \'multiverseId\': 644152}, \'multiverseid\': 644152}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrate nel Senato, la sede della giustizia e il fondamento della società di Ravnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77b99682-70bb-46fe-99bd-c312fd9d9fee\', \'multiverseId\': 644443}, \'multiverseid\': 644443}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'ラヴニカ社会の礎、正義のやどるところ、評議会はこの中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16572d67-c38e-46e7-9365-03170fc756b2\', \'multiverseId\': 644734}, \'multiverseid\': 644734}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Entrem no Senado, sede da justiça e alicerce da sociedade ravnicana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0a51905-c00c-4dfe-addc-0bc616177e8c\', \'multiverseId\': 645025}, \'multiverseid\': 645025}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立公会门\', \'text\': \'俄佐立公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}。\', \'type\': \'地 — 门\', \'flavor\': \'此门通往参议院，拉尼卡天空下的正义础石。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'960d2b83-9c50-4c65-b04e-d41e9f27c5ce\', \'multiverseId\': 645316}, \'multiverseid\': 645316}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Azorius-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Betritt den Senat, die Welt der Justiz, wo einst Ravnicas Grundstein gelegt wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be25c003-62e8-4543-aebe-dc6f09617612\', \'multiverseId\': 645607}, \'multiverseid\': 645607}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Azorio\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete al Senado, la sede de la justicia y base de la sociedad de Rávnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'139b66ef-ee30-4ed0-a118-929e5d9eb3a3\', \'multiverseId\': 645721}, \'multiverseid\': 645721}, {\'name\': "Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain — porte\', \'flavor\': \'Entrez au Sénat, siège de la justice et fondation de la société ravnicane.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a2f5eea-2266-4771-ae49-8d299434ff36\', \'multiverseId\': 645835}, \'multiverseid\': 645835}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrate nel Senato, la sede della giustizia e il fondamento della società di Ravnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f75e9605-33ce-4808-8820-56da964851b7\', \'multiverseId\': 645949}, \'multiverseid\': 645949}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'ラヴニカ社会の礎、正義のやどるところ、評議会はこの中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35d07761-b8dc-4cd9-ae01-4320736f7a11\', \'multiverseId\': 646063}, \'multiverseid\': 646063}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Entrem no Senado, sede da justiça e alicerce da sociedade ravnicana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e74edd-b366-475f-8664-a58c76d8e8c1\', \'multiverseId\': 646177}, \'multiverseid\': 646177}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立公会门\', \'text\': \'俄佐立公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}。\', \'type\': \'地 — 门\', \'flavor\': \'此门通往参议院，拉尼卡天空下的正义础石。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a80bc26b-47be-466f-afc7-a728789179b0\', \'multiverseId\': 646291}, \'multiverseid\': 646291}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Gildenmagier\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{2}{U}: Neutralisiere eine aktivierte Fähigkeit deiner Wahl. (Manafähigkeiten können nicht als Ziel gewählt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff91789f-33af-43de-81b0-ceaf2da5d87f\', \'multiverseId\': 643463}, \'multiverseid\': 643463}, {\'name\': \'Maga del Gremio Azorio\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}: Gira la criatura objetivo.\\n{2}{U}: Contrarresta la habilidad activada objetivo. (Las habilidades de maná no pueden hacerse objetivo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1dfbd60-9fd6-49ee-b467-3eeb9fc9ca1d\', \'multiverseId\': 643754}, \'multiverseid\': 643754}, {\'name\': "Ghildmage d\'Azorius", \'text\': \'{2}{W} : Engagez une créature ciblée.\\n{2}{U} : Contrecarrez une capacité activée ciblée. (Les capacités de mana ne peuvent pas être ciblées.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — vedalken et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644045&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b63bbde-ad52-456e-bdc4-ae803bd389d8\', \'multiverseId\': 644045}, \'multiverseid\': 644045}, {\'name\': \'Maga della Gilda Azorius\', \'text\': "{2}{W}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\\n{2}{U}: Neutralizza un\'abilità attivata bersaglio. (Le abilità di mana non possono essere bersagliate.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c32f63af-47a9-4b1f-85fc-ea1c710e7948\', \'multiverseId\': 644336}, \'multiverseid\': 644336}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスのギルド魔道士\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\\n{2}{U}：起動型能力１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。（マナ能力は対象にできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ebd8b8-63ea-4df2-9f27-ae1bba364b50\', \'multiverseId\': 644627}, \'multiverseid\': 644627}, {\'name\': \'Maga da Guilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}: Vire a criatura alvo.\\n{2}{U}: Anule a habilidade ativada alvo. (As habilidades de mana não podem ser alvo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f726f73f-9b4c-499e-920d-512a77b26476\', \'multiverseId\': 644918}, \'multiverseid\': 644918}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立公会法师\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}：横置目标生物。\\n{2}{U}：反击目标起动式异能。（其目标不能是法术力异能。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 维多肯／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'932a5734-7d3f-4852-b8b2-36cbb82eb648\', \'multiverseId\': 645209}, \'multiverseid\': 645209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Justiziarin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Azorius-Justiziarin ins Spiel kommt, inhaftiere bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die deine Gegner kontrollieren. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug können jene Kreaturen nicht angreifen oder blocken und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Potential zum Begehen einer Straftat bedarf weiterer Nachforschungen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643304&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21ddbc3-2610-40e2-9e03-8e17c1138cbd\', \'multiverseId\': 643304}, \'multiverseid\': 643304}, {\'name\': \'Justiciar azorio\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Justiciar azorio entre al campo de batalla, detén hasta dos criaturas objetivo que controlan tus oponentes. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esas criaturas no pueden atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu potencial para cometer un crimen justifica una investigación más a fondo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b41c58d-a54e-46a0-b7ac-ad7698c80d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 643595}, \'multiverseid\': 643595}, {\'name\': "Justicière d\'Azorius", \'text\': "Quand la Justicière d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, détenez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées que vos adversaires contrôlent. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures ne peuvent ni attaquer ni bloquer et leurs capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« L\'éventualité que vous commettiez un crime mérite une enquête plus approfondie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643886&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a332e38-3023-4df0-b236-e7f7b7a1038f\', \'multiverseId\': 643886}, \'multiverseid\': 643886}, {\'name\': \'Magistrato Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando il Magistrato Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, trattieni fino a due creature bersaglio controllate dai tuoi avversari. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature non possono attaccare o bloccare e le loro abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La possibilità che tu commetta un crimine ci autorizza a compiere ulteriori indagini."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'142c4afb-9c40-424d-b8f5-566337c64bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 644177}, \'multiverseid\': 644177}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大司法官\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大司法官が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらを留置する。（次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それらの起動型能力は起動できない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたが犯罪をおかす可能性を考えると、更なる取り調べが必要のようです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62291857-d26c-4a40-bf5f-4d5ee467b1f0\', \'multiverseId\': 644468}, \'multiverseid\': 644468}, {\'name\': \'Justiciar Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando Justiciar Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, detenha até duas criaturas alvo que seus oponentes controlam. (Até seu próximo turno, aquelas criaturas não podem atacar nem bloquear e as habilidades ativadas delas não podem ser ativadas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Seu potencial para cometer crimes legitima maiores investigações."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9665a985-60c0-42fe-b8f3-8e681ebe8caf\', \'multiverseId\': 644759}, \'multiverseid\': 644759}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立大司法\', \'text\': \'当俄佐立大司法进战场时，拘留至多两个目标由对手操控的生物。（直到你的下一个回合，这些生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你有犯罪的可能性，因此有必要进一步调查。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e26f4c-baee-44d2-9a52-bd5ab05b8abf\', \'multiverseId\': 645050}, \'multiverseid\': 645050}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist wie ein Labyrinth gestaltet und verkörpert damit die Rechtsprechung der Azorius — eine feste Struktur, die viel aushalten kann und Veränderungen verhindern soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1fcd75-11bb-4a82-907a-f8bc7ba0b20a\', \'multiverseId\': 643548}, \'multiverseid\': 643548}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Azorius", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le motif labyrinthique représente la base de la loi d\'Azorius — une structure stricte conçue pour briser les volontés et nuire à l\'évolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644130&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8a109e6-e30e-42fd-8fa4-4dac43540877\', \'multiverseId\': 644130}, \'multiverseid\': 644130}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Lo stile labirintico rappresenta l\'essenza della legge Azorius: una rigida struttura progettata per mettere alla prova la determinazione e per impedire i cambiamenti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a4c9dc-ddf2-45df-b25f-629ff1422428\', \'multiverseId\': 644421}, \'multiverseid\': 644421}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'迷路のような文様は、アゾリウスの法の中核を具現化している。意志を試し、変化を止める厳格な構造だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c14708-cf54-45a2-9760-1570458670c8\', \'multiverseId\': 644712}, \'multiverseid\': 644712}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seu desenho labiríntico expressa os fundamentos da lei Azorius, uma estrutura rígida projetada para testar a determinação e procrastinar mudanças.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'525463b9-6f98-41a0-b55b-010e0ae446fb\', \'multiverseId\': 645003}, \'multiverseid\': 645003}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{W}{U}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'这迷宫般的设计具现了俄佐立法律的核心精神～用来试练意志、延缓变化的精密结构。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58534f6c-bfcd-45bc-8495-7007bfcbb315\', \'multiverseId\': 645294}, \'multiverseid\': 645294}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balustradenspion\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Balustradenspion ins Spiel kommt, deckt ein Spieler deiner Wahl Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Länderkarte aufdeckt, dann legt er die Karten auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a282744d-4893-44d1-bcd5-55441d12205d\', \'multiverseId\': 643364}, \'multiverseid\': 643364}, {\'name\': \'Espía de la balaustrada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Espía de la balaustrada entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de tierra, luego pone esas cartas en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b16532da-983e-473a-a5b9-a79a44d369f3\', \'multiverseId\': 643655}, \'multiverseid\': 643655}, {\'name\': \'Espion de balustrade\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Espion de balustrade arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte de terrain, puis il met ces cartes dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11890b11-6429-42e9-8091-905901024a9f\', \'multiverseId\': 643946}, \'multiverseid\': 643946}, {\'name\': \'Spia della Balaustra\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Spia della Balaustra entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio rivela carte dalla cima del suo grimorio fino a che non rivela una carta terra, poi mette quelle carte nel suo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'389f94cb-ce0a-4e1f-8191-b05dac2408c6\', \'multiverseId\': 644237}, \'multiverseid\': 644237}, {\'name\': \'欄干のスパイ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n欄干のスパイが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、土地・カード１枚が公開されるまで自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していき、その後、それらの公開されたカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2038d0-9335-4a2e-8812-6e9f17dc08a9\', \'multiverseId\': 644528}, \'multiverseid\': 644528}, {\'name\': \'Espião de Balaustrada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Espião de Balaustrada entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até revelar um card de terreno. Depois, ele coloca aqueles cards no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d4f921c-707b-40b3-b099-210ef134e543\', \'multiverseId\': 644819}, \'multiverseid\': 644819}, {\'name\': \'栏外探子\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当栏外探子进战场时，目标牌手从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张地牌为止，然后将这些牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3685b20-ba9d-4f2f-843b-f7c0fbf6a2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 645110}, \'multiverseid\': 645110}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basilikawachen\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nAbnötigen (Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du {W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Niemand darf passieren, … ohne zu zahlen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643305&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bdc441-9c9b-4164-8ff7-275666fce7b2\', \'multiverseId\': 643305}, \'multiverseid\': 643305}, {\'name\': \'Guardias de la basílica\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nExtorsionar. (Siempre que lances un hechizo, puedes pagar {W/B}. Si lo haces, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas esa cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No pasará nadie… gratis".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21df06ac-a1a0-4fca-bc0a-ef74a3f3268c\', \'multiverseId\': 643596}, \'multiverseid\': 643596}, {\'name\': \'Gardes de la basilique\', \'text\': \'Défenseur\\nExtorsion (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez payer {W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez autant de points de vie.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Personne ne passe... sans payer. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96eecaf5-7c2a-46bf-ab20-6460a062c196\', \'multiverseId\': 643887}, \'multiverseid\': 643887}, {\'name\': \'Guardie della Basilica\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nEstorsione (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, puoi pagare {W/B}. Se lo fai, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni altrettanti punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nessuno può passare... gratis."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba2c629-879d-4ff8-ad2e-5bf4797f307d\', \'multiverseId\': 644178}, \'multiverseid\': 644178}, {\'name\': \'聖堂の護衛\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n強請（あなたが呪文１つを唱えるたび、{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ここは通さん……無料では。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26498407-3cbd-4476-a68c-c823ffa8a0e9\', \'multiverseId\': 644469}, \'multiverseid\': 644469}, {\'name\': \'Guardas da Basílica\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nExtorquir (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, você pode pagar {W/B}. Se fizer isso, cada oponente perderá 1 ponto de vida e você ganhará uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ninguém passará... de graça."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce33348-2f39-4170-8972-ba5f636f15c6\', \'multiverseId\': 644760}, \'multiverseid\': 644760}, {\'name\': \'大教堂守卫\', \'text\': \'守军\\n敲诈（每当你施放咒语时，你可以支付{W/B}。若你如此作，则每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「无人可以…通过而不付代价。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d259ee3a-f2fd-4459-94f0-64845761d32f\', \'multiverseId\': 645051}, \'multiverseid\': 645051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beharrliche Bittsteller\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt eine Karte. (Er legt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.)\\nTappe vier ungetappte Berater, die du kontrollierst: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt zwölf Karten.\\nEin Deck kann eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten namens Beharrliche Bittsteller enthalten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7bfb796-37cc-4a7d-b861-f56b20332090\', \'multiverseId\': 643351}, \'multiverseid\': 643351}, {\'name\': \'Suplicantes insistentes\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: El jugador objetivo muele una carta. (Pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.)\\nGirar cuatro Consejeros enderezados que controlas: El jugador objetivo muele doce cartas.\\nUn mazo puede tener cualquier cantidad de cartas llamadas Suplicantes insistentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89446c60-e6e9-480b-9cff-218f0c67d432\', \'multiverseId\': 643642}, \'multiverseid\': 643642}, {\'name\': \'Pétitionnaires tenaces\', \'text\': "{1},{T} : Un joueur ciblé meule une carte. (Il met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.)\\nEngagez quatre conseillers dégagés que vous contrôlez : Un joueur ciblé meule douze cartes.\\nUn deck peut contenir n\'importe quel nombre de cartes appelées Pétitionnaires tenaces.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f44be838-af9b-4d3d-b8d9-bedd91dc2058\', \'multiverseId\': 643933}, \'multiverseid\': 643933}, {\'name\': \'Postulanti Ostinati\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Un giocatore bersaglio macina una carta. (Mette nel suo cimitero la prima carta del suo grimorio.)\\nTAPpa quattro Consiglieri STAPpati che controlli: Un giocatore bersaglio macina dodici carte.\\nUn mazzo può avere un qualsiasi numero di carte chiamate Postulanti Ostinati.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85d6afc6-ef50-4872-a2b3-981f857a594c\', \'multiverseId\': 644224}, \'multiverseid\': 644224}, {\'name\': \'しつこい請願者\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を切削する。（そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を自分の墓地に置く。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のアドバイザー４体をタップする：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード12枚を切削する。\\nデッキに「しつこい請願者」という名前のカードを何枚入れてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3bde04-f867-4b3a-a315-1b1804cdcbec\', \'multiverseId\': 644515}, \'multiverseid\': 644515}, {\'name\': \'Peticionários Persistentes\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: O jogador alvo tritura um card. (Ele coloca o card do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.)\\nVire quatro Conselheiros desvirados que você controla: O jogador alvo tritura doze cards.\\nUm deck pode conter um número qualquer de cards com o nome Peticionários Persistentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fdcd2f9-7d44-434a-b6da-18f0f18eee00\', \'multiverseId\': 644806}, \'multiverseid\': 644806}, {\'name\': \'执着诉愿人\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：目标牌手磨一张牌。（该牌手将其牌库顶的牌置入其坟墓场。）\\n横置四个由你操控且未横置的参谋：目标牌手磨十二张牌。\\n名称为执着诉愿人的牌，在套牌中的数量不受限制。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7c8fb4-aada-47ed-b7eb-aeb33b973593\', \'multiverseId\': 645097}, \'multiverseid\': 645097}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beharrliche Bittsteller\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt eine Karte.\\nTappe vier ungetappte Berater, die du kontrollierst: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt zwölf Karten.\\nEin Deck kann eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten namens Beharrliche Bittsteller enthalten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0f6bd4d-9c7d-424e-a6b4-65e20d4f99c4\', \'multiverseId\': 645527}, \'multiverseid\': 645527}, {\'name\': \'Suplicantes insistentes\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: El jugador objetivo muele una carta.\\nGirar cuatro Consejeros enderezados que controlas: El jugador objetivo muele doce cartas.\\nUn mazo puede tener cualquier cantidad de cartas llamadas Suplicantes insistentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc447f38-a187-4372-8c00-00da1bc1c411\', \'multiverseId\': 645641}, \'multiverseid\': 645641}, {\'name\': \'Pétitionnaires tenaces\', \'text\': "{1},{T} : Un joueur ciblé meule une carte.\\nEngagez quatre conseillers dégagés que vous contrôlez : Un joueur ciblé meule douze cartes.\\nUn deck peut contenir n\'importe quel nombre de cartes appelées Pétitionnaires tenaces.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645755&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb455bc8-ccff-4bf1-95a9-393b203c5d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 645755}, \'multiverseid\': 645755}, {\'name\': \'Postulanti Ostinati\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Un giocatore bersaglio macina una carta.\\nTAPpa quattro Consiglieri STAPpati che controlli: Un giocatore bersaglio macina dodici carte.\\nUn mazzo può avere un qualsiasi numero di carte chiamate Postulanti Ostinati.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf7c51f-d79f-4b50-a65a-d1cd65f789a5\', \'multiverseId\': 645869}, \'multiverseid\': 645869}, {\'name\': \'しつこい請願者\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を切削する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のアドバイザー４体をタップする：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード12枚を切削する。\\nデッキに「しつこい請願者」という名前のカードを何枚入れてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83494f41-7b0b-4522-91dd-6a4ae253b8c9\', \'multiverseId\': 645983}, \'multiverseid\': 645983}, {\'name\': \'Peticionários Persistentes\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: O jogador alvo tritura um card.\\nVire quatro Conselheiros desvirados que você controla: O jogador alvo tritura doze cards.\\nUm deck pode conter um número qualquer de cards com o nome Peticionários Persistentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ddda7b0-d920-43bd-a6b3-098c3cbfa642\', \'multiverseId\': 646097}, \'multiverseid\': 646097}, {\'name\': \'执着诉愿人\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：目标牌手磨一张牌。\\n横置四个由你操控且未横置的参谋：目标牌手磨十二张牌。\\n名称为执着诉愿人的牌，在套牌中的数量不受限制。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0763ab82-cbe5-40da-9670-e544de540c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 646211}, \'multiverseid\': 646211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerung durch Türme\', \'text\': \'Reproduktion {1}{R} (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du seine Reproduktionskosten bezahlst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.)\\nEin Gebirge deiner Wahl wird zu einer 3/1 Kreatur. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18fe31aa-1b48-4bd4-82b6-efe4a967a3dc\', \'multiverseId\': 643421}, \'multiverseid\': 643421}, {\'name\': \'Asedio de las torres\', \'text\': \'Reproducir {1}{R}. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada vez que pagaste su coste de reproducir. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\\nLa montaña objetivo se convierte en una criatura 3/1. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d987c928-60b8-4c42-8d55-c9942a27f081\', \'multiverseId\': 643712}, \'multiverseid\': 643712}, {\'name\': \'Assiégé par les tours\', \'text\': "Duplication {1}{R} (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez payé son coût de duplication. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.)\\nUne montagne ciblée devient une créature 3/1. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644003&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2b16a16-ed75-429c-a6bb-1313134a8037\', \'multiverseId\': 644003}, \'multiverseid\': 644003}, {\'name\': \'Assedio delle Torri\', \'text\': \'Replicare {1}{R} (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni volta che hai pagato il suo costo di replica. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.)\\nUna Montagna bersaglio diventa una creatura 3/1. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f10426-98d0-42cf-a141-465e51050bb7\', \'multiverseId\': 644294}, \'multiverseid\': 644294}, {\'name\': \'塔の包囲\', \'text\': \'複製{1}{R}（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたがこれの複製コストを支払った回数１回につき１回、これをコピーする。それらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\\n山１つを対象とする。それは３/１のクリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b460261e-d0c9-4a3f-9a98-a15ecf35fa58\', \'multiverseId\': 644585}, \'multiverseid\': 644585}, {\'name\': \'Cerco de Torres\', \'text\': \'Replicar {1}{R} (Quando você conjurar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada vez que tiver pago seu custo de replicação. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)\\nA Montanha alvo torna-se uma criatura 3/1. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c08f9893-a99f-403f-88a4-0af7f74d082a\', \'multiverseId\': 644876}, \'multiverseid\': 644876}, {\'name\': \'众塔围城\', \'text\': \'覆诵{1}{R}（当你施放此咒语时，每支付一次覆诵费用，就可以将它复制一次。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。）\\n目标山脉成为3/1生物。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3532714e-ef45-492c-8da6-76b38d16a37a\', \'multiverseId\': 645167}, \'multiverseid\': 645167}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungswurm\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Die Gefahr überwog den Reiz des Angebots.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643453&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69026c5d-3aa3-414b-bf07-2cf9820670cd\', \'multiverseId\': 643453}, \'multiverseid\': 643453}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe de asedio\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nArrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'De repente, regatear no parecía tan importante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd4717c-3bb5-4509-a78d-12362959da18\', \'multiverseId\': 643744}, \'multiverseid\': 643744}, {\'name\': \'Guivre de siège\', \'text\': \'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nPiétinement\', \'type\': \'Créature — guivre\', \'flavor\': \'Marchander ne semblait tout à coup plus aussi important.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644035&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bd84aa7-8bc4-4099-8a20-c460771d2e05\', \'multiverseId\': 644035}, \'multiverseid\': 644035}, {\'name\': \'Wurm da Assedio\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nTravolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': "All\'improvviso, le contrattazioni non sembrarono più tanto importanti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32089d1c-d321-47d2-a4e7-238488e44cc9\', \'multiverseId\': 644326}, \'multiverseid\': 644326}, {\'name\': \'包囲ワーム\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nトランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'突如として、すべての値切りはどうでもいいものになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5d749f-e628-4af5-9dfe-271125da51ce\', \'multiverseId\': 644617}, \'multiverseid\': 644617}, {\'name\': \'Vorme de Cerco\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nAtropelar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'De repente, a pechinchada toda não parecia mais tão importante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259aaa42-bb04-47f0-bd1d-33b2f1eaae34\', \'multiverseId\': 644908}, \'multiverseid\': 644908}, {\'name\': \'攻城亚龙\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n践踏\', \'type\': \'生物 — 亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'突然间，什么买卖都不重要了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'406dd8e6-adc7-407c-8f3e-1384d3d9208b\', \'multiverseId\': 645199}, \'multiverseid\': 645199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschleunigen\', \'text\': \'Die nächste Hexerei, die du in diesem Zug wirkst, kann gewirkt werden, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätte.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ein talentierter Izzet-Chronarch kann einen ganzen Rachefeldzug mit epischen Ausmaßen durchführen, während ein einzelnes Sandkorn durch die Sanduhr rutscht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643355&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5508a400-9df0-4623-ab58-5d60fe18608b\', \'multiverseId\': 643355}, \'multiverseid\': 643355}, {\'name\': \'Apresurar\', \'text\': \'El próximo hechizo de conjuro que lances este turno puede ser lanzado como si tuviera la habilidad de destello.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un cronarca ízzet hábil puede resolver una vendetta épica entre la caída de dos granos de un reloj de arena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'008c529f-7ae4-4beb-939b-dbeb5810b1f6\', \'multiverseId\': 643646}, \'multiverseid\': 643646}, {\'name\': \'Promptitude\', \'text\': "Le prochain sort de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci peut être lancé comme s\'il avait le flash.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Un chronarque izzet expérimenté peut mener une vendetta entre la chute d\'un grain de sable et celle du suivant dans un sablier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643937&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a8ec25-b50e-4b1d-a460-4acc5e7b6fd8\', \'multiverseId\': 643937}, \'multiverseid\': 643937}, {\'name\': \'Velocizzare\', \'text\': \'La prossima magia stregoneria che lanci in questo turno può essere lanciata come se avesse lampo.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Un cronarca Izzet esperto è in grado di portare a termine un\'epica vendetta nell\'istante che separa la caduta di due granelli di sabbia nella clessidra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f022feb4-3176-4b5f-9089-176ee9612b54\', \'multiverseId\': 644228}, \'multiverseid\': 644228}, {\'name\': \'急かし\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたが次に唱えるソーサリー・呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'熟練のイゼットの時術師は、砂時計の砂が一粒落ちる間に、大々的な復讐を実行することができる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bcad22a-49d4-4e98-879d-4ba21daa611b\', \'multiverseId\': 644519}, \'multiverseid\': 644519}, {\'name\': \'Acelerar\', \'text\': \'O próximo feitiço que você conjurar neste turno poderá ser conjurado como se tivesse lampejo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Um cronarca Izzet habilidoso é capaz de realizar uma vendeta épica entre o cair de um grão de uma ampulheta e outro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53424592-cb1d-4dfb-a5d4-3e48de89b6e4\', \'multiverseId\': 644810}, \'multiverseid\': 644810}, {\'name\': \'加快\', \'text\': \'你本回合中施放的下一个法术咒语能视同具有闪现异能地来施放。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'技艺纯熟的伊捷时法师，能在沙漏两粒沙落下的时间差里完成一回壮绝复仇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8a5d5b-5bd8-43e7-9563-6458d5f69c40\', \'multiverseId\': 645101}, \'multiverseid\': 645101}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschleunigen\', \'text\': \'Die nächste Hexerei, die du in diesem Zug wirkst, kann gewirkt werden, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätte.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ein talentierter Izzet-Chronarch kann einen ganzen Rachefeldzug mit epischen Ausmaßen durchführen, während ein einzelnes Sandkorn durch die Sanduhr rutscht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7505d4f7-107f-489e-b006-1560393c5af3\', \'multiverseId\': 645529}, \'multiverseid\': 645529}, {\'name\': \'Apresurar\', \'text\': \'El próximo hechizo de conjuro que lances este turno puede ser lanzado como si tuviera la habilidad de destello.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un cronarca ízzet hábil puede resolver una vendetta épica entre la caída de dos granos de un reloj de arena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02fbf336-a787-4df2-aa19-f086f81b7cbf\', \'multiverseId\': 645643}, \'multiverseid\': 645643}, {\'name\': \'Promptitude\', \'text\': "Le prochain sort de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci peut être lancé comme s\'il avait le flash.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Un chronarque izzet expérimenté peut mener une vendetta entre la chute d\'un grain de sable et celle du suivant dans un sablier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645757&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f828896c-1a13-45f2-82ef-70cd10a34a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 645757}, \'multiverseid\': 645757}, {\'name\': \'Velocizzare\', \'text\': \'La prossima magia stregoneria che lanci in questo turno può essere lanciata come se avesse lampo.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Un cronarca Izzet esperto è in grado di portare a termine un\'epica vendetta nell\'istante che separa la caduta di due granelli di sabbia nella clessidra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'972fe27a-0986-4af8-8a3f-4c38bd7abeb5\', \'multiverseId\': 645871}, \'multiverseid\': 645871}, {\'name\': \'急かし\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたが次に唱えるソーサリー・呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'熟練のイゼットの時術師は、砂時計の砂が一粒落ちる間に、大々的な復讐を実行することができる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d559f1fc-0388-43ad-9d47-7b9bc60d581b\', \'multiverseId\': 645985}, \'multiverseid\': 645985}, {\'name\': \'Acelerar\', \'text\': \'O próximo feitiço que você conjurar neste turno poderá ser conjurado como se tivesse lampejo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Um cronarca Izzet habilidoso é capaz de realizar uma vendeta épica entre o cair de um grão de uma ampulheta e outro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cccc9aa3-d06b-42ad-bf6e-65dc1fcaec61\', \'multiverseId\': 646099}, \'multiverseid\': 646099}, {\'name\': \'加快\', \'text\': \'你本回合中施放的下一个法术咒语能视同具有闪现异能地来施放。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'技艺纯熟的伊捷时法师，能在沙漏两粒沙落下的时间差里完成一回壮绝复仇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66927a75-587c-4af1-af1f-5e648445b167\', \'multiverseId\': 646213}, \'multiverseid\': 646213}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewohnerin der Schattenallee\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere schwarze Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Einschüchtern bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643390&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c4dd536-75cc-405f-94c4-d1ccf3f348a7\', \'multiverseId\': 643390}, \'multiverseid\': 643390}, {\'name\': \'Habitante de la Calle Sombra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura negra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de intimidar hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40f299f-8937-4889-82ac-e5143181351e\', \'multiverseId\': 643681}, \'multiverseid\': 643681}, {\'name\': \'Habitante de la ruelle des Ombres\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature noire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, une créature ciblée acquiert l\'intimidation jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643972&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65ab0716-7008-4d34-a491-6baf0c289ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 643972}, \'multiverseid\': 643972}, {\'name\': \'Abitante di Vicolo delle Ombre\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura nera entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio ha intimidire fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44b83e37-4e48-4945-909e-6adfe63dc857\', \'multiverseId\': 644263}, \'multiverseid\': 644263}, {\'name\': \'影小道の住人\', \'text\': \'これでない黒のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは威嚇を得る。（それはアーティファクト・クリーチャーやそれと共通の色を持つクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8fd2c69-ec1b-492e-b02f-6305853d40ab\', \'multiverseId\': 644554}, \'multiverseid\': 644554}, {\'name\': \'Habitante do Beco das Sombras\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura preta entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo ganha intimidar até o final do turno. (Ela só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas que compartilharem uma cor com ela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8e6c9a5-4ee2-44b4-9eb2-316dd2cae273\', \'multiverseId\': 644845}, \'multiverseid\': 644845}, {\'name\': \'暗影巷居民\', \'text\': \'每当另一个黑色生物在你操控下进战场时，目标生物获得威吓异能直到回合结束。（它只能被神器生物和／或与它有共通颜色的生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520f77bc-fc20-4a85-91a0-67e47fcab203\', \'multiverseId\': 645136}, \'multiverseid\': 645136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Gehorsam\', \'text\': \'Abnötigen (Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du {W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.)\\nArtefakte und Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, kommen getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn deine Knie erst deine Robe verschlissen haben, beginnst du vielleicht zu begreifen, wo dein Platz ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643307&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8be4b30-14b0-49d1-988a-75adebbc5491\', \'multiverseId\': 643307}, \'multiverseid\': 643307}, {\'name\': \'Obediencia ciega\', \'text\': \'Extorsionar. (Siempre que lances un hechizo, puedes pagar {W/B}. Si lo haces, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas esa cantidad de vidas.)\\nLos artefactos y criaturas que controlan tus oponentes entran al campo de batalla girados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Para cuando hayas desgastado la túnica con las rodillas, quizá hayas empezado a entender cuál es tu sitio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'376493a8-12f3-4ead-b465-4fccce066533\', \'multiverseId\': 643598}, \'multiverseid\': 643598}, {\'name\': \'Obéissance aveugle\', \'text\': \'Extorsion (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez payer {W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez autant de points de vie.)\\nLes artefacts et les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand tes genoux auront fini par trouer ta robe, tu auras peut-être commencé à apprendre quel est ton rang. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643889&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d9e6b4-8217-46db-9110-8191aa904a78\', \'multiverseId\': 643889}, \'multiverseid\': 643889}, {\'name\': \'Cieca Obbedienza\', \'text\': \'Estorsione (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, puoi pagare {W/B}. Se lo fai, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni altrettanti punti vita.)\\nGli artefatti e le creature controllati dai tuoi avversari entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando avrai consumato la tunica a forza di inginocchiarti, avrai imparato qual è il tuo posto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'091787bc-db05-4433-8863-f1378b1145cb\', \'multiverseId\': 644180}, \'multiverseid\': 644180}, {\'name\': \'盲従\', \'text\': \'強請（あなたが呪文１つを唱えるたび、{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\\nアーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしているものはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「法衣の膝が抜けるぐらいになってようやく、おのれの卑小さを自覚しはじめると言えよう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f9548f0-3bcc-4d21-91f8-c4abf4166b31\', \'multiverseId\': 644471}, \'multiverseid\': 644471}, {\'name\': \'Obediência Cega\', \'text\': \'Extorquir (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, você pode pagar {W/B}. Se fizer isso, cada oponente perderá 1 ponto de vida e você ganhará uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\\nOs artefatos e as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam entram no campo de batalha virados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando seus joelhos tiverem rasgado seu manto, talvez você terá aprendido qual é o seu lugar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee36bca0-b76d-4a58-95e4-85612bd377a0\', \'multiverseId\': 644762}, \'multiverseid\': 644762}, {\'name\': \'盲目服从\', \'text\': \'敲诈（每当你施放咒语时，你可以支付{W/B}。若你如此作，则每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得等量的生命。）\\n由对手操控的神器与生物须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「跪到长袍磨破时，你就会明白自己的地位到哪里。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'624d2e83-b910-4d07-ad6c-18d2e253b60e\', \'multiverseId\': 645053}, \'multiverseid\': 645053}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Gehorsam\', \'text\': \'Abnötigen\\nArtefakte und Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, kommen getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn deine Knie erst deine Robe verschlissen haben, beginnst du vielleicht zu begreifen, wo dein Platz ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e925ff7c-ce3b-43a2-bbce-e190d9c6abc2\', \'multiverseId\': 645514}, \'multiverseid\': 645514}, {\'name\': \'Obediencia ciega\', \'text\': \'Extorsionar.\\nLos artefactos y criaturas que controlan tus oponentes entran al campo de batalla girados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Para cuando hayas desgastado la túnica con las rodillas, quizá hayas empezado a entender cuál es tu sitio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de80990d-e399-4042-990e-465b8c62637e\', \'multiverseId\': 645628}, \'multiverseid\': 645628}, {\'name\': \'Obéissance aveugle\', \'text\': \'Extorsion\\nLes artefacts et les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand tes genoux auront fini par trouer ta robe, tu auras peut-être commencé à apprendre quel est ton rang. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b844fa6e-3727-4f7b-b592-4a2d7a391444\', \'multiverseId\': 645742}, \'multiverseid\': 645742}, {\'name\': \'Cieca Obbedienza\', \'text\': \'Estorsione\\nGli artefatti e le creature controllati dai tuoi avversari entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando avrai consumato la tunica a forza di inginocchiarti, avrai imparato qual è il tuo posto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3dab56c-a744-4dac-af9f-5c476171c6d0\', \'multiverseId\': 645856}, \'multiverseid\': 645856}, {\'name\': \'盲従\', \'text\': \'強請\\nアーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしているものはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「法衣の膝が抜けるぐらいになってようやく、おのれの卑小さを自覚しはじめると言えよう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5697caa-8067-4be8-acff-0db2a7ae9810\', \'multiverseId\': 645970}, \'multiverseid\': 645970}, {\'name\': \'Obediência Cega\', \'text\': \'Extorquir\\nOs artefatos e as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam entram no campo de batalha virados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando seus joelhos tiverem rasgado seu manto, talvez você terá aprendido qual é o seu lugar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca432844-5185-4466-bce9-252ddc85430c\', \'multiverseId\': 646084}, \'multiverseid\': 646084}, {\'name\': \'盲目服从\', \'text\': \'敲诈\\n由对手操控的神器与生物须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「跪到长袍磨破时，你就会明白自己的地位到哪里。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'743c861b-201a-4b83-a8c6-287f19742af0\', \'multiverseId\': 646198}, \'multiverseid\': 646198}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Jäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSpuk (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, schicke sie ins Exil, sodass sie bei einer Kreatur deiner Wahl spukt.)\\nWenn der Blinde Jäger ins Spiel kommt oder die Kreatur, bei der er spukt, stirbt, verliert ein Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fledermaus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643464&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e21811-843f-4ed1-8250-10641c857ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 643464}, \'multiverseid\': 643464}, {\'name\': \'Cazador ciego\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAcechar. (Cuando esta criatura muera, exíliala acechando a la criatura objetivo.)\\nCuando el Cazador ciego entre al campo de batalla o la criatura a la que está acechando muera, el jugador objetivo pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Murciélago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6abcb8e-1fad-4839-b900-bc3b15e12b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 643755}, \'multiverseid\': 643755}, {\'name\': \'Chasseur aveugle\', \'text\': "Vol\\nHantise (Quand cette créature meurt, exilez-la, hantant une créature ciblée.)\\nQuand le Chasseur aveugle arrive sur le champ de bataille ou que la créature qu\'il hante meurt, un joueur ciblé perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — chauve-souris\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87182726-b970-471c-8d8f-c690c7296d31\', \'multiverseId\': 644046}, \'multiverseid\': 644046}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatore Cieco\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nTormentare (Quando questa creatura muore, esiliala ed essa va a tormentare una creatura bersaglio.)\\nQuando il Cacciatore Cieco entra nel campo di battaglia o la creatura che esso tormenta muore, un giocatore bersaglio perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pipistrello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6177ab8-5b8a-498e-a3ec-a293a602ccd1\', \'multiverseId\': 644337}, \'multiverseid\': 644337}, {\'name\': \'盲目の狩人\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n憑依（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれに憑依している状態で追放する。）\\n盲目の狩人が戦場に出たか、これが憑依しているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コウモリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'603fac3e-7fe9-4dec-9f74-23c9f39f52ff\', \'multiverseId\': 644628}, \'multiverseid\': 644628}, {\'name\': \'Caçador Cego\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAssombrar (Quando esta criatura morrer, exile-a assombrando a criatura alvo.)\\nQuando Caçador Cego entra no campo de batalha ou a criatura que ele assombra morre, o jogador alvo perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Morcego\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f0b312d-7f60-467b-85f3-1737d8540c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 644919}, \'multiverseid\': 644919}, {\'name\': \'盲猎手\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n缠身（当此生物死去时，将它放逐并缠身在目标生物上。）\\n当盲猎手进战场或它所缠身的生物死去时，目标牌手失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c060c6-1bd4-4d0e-8368-96b47d6d3506\', \'multiverseId\': 645210}, \'multiverseid\': 645210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzhelix\', \'text\': \'Die Blitzhelix fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl sie nicht so bekannt wie die Soldaten der Armee sind, werden die Magier-Priester der Boros-Legion von den Unschuldigen respektiert und von den Geistern der Schuldigen gehasst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643495&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'468ca41e-e077-44a4-ace0-897f464c721f\', \'multiverseId\': 643495}, \'multiverseid\': 643495}, {\'name\': \'Hélice de relámpagos\', \'text\': \'La Hélice de relámpagos hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y tú ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque son menos conocidos que su ejército de soldados, los magos-sacerdotes de la Legión Boros son tan respetados por los inocentes como son odiados por los fantasmas de los culpables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836da9d0-56be-4c51-86b6-72b59dedfb66\', \'multiverseId\': 643786}, \'multiverseid\': 643786}, {\'name\': "Hélice d\'éclairs", \'text\': "L\'Hélice d\'éclairs inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Bien que moins connus que ses soldats, les prêtres-mage de la Légion de Boros sont autant respectés par les innocents qu\'ils sont haïs par les fantômes des coupables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644077&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11c69694-fae1-42ac-b117-0e44c5020ca5\', \'multiverseId\': 644077}, \'multiverseid\': 644077}, {\'name\': \'Spirale Fulminante\', \'text\': \'La Spirale Fulminante infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Benché meno conosciuti del suo esercito di soldati, i preti-maghi della Legione Boros sono tanto rispettati dagli innocenti quanto odiati dai fantasmi dei colpevoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e327fa-57bf-426f-85bd-a1daebd56c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 644368}, \'multiverseid\': 644368}, {\'name\': \'稲妻のらせん\', \'text\': \'１つを対象とする。稲妻のらせんはそれに３点のダメージを与え、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'軍団の兵士たちほど有名ではないが、ボロス軍の魔道僧侶は純潔の者に愛され、罪を負った者の霊に嫌われている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6042636-b737-4763-8b44-7d8717f14b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 644659}, \'multiverseid\': 644659}, {\'name\': \'Hélice de Raios\', \'text\': \'Hélice de Raios causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Embora menos conhecidos que seu exército de soldados, os sacerdotes-magos da Legião de Boros são tão respeitados pelos inocentes quanto odiados pelos fantasmas dos culpados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'104943cb-daf0-4fcd-abfc-18ad480fbc6b\', \'multiverseId\': 644950}, \'multiverseid\': 644950}, {\'name\': \'闪电螺旋\', \'text\': \'闪电螺旋对任意一个目标造成3点伤害，且你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'虽然波洛斯教团是以士兵的实力而闻名，但其麾下的法师僧侣也同样受善人敬重，遭恶徒憎厌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d4c039-570d-4679-bfd5-837f1d78d11d\', \'multiverseId\': 645241}, \'multiverseid\': 645241}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzhelix\', \'text\': \'Die Blitzhelix fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl sie nicht so bekannt wie die Soldaten der Armee sind, werden die Magier-Priester der Boros-Legion von den Unschuldigen respektiert und von den Geistern der Schuldigen gehasst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1394b0-c314-4642-9351-2bf79b43a51d\', \'multiverseId\': 645583}, \'multiverseid\': 645583}, {\'name\': \'Hélice de relámpagos\', \'text\': \'La Hélice de relámpagos hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y tú ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque son menos conocidos que su ejército de soldados, los magos-sacerdotes de la Legión Boros son tan respetados por los inocentes como son odiados por los fantasmas de los culpables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eae264e-51d3-43e7-989c-fff54f1e697c\', \'multiverseId\': 645697}, \'multiverseid\': 645697}, {\'name\': "Hélice d\'éclairs", \'text\': "L\'Hélice d\'éclairs inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Bien que moins connus que ses soldats, les prêtres-mage de la Légion de Boros sont autant respectés par les innocents qu\'ils sont haïs par les fantômes des coupables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd2cfb2c-94bd-4c01-bb20-caddc463b4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 645811}, \'multiverseid\': 645811}, {\'name\': \'Spirale Fulminante\', \'text\': \'La Spirale Fulminante infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Benché meno conosciuti del suo esercito di soldati, i preti-maghi della Legione Boros sono tanto rispettati dagli innocenti quanto odiati dai fantasmi dei colpevoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a00d358c-9019-4c17-b91f-6091afcd7f90\', \'multiverseId\': 645925}, \'multiverseid\': 645925}, {\'name\': \'稲妻のらせん\', \'text\': \'１つを対象とする。稲妻のらせんはそれに３点のダメージを与え、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'軍団の兵士たちほど有名ではないが、ボロス軍の魔道僧侶は純潔の者に愛され、罪を負った者の霊に嫌われている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04fab8a1-9e1d-4cfe-be99-eae1efc4928f\', \'multiverseId\': 646039}, \'multiverseid\': 646039}, {\'name\': \'Hélice de Raios\', \'text\': \'Hélice de Raios causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Embora menos conhecidos que seu exército de soldados, os sacerdotes-magos da Legião de Boros são tão respeitados pelos inocentes quanto odiados pelos fantasmas dos culpados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44fa8084-b202-443f-b39a-8166a9f72385\', \'multiverseId\': 646153}, \'multiverseid\': 646153}, {\'name\': \'闪电螺旋\', \'text\': \'闪电螺旋对任意一个目标造成3点伤害，且你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'虽然波洛斯教团是以士兵的实力而闻名，但其麾下的法师僧侣也同样受善人敬重，遭恶徒憎厌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f1bf41-849a-4deb-91df-e160a11ea9f5\', \'multiverseId\': 646267}, \'multiverseid\': 646267}]', "[{'name': 'Blutkrypta', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.)\\nSowie die Blutkrypta ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt sie getappt ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643571&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '680a7a45-ae85-48c2-afea-3190a9f204e8', 'multiverseId': 643571}, 'multiverseid': 643571}, {'name': 'Cripta sangrienta', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.)\\nEn cuanto la Cripta sangrienta entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, entra al campo de batalla girada.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643862&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2de2b1e-021d-4f24-ad7f-bed1416f7d03', 'multiverseId': 643862}, 'multiverseid': 643862}, {'name': 'Crypte de sang', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.)\\nAu moment où la Crypte de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.', 'type': 'Terrain — marais et montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644153&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8bc98c2-3794-4880-bff8-03c259ffce96', 'multiverseId': 644153}, 'multiverseid': 644153}, {'name': 'Cripta di Sangue', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.)\\nMentre la Cripta di Sangue entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644444&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c98d5e91-6320-4956-8b8c-3229124fa114', 'multiverseId': 644444}, 'multiverseid': 644444}, {'name': '血の墓所', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。）\\n血の墓所が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644735&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25a5c047-3ced-41c8-a4c8-b69d852882cc', 'multiverseId': 644735}, 'multiverseid': 644735}, {'name': 'Cripta de Sangue', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.)\\nConforme Cripta de Sangue entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ela entrará no campo de batalha virada.', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645026&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bdb8862-ccf0-4f6a-bfdd-38afdc7b45b5', 'multiverseId': 645026}, 'multiverseid': 645026}, {'name': '血腥墓穴', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}。）\\n于血腥墓穴进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则血腥墓穴须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 — 沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645317&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4201a0fe-d936-4357-b4ed-0ce8b3698e19', 'multiverseId': 645317}, 'multiverseid': 645317}]", "[{'name': 'Blutkrypta', 'text': 'Sowie die Blutkrypta ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt sie getappt ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645608&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02321c0a-080d-44ac-9200-3a9260505967', 'multiverseId': 645608}, 'multiverseid': 645608}, {'name': 'Cripta sangrienta', 'text': 'En cuanto la Cripta sangrienta entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, entra al campo de batalla girada.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645722&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b52ed603-a6f0-44d4-8fc0-5b39babc7d88', 'multiverseId': 645722}, 'multiverseid': 645722}, {'name': 'Crypte de sang', 'text': 'Au moment où la Crypte de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.', 'type': 'Terrain — marais et montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645836&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82f9e131-3da7-4e06-bdf3-ea7036182f66', 'multiverseId': 645836}, 'multiverseid': 645836}, {'name': 'Cripta di Sangue', 'text': 'Mentre la Cripta di Sangue entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645950&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1acaaae6-17a9-494c-945d-63d83510bbb6', 'multiverseId': 645950}, 'multiverseid': 645950}, {'name': '血の墓所', 'text': '血の墓所が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646064&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '315848ac-c5ce-4797-af93-00aff9b43b27', 'multiverseId': 646064}, 'multiverseid': 646064}, {'name': 'Cripta de Sangue', 'text': 'Conforme Cripta de Sangue entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ela entrará no campo de batalha virada.', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646178&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2968cb7d-38b3-4bc8-861b-1345ad151dd8', 'multiverseId': 646178}, 'multiverseid': 646178}, {'name': '血腥墓穴', 'text': '于血腥墓穴进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则血腥墓穴须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 — 沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646292&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d6d3887-b679-43fe-86c6-dc83fd98a86e', 'multiverseId': 646292}, 'multiverseid': 646292}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutpfad-Riese\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nEntfesselt (Du kannst diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommen lassen. Sie kann nicht blocken, solange eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr liegt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn der Star von Juris Revue auftritt, quellen Blut und Zuschauer bis auf die Straße hinaus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643399&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'403e3eff-fc5d-4e3d-9488-5904cbb736b1\', \'multiverseId\': 643399}, \'multiverseid\': 643399}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Sangrelucha\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nDesatar. (Puedes hacer que esta criatura entre al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. No puede bloquear mientras tenga un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Es el artista estrella del elenco de Juri, sus espectáculos tienen admiradores y sangre derramada en las calles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9cd130a-381d-4197-bb19-b7de39a78f03\', \'multiverseId\': 643690}, \'multiverseid\': 643690}, {\'name\': \'Géant rixesang\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nEmportement (Vous pouvez faire arriver cette créature sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle ne peut pas bloquer tant qu\'elle a au moins un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature — géant\', \'flavor\': \'Clou de la Revue de Juri, il attire les foules et fait couler le sang jusque dans la rue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643981&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9acf8dc7-9df7-4d46-89c4-9b10b6f6c58f\', \'multiverseId\': 643981}, \'multiverseid\': 643981}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Rissa Sanguinaria\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nScatenare (Puoi far entrare questa creatura nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1. Non può bloccare fintanto che ha un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'La stella della Rivista di Juri. I suoi spettacoli fanno riversare fan e sangue nelle strade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72ef30e5-3695-421b-b95d-8c820fd9f3c6\', \'multiverseId\': 644272}, \'multiverseid\': 644272}, {\'name\': \'血暴れの巨人\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n解鎖（このクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出してもよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'ジョーリ組のスターである彼のステージでは表通りまで観客と鮮血が溢れかえる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c7f7439-bbb3-4de6-a8bc-6eb147d514aa\', \'multiverseId\': 644563}, \'multiverseid\': 644563}, {\'name\': \'Gigante da Cólera Sanguinária\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nLiberar (Você pode fazer com que esta criatura entre no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1. Ela não poderá bloquear enquanto tiver um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Ele é a estrela da Trupe de Juri, e em seus shows fãs e sangue jorram pela rua.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'212ce426-8bfc-4cd4-ab16-c065962387a4\', \'multiverseId\': 644854}, \'multiverseid\': 644854}, {\'name\': \'血斗巨人\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它便不能进行阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'他是裘里剧团的明星演员，让街上满是剧迷与鲜血。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab0c3678-1bb8-4908-8ad8-936ab1154350\', \'multiverseId\': 645145}, \'multiverseid\': 645145}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterfresser\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn der Blätterfresser ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir kämpfen, um einen Tyrannen zu stoppen, und auch für die sanften Kreaturen, die keine Ahnung haben, was über ihre Welt hereingebrochen ist."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643429&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51cf5c10-076c-42d2-a0a8-ed85d2490ab0\', \'multiverseId\': 643429}, \'multiverseid\': 643429}, {\'name\': \'Herbívoro arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando el Herbívoro arbóreo entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Luchamos para detener a un tirano, pero también por las criaturas inocentes que desconocen lo que amenaza su mundo".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2da89350-e88e-43a8-b61b-85999c489ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 643720}, \'multiverseid\': 643720}, {\'name\': \'Paisseur arboricole\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nQuand le Paisseur arboricole arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain engagée depuis votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature — bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous combattons pour stopper un tyran, mais aussi pour sauver les créatures paisibles qui ne comprennent pas ce qui arrive à leur monde. »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644011&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7847704e-bd15-4e3d-9e79-9d2b85f983aa\', \'multiverseId\': 644011}, \'multiverseid\': 644011}, {\'name\': \'Brucante Arboreo\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nQuando il Brucante Arboreo entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano una carta terra TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Combattiamo per fermare un tiranno, ma lo facciamo anche per le creature indifese che non comprendono cosa stia accadendo al loro mondo."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0fe17a3-50d0-451f-9a21-c0caf38f3972\', \'multiverseId\': 644302}, \'multiverseid\': 644302}, {\'name\': \'樹上の草食獣\', \'text\': \'到達\\n樹上の草食獣が戦場に出たとき、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「暴君を止めるための戦いは、自分の世界に何が起きているか知りもしないおとなしい生き物のためでもあるわ。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca66692c-8070-49af-ae6c-df131cf532a6\', \'multiverseId\': 644593}, \'multiverseid\': 644593}, {\'name\': \'Herbívoro Arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nQuando Herbívoro Arbóreo entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Lutamos para deter um tirano, mas também lutamos pelas amáveis criaturas que não fazem ideia do que está acontecendo com seu mundo."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83fd54e-ed2b-415f-bffd-53c868bef94a\', \'multiverseId\': 644884}, \'multiverseid\': 644884}, {\'name\': \'树栖食草兽\', \'text\': \'延势\\n当树栖食草兽进战场时，你可以将一张地牌从你手上横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「我们为击倒暴君而战斗，同时也为了那些温顺的生物而战斗；它们无法理解是何等灾难降临自己世界。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6547ec55-b402-400c-9070-b35be410f84d\', \'multiverseId\': 645175}, \'multiverseid\': 645175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterfresser\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn der Blätterfresser ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir kämpfen, um einen Tyrannen zu stoppen, und auch für die sanften Kreaturen, die keine Ahnung haben, was über ihre Welt hereingebrochen ist."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e18a1e-7a43-43ec-a6a0-efd3e8d7ab37\', \'multiverseId\': 645554}, \'multiverseid\': 645554}, {\'name\': \'Herbívoro arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando el Herbívoro arbóreo entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Luchamos para detener a un tirano, pero también por las criaturas inocentes que desconocen lo que amenaza su mundo".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c64f6f2-dd86-4291-b0f8-7a94d2e6ae43\', \'multiverseId\': 645668}, \'multiverseid\': 645668}, {\'name\': \'Paisseur arboricole\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nQuand le Paisseur arboricole arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain engagée depuis votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature — bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous combattons pour stopper un tyran, mais aussi pour sauver les créatures paisibles qui ne comprennent pas ce qui arrive à leur monde. »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af847ca8-9c70-49eb-bf18-1969530749e2\', \'multiverseId\': 645782}, \'multiverseid\': 645782}, {\'name\': \'Brucante Arboreo\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nQuando il Brucante Arboreo entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano una carta terra TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Combattiamo per fermare un tiranno, ma lo facciamo anche per le creature indifese che non comprendono cosa stia accadendo al loro mondo."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6a2e6c0-8f79-4048-a6c1-5c139050a846\', \'multiverseId\': 645896}, \'multiverseid\': 645896}, {\'name\': \'樹上の草食獣\', \'text\': \'到達\\n樹上の草食獣が戦場に出たとき、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「暴君を止めるための戦いは、自分の世界に何が起きているか知りもしないおとなしい生き物のためでもあるわ。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d6c67fa-b309-4923-9251-9fed0f478de7\', \'multiverseId\': 646010}, \'multiverseid\': 646010}, {\'name\': \'Herbívoro Arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nQuando Herbívoro Arbóreo entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Lutamos para deter um tirano, mas também lutamos pelas amáveis criaturas que não fazem ideia do que está acontecendo com seu mundo."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e50f3bd4-5198-4b92-b2c1-e821619093cd\', \'multiverseId\': 646124}, \'multiverseid\': 646124}, {\'name\': \'树栖食草兽\', \'text\': \'延势\\n当树栖食草兽进战场时，你可以将一张地牌从你手上横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「我们为击倒暴君而战斗，同时也为了那些温顺的生物而战斗；它们无法理解是何等灾难降临自己世界。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d152f8-418e-48e9-8b3b-7cbbfa188f45\', \'multiverseId\': 646238}, \'multiverseid\': 646238}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bollwerk-Riesin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bollwerk-Riesin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wo ist denn die hergekommen? Und vor allem: Gibt es noch mehr davon?"\\n—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6330dcf3-47a6-4f1d-967c-05ae9619c0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 643309}, \'multiverseid\': 643309}, {\'name\': \'Giganta baluarte\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Giganta baluarte entre al campo de batalla, ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Pero de dónde salió? Y aún más importante: ¿hay otros como ella?".\\n—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3272d653-dd6d-4f52-bccc-15e246bebac7\', \'multiverseId\': 643600}, \'multiverseid\': 643600}, {\'name\': \'Géante des remparts\', \'text\': \'Quand la Géante des remparts arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 5 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature — géant et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« D\'où est-ce qu\'elle sort ? Et surtout, est-ce qu\'il y en a d\'autres comme elle ? »\\n—Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f3563ad-90a8-47f4-8265-a0c6e24c7886\', \'multiverseId\': 643891}, \'multiverseid\': 643891}, {\'name\': \'Gigante del Baluardo\', \'text\': \'Quando la Gigante del Baluardo entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"E lei da dov\\\'è sbucata? Ma soprattutto, ce ne sono altre in giro?"\\n—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f8b6ff6-cd07-4a65-baf4-107f5f207ba3\', \'multiverseId\': 644182}, \'multiverseid\': 644182}, {\'name\': \'防壁の巨人\', \'text\': \'防壁の巨人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「あれはいったいどこから来たんだ？いや、それよりも、あれは他にもいるのか？」\\n――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bf011fa-b6ae-41a4-a50b-cab59db72001\', \'multiverseId\': 644473}, \'multiverseid\': 644473}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Baluarte\', \'text\': \'Quando Gigante Baluarte entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Mas de onde foi que ela saiu? E mais importante, há outros como ela?"\\n— Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'167347dd-ff8a-4b29-8083-250d909299de\', \'multiverseId\': 644764}, \'multiverseid\': 644764}, {\'name\': \'援护巨人\', \'text\': \'当援护巨人进战场时，你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「她从哪来的？更重要的是，还有更多她这样的人吗？」\\n～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd94cc4f-708d-4be6-be09-8ee1ccd39411\', \'multiverseId\': 645055}, \'multiverseid\': 645055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bomberkorps\', \'text\': \'Bataillon — Immer wenn das Bomberkorps und mindestens zwei andere Kreaturen angreifen, fügt das Bomberkorps einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Subtilität ist etwas für Gesetzesmagier und Spione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643400&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c6ef21-2790-4e2c-8d9d-6a85a298e6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 643400}, \'multiverseid\': 643400}, {\'name\': \'Cuerpo de bombarderos\', \'text\': \'Batallón — Siempre que el Cuerpo de bombarderos y al menos otras dos criaturas ataquen, el Cuerpo de bombarderos hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La sutileza es para los magos de la ley y los espías".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3f8de3-74d1-45f7-8dbd-2ec393a4dcaa\', \'multiverseId\': 643691}, \'multiverseid\': 643691}, {\'name\': \'Corps de bombardiers\', \'text\': "Bataillon — À chaque fois que le Corps de bombardiers et au moins deux autres créatures attaquent, le Corps de bombardiers inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« La subtilité, c\'est bon pour les magelois et les espions. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643982&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e48eb942-2392-4110-9cb5-aa2d1c0a46a2\', \'multiverseId\': 643982}, \'multiverseid\': 643982}, {\'name\': \'Bombardiera\', \'text\': \'Battaglione — Ogniqualvolta la Bombardiera e almeno altre due creature attaccano, la Bombardiera infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'astuzia è per i maghi della legge e le spie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d3da0d-137b-4e85-87c4-bf3ac1692c26\', \'multiverseId\': 644273}, \'multiverseid\': 644273}, {\'name\': \'爆弾部隊\', \'text\': \'大隊 ― 爆弾部隊とこれでない２体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、１つを対象とする。爆弾部隊はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「緻密さなんてのは法魔道士やスパイに任せとけばいいのさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb5c088-2f37-4949-8526-234205a70452\', \'multiverseId\': 644564}, \'multiverseid\': 644564}, {\'name\': \'Esquadrão de Bombardeiros\', \'text\': \'Batalhão — Toda vez que Esquadrão de Bombardeiros e pelo menos duas outras criaturas atacarem, Esquadrão de Bombardeiros causará 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"A sutileza é para magos-legistas e espiões."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'584a0793-4360-489e-bf29-d2e634c122f3\', \'multiverseId\': 644855}, \'multiverseid\': 644855}, {\'name\': \'轰炸队\', \'text\': \'协战～每当轰炸队与至少两个其他生物攻击时，轰炸队对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「律法师和间谍才用得到精密细心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6693ed09-d6b6-445b-b64a-b0e94a553339\', \'multiverseId\': 645146}, \'multiverseid\': 645146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Borborygmos in Wut\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn Borborygmos in Wut einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, decke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm alle Länderkarten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\\nWirf eine Länderkarte ab: Borborygmos in Wut fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zyklop\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643465&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc60e6e-1633-44f5-80a3-2bc9c410e880\', \'multiverseId\': 643465}, \'multiverseid\': 643465}, {\'name\': \'Borborygmos furioso\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que Borborygmos furioso haga daño de combate a un jugador, muestra las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas de tierra mostradas de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.\\nDescartar una carta de tierra: Borborygmos furioso hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Cíclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddff5b5-1d6b-4f51-8e37-8b1f8caa57be\', \'multiverseId\': 643756}, \'multiverseid\': 643756}, {\'name\': \'Borborygmos enragé\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que Borborygmos enragé inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, révélez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes de terrain révélées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte de terrain : Borborygmos enragé inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — cyclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78c7a39a-1cd4-4927-80a0-fa9660211797\', \'multiverseId\': 644047}, \'multiverseid\': 644047}, {\'name\': \'Borborygmos Infuriato\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta Borborygmos Infuriato infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, rivela le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte terra rivelate in questo modo e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\\nScarta una carta terra: Borborygmos Infuriato infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c878b8fb-9584-4566-aa4d-bfc2c95211c5\', \'multiverseId\': 644338}, \'multiverseid\': 644338}, {\'name\': \'怒れる腹音鳴らし\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n怒れる腹音鳴らしがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を公開する。これにより公開されたすべての土地・カードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\\n土地・カード１枚を捨てる：１つを対象とする。怒れる腹音鳴らしはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — サイクロプス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c647c3b-3ee1-40dd-b411-66d1d45489f0\', \'multiverseId\': 644629}, \'multiverseid\': 644629}, {\'name\': \'Borborigmo Enfurecido\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Borborigmo Enfurecido causar dano de combate a um jogador, revele os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards de terreno revelados dessa maneira na sua mão e o restante no seu cemitério.\\nDescarte um card de terreno: Borborigmo Enfurecido causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b6a9706-afc1-4834-b58e-f6b490372f89\', \'multiverseId\': 644920}, \'multiverseid\': 644920}, {\'name\': \'盛怒咕噜力莫\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当盛怒咕噜力莫对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，展示你牌库顶的三张牌。将所有以此法展示的地牌置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。\\n弃一张地牌：盛怒咕噜力莫对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 独眼巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d383844-04fe-4f1a-8d12-edadbefb86e7\', \'multiverseId\': 645211}, \'multiverseid\': 645211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Borborygmos in Wut\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn Borborygmos in Wut einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, decke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm alle Länderkarten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\\nWirf eine Länderkarte ab: Borborygmos in Wut fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zyklop\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7827ad5-dfe9-4ba7-ab31-25e20ddf435c\', \'multiverseId\': 645568}, \'multiverseid\': 645568}, {\'name\': \'Borborygmos furioso\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que Borborygmos furioso haga daño de combate a un jugador, muestra las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas de tierra mostradas de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.\\nDescartar una carta de tierra: Borborygmos furioso hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Cíclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'834f28a3-4a0c-48ab-ab17-308d1be2e2c1\', \'multiverseId\': 645682}, \'multiverseid\': 645682}, {\'name\': \'Borborygmos enragé\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que Borborygmos enragé inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, révélez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes de terrain révélées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte de terrain : Borborygmos enragé inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — cyclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645796&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56069e92-481b-4ed5-ba18-9666ca47f722\', \'multiverseId\': 645796}, \'multiverseid\': 645796}, {\'name\': \'Borborygmos Infuriato\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta Borborygmos Infuriato infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, rivela le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte terra rivelate in questo modo e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\\nScarta una carta terra: Borborygmos Infuriato infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a893fc3a-98f8-4437-b294-394c87cef856\', \'multiverseId\': 645910}, \'multiverseid\': 645910}, {\'name\': \'怒れる腹音鳴らし\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n怒れる腹音鳴らしがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を公開する。これにより公開されたすべての土地・カードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\\n土地・カード１枚を捨てる：１つを対象とする。怒れる腹音鳴らしはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — サイクロプス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'917d52e7-c1e0-483e-9423-98711c1ecf29\', \'multiverseId\': 646024}, \'multiverseid\': 646024}, {\'name\': \'Borborigmo Enfurecido\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Borborigmo Enfurecido causar dano de combate a um jogador, revele os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards de terreno revelados dessa maneira na sua mão e o restante no seu cemitério.\\nDescarte um card de terreno: Borborigmo Enfurecido causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95fec437-8c33-4060-a4d5-fbfc6da8d513\', \'multiverseId\': 646138}, \'multiverseid\': 646138}, {\'name\': \'盛怒咕噜力莫\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当盛怒咕噜力莫对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，展示你牌库顶的三张牌。将所有以此法展示的地牌置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。\\n弃一张地牌：盛怒咕噜力莫对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 独眼巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83fbdcb0-f9cd-4449-be7f-d90aa18d2360\', \'multiverseId\': 646252}, \'multiverseid\': 646252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Elite\', \'text\': \'Bataillon — Immer wenn die Boros-Elite und mindestens zwei andere Kreaturen angreifen, erhält die Boros-Elite +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Zuerst musst du dich unter den einfachen Soldaten behaupten. Dadurch kann ich deine Führungsqualitäten einschätzen."\\n—Aurelia zu Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643308&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e70f8dc1-fda3-4d5d-b63f-8d6606d9e4e9\', \'multiverseId\': 643308}, \'multiverseid\': 643308}, {\'name\': \'Élite boros\', \'text\': \'Batallón — Siempre que la Élite boros y al menos otras dos criaturas ataquen, la Élite boros obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Antes debes luchar entre los soldados rasos. Allí es donde evaluaré tus aptitudes para el liderazgo".\\n—Aurelia, a Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5c25cc3-10d6-4f19-a573-377144349c19\', \'multiverseId\': 643599}, \'multiverseid\': 643599}, {\'name\': \'Élite de Boros\', \'text\': "Bataillon — À chaque fois que l\'Élite de Boros et au moins deux autres créatures attaquent, l\'Élite de Boros gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Commencez déjà par combattre parmi les hommes de troupe. C\'est ainsi que je verrai ce que vous valez comme chef. »\\n—Aurélia, à Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c81b652-6aa2-409c-9bc2-3f65a02a0e32\', \'multiverseId\': 643890}, \'multiverseid\': 643890}, {\'name\': \'Elite Boros\', \'text\': "Battaglione — Ogniqualvolta l\'Elite Boros e almeno altre due creature attaccano, l\'Elite Boros prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Per prima cosa devi combattere come soldato semplice. In questo modo saprò se hai le doti di un leader."\\n—Aurelia a Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f207cee2-316d-4969-b66f-ba6f43b5e8e3\', \'multiverseId\': 644181}, \'multiverseid\': 644181}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの精鋭\', \'text\': \'大隊 ― ボロスの精鋭とこれでない２体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、ボロスの精鋭は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「まずは一兵卒として戦わねばなりません。あなたの統率者としての力量はそこで見極めます。」\\n――オレリアからギデオン・ジュラへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1938f75-0a35-4b7c-971f-20908558ac6e\', \'multiverseId\': 644472}, \'multiverseid\': 644472}, {\'name\': \'Elite Boros\', \'text\': \'Batalhão — Toda vez que Elite Boros e pelo menos duas outras criaturas atacarem, Elite Boros receberá +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Primeiro, você precisa lutar nas fileiras, junto com os soldados. É lá que discernirei suas habilidades como líder."\\n— Aurélia, para Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae80844-018a-40cf-84f2-cdf3a1b8cf8d\', \'multiverseId\': 644763}, \'multiverseid\': 644763}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯精兵\', \'text\': \'协战～每当波洛斯精兵与至少两个其他生物攻击时，波洛斯精兵得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「你必须先与士兵一同奋战，我才能看出你的领袖才能。」\\n～欧瑞梨告诉基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8d7e43c-8a35-4173-94f0-ee9250c30eff\', \'multiverseId\': 645054}, \'multiverseid\': 645054}]', "[{'name': 'Boros-Gildeneingang', 'text': 'Der Boros-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land — Tor', 'flavor': 'Tritt ein, zögere nicht! Keine Zeit für Gnade, sei bereit für den Krieg!', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643572&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb5e3bed-7b5f-4fb3-b6e0-059db77815b0', 'multiverseId': 643572}, 'multiverseid': 643572}, {'name': 'Portal del Gremio Boros', 'text': 'El Portal del Gremio Boros entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra — Portal', 'flavor': 'Únete con un corazón piadoso. Regresa con un grito de batalla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643863&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37267d08-3c54-46e4-84a4-0b5042ad9009', 'multiverseId': 643863}, 'multiverseid': 643863}, {'name': 'Porte de la guilde de Boros', 'text': 'La Porte de la guilde de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain — porte', 'flavor': 'Entrez, le cœur plein de pitié. Sortez, un cri de bataille dans la gorge.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644154&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5073670-36c2-4cf5-aca6-3dab09718f27', 'multiverseId': 644154}, 'multiverseid': 644154}, {'name': 'Cancello della Gilda Boros', 'text': 'Il Cancello della Gilda Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra — Cancello', 'flavor': 'Entrate con cuori misericordiosi. Uscite con un grido di battaglia possente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644445&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b75b8c01-b566-41df-9aa9-4129a1b8e016', 'multiverseId': 644445}, 'multiverseid': 644445}, {'name': 'ボロスのギルド門', 'text': 'ボロスのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地 — 門', 'flavor': '慈悲の心で入れ。喊声をあげて出よ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644736&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bdbc069-8a1d-40fd-ad46-13857f153fa9', 'multiverseId': 644736}, 'multiverseid': 644736}, {'name': 'Portão da Guilda Boros', 'text': 'Portão da Guilda Boros entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno — Portão', 'flavor': 'Entrem com corações piedosos. Saiam com gritos de guerra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645027&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c046a6d-c408-4e9d-8695-4a8fd3f3efd6', 'multiverseId': 645027}, 'multiverseid': 645027}, {'name': '波洛斯公会门', 'text': '波洛斯公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。', 'type': '地 — 门', 'flavor': '此门前来时尚存慈悲胸怀，归去时锻出响亮战嚎。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645318&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3dc05f15-73f4-4fb2-a6bf-3a3f45d49b8d', 'multiverseId': 645318}, 'multiverseid': 645318}]", "[{'name': 'Boros-Gildeneingang', 'text': 'Der Boros-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land — Tor', 'flavor': 'Tritt ein, zögere nicht! Keine Zeit für Gnade, sei bereit für den Krieg!', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645609&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5882aa34-b7b7-44cd-9413-df6d0500bdb5', 'multiverseId': 645609}, 'multiverseid': 645609}, {'name': 'Porte de la guilde de Boros', 'text': 'La Porte de la guilde de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain — porte', 'flavor': 'Entrez, le cœur plein de pitié. Sortez, un cri de bataille dans la gorge.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645837&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f15b142-c5ef-4d51-b23a-d1c033ed34e5', 'multiverseId': 645837}, 'multiverseid': 645837}, {'name': 'Cancello della Gilda Boros', 'text': 'Il Cancello della Gilda Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra — Cancello', 'flavor': 'Entrate con cuori misericordiosi. Uscite con un grido di battaglia possente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645951&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fb2caa3-6c94-4b11-9804-f9cb128dd94e', 'multiverseId': 645951}, 'multiverseid': 645951}, {'name': 'ボロスのギルド門', 'text': 'ボロスのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地 — 門', 'flavor': '慈悲の心で入れ。喊声をあげて出よ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646065&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9953e4cc-1dc5-473c-9fc9-6f746f202298', 'multiverseId': 646065}, 'multiverseid': 646065}, {'name': 'Portão da Guilda Boros', 'text': 'Portão da Guilda Boros entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno — Portão', 'flavor': 'Entrem com corações piedosos. Saiam com gritos de guerra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646179&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c470c0a6-4879-44dd-9b34-56ea3fda040e', 'multiverseId': 646179}, 'multiverseid': 646179}, {'name': '波洛斯公会门', 'text': '波洛斯公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。', 'type': '地 — 门', 'flavor': '此门前来时尚存慈悲胸怀，归去时锻出响亮战嚎。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646293&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '671b2320-4859-43d8-86bd-b0c6a4e3fc20', 'multiverseId': 646293}, 'multiverseid': 646293}]", '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Gildenmagier\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{1}{W}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643466&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b453e86e-55a0-4bbb-a493-38cd36f96acd\', \'multiverseId\': 643466}, \'multiverseid\': 643466}, {\'name\': \'Maga del Gremio Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\\n{1}{W}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'330e1a1a-9e9e-471b-b19e-f81ce022e743\', \'multiverseId\': 643757}, \'multiverseid\': 643757}, {\'name\': \'Ghildmage de Boros\', \'text\': "{1}{R} : Une créature ciblée acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{1}{W} : Une créature ciblée acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1ccab00-1a12-4bb9-9afe-0ec82a9633b2\', \'multiverseId\': 644048}, \'multiverseid\': 644048}, {\'name\': \'Maga della Gilda Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Una creatura bersaglio ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\n{1}{W}: Una creatura bersaglio ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a155d8a-df38-47d3-83ca-802c48974bcb\', \'multiverseId\': 644339}, \'multiverseid\': 644339}, {\'name\': \'ボロスのギルド魔道士\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\\n{1}{W}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be70021c-53cb-40ad-b000-8af30c5d0bea\', \'multiverseId\': 644630}, \'multiverseid\': 644630}, {\'name\': \'Maga da Guilda Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: A criatura alvo ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\\n{1}{W}: A criatura alvo ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d91b19c-ad78-4f36-8ed2-97802cb7e655\', \'multiverseId\': 644921}, \'multiverseid\': 644921}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯公会法师\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：目标生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\\n{1}{W}：目标生物获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb59bb0b-aec7-4356-80b9-532ef9d10c1d\', \'multiverseId\': 645212}, \'multiverseid\': 645212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Hattest du schon einmal ein Boros-Petschaft in der Hand? Man wundert sich, dass es bei seiner Größe so schwer sein kann — ein Gewicht von Stolz und Stärke."\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177e07da-3305-44e1-97b3-321d31048f78\', \'multiverseId\': 643549}, \'multiverseid\': 643549}, {\'name\': \'Sello boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Has sostenido alguna vez un sello boros? Tiene un peso que no se corresponde con su tamaño: el peso de la fuerza y el orgullo".\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48810330-4fdf-4a4a-a31b-1d59afb83485\', \'multiverseId\': 643840}, \'multiverseid\': 643840}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Avez-vous déjà eu en main le cachet de Boros ? Il est bien plus lourd qu\'on pourrait le croire — il a le pesant de la force et de la fierté. »\\n—Agrus Kos", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644131&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40a1863-72cc-4ae6-a7ed-cbbe107c6aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 644131}, \'multiverseid\': 644131}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai mai tenuto in mano un sigillo Boros? Il suo peso stupisce in rapporto alle dimensioni: è il peso della forza e dell\\\'orgoglio."\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7a1336e-c626-41ef-ac71-808bc9915ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 644422}, \'multiverseid\': 644422}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{R}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「ボロスの印鑑を手にしたことがあるか？その重さは見た目以上だ。力と誇りの重みなのだ。」\\n――アグルス・コス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec58fdc-92fd-41c1-b808-6fcfe9c5c6f9\', \'multiverseId\': 644713}, \'multiverseid\': 644713}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Você já segurou um sinete Boros? Seu peso não corresponde ao seu tamanho, é o peso da força e do orgulho."\\n— Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3e8c33e-7aaf-4fdf-9d25-6f7de7a12d7d\', \'multiverseId\': 645004}, \'multiverseid\': 645004}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{R}{W}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你有没有用手捧过波洛斯印记？这印记比外表看起来要沉重许多～因为它承载了厚实的力量与荣耀。」\\n～阿固寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6f7f444-7101-472f-bc07-91d2c6bb72ec\', \'multiverseId\': 645295}, \'multiverseid\': 645295}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bote des Syndikats\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSeelenwandlung 1 (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen und schwarzen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'„Viele Schwingen verdunkeln heutzutage den Himmel. Nur wenige von Ihnen überbringen gute Nachrichten."\\n—Lavinia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643327&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef342ea-9d6c-4c2a-8b22-546f4817a695\', \'multiverseId\': 643327}, \'multiverseid\': 643327}, {\'name\': \'Mensajera del Sindicato\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nUltratumba 1. (Cuando esta criatura muera, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca y negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Muchas alas surcan los cielos hoy en día, pero pocas traen buenas nuevas".\\n—Lavinia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40da4a7e-8029-4bac-8f87-337fa8ad6fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 643618}, \'multiverseid\': 643618}, {\'name\': \'Messager du Syndicat\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nAu-delà 1 (Quand cette créature meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche et noire Esprit avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — oiseau\', \'flavor\': "« Nombreuses sont les ailes à parcourir le ciel ces temps-ci. Peu d\'entre elles sont porteuses de bonnes nouvelles. »\\n—Lavinia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ac9913f-6b06-43fa-a5d3-142ae8bc7ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 643909}, \'multiverseid\': 643909}, {\'name\': \'Messaggero del Sindacato\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nAldilà 1 (Quando questa creatura muore, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca e nera con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Molte ali solcano i cieli, di questi tempi. Ben poche sono portatrici di buone notizie."\\n—Lavinia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7a5d903-035f-487b-8d45-5823752854a2\', \'multiverseId\': 644200}, \'multiverseid\': 644200}, {\'name\': \'組織の伝書使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n死後１（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白黒の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「近頃はたくさんの翼が空に飛び交っているわね。その中でもいい知らせを持っているのはごく僅かだわ。」\\n――ラヴィニア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11caf48c-cf81-461a-9c07-14dc0f9ad433\', \'multiverseId\': 644491}, \'multiverseid\': 644491}, {\'name\': \'Mensageiro do Sindicato\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nPós-vida 1 (Quando esta criatura morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Espírito branca e preta 1/1 com voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoje em dia, muitas asas assombram os céus. Poucas trazem boas novas."\\n— Lavínia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cffbb2f3-f6e6-40b0-9070-480f523abfe3\', \'multiverseId\': 644782}, \'multiverseid\': 644782}, {\'name\': \'集团信使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n往生1（当此生物死去时，派出一个1/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鸟\', \'flavor\': \'「如今天空布满羽翼，但鲜有好事相传。」\\n～拉温妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bf423c3-680d-4c04-a68a-e7929d29e87b\', \'multiverseId\': 645073}, \'multiverseid\': 645073}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruvac der Wortgewaltige\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Gegner eine oder mehrere Karten millen würde, millt er stattdessen doppelt so viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„… und darüber hinaus …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643333&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba68320-02fb-49dd-9275-6c212cf25f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 643333}, \'multiverseid\': 643333}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac el Grandilocuente\', \'text\': \'Si un oponente fuera a moler una o más cartas, en vez de eso, muele el doble de esa cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"... y, además...".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bfab745-f69b-4b7d-8a41-5436f71a8e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 643624}, \'multiverseid\': 643624}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac le grandiloquent\', \'text\': \'Si un adversaire devait meuler au moins une carte, il meule deux fois ce nombre de cartes à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'« ... Et de plus... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b283b62d-bd1f-480f-9146-288745bc41e5\', \'multiverseId\': 643915}, \'multiverseid\': 643915}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac il Magniloquente\', \'text\': \'Se un avversario sta per macinare una o più carte, ne macina invece il doppio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"... in aggiunta..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'519ab51a-33dd-474d-8dea-9aad39f57460\', \'multiverseId\': 644206}, \'multiverseid\': 644206}, {\'name\': \'文飾衒才のブルバック\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が１枚以上のカードを切削するなら、そのプレイヤーは代わりにその２倍の枚数のカードを切削する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「……また、さらに……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'907e0444-4f3f-46de-9619-b5924164c487\', \'multiverseId\': 644497}, \'multiverseid\': 644497}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac, o Grandiloquente\', \'text\': \'Se um oponente for triturar um ou mais cards, em vez disso, ele tritura o dobro daquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"... data venia..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b8ec62-055e-41b2-b276-859747e7c26d\', \'multiverseId\': 644788}, \'multiverseid\': 644788}, {\'name\': \'浮夸的布鲁瓦\', \'text\': \'如果某对手将磨一张或数张牌，则改为其磨该数量两倍的牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「…此外…」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c59e200-caa0-4614-a277-f5eeae8df7fa\', \'multiverseId\': 645079}, \'multiverseid\': 645079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruvac der Wortgewaltige\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Gegner eine oder mehrere Karten millen würde, millt er stattdessen doppelt so viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„… und darüber hinaus …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7709adfe-e17d-443f-bdca-5a5b0b1ae1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 645520}, \'multiverseid\': 645520}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac el Grandilocuente\', \'text\': \'Si un oponente fuera a moler una o más cartas, en vez de eso, muele el doble de esa cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"... y, además...".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'962b5836-c726-463a-a649-9eeee16acf2b\', \'multiverseId\': 645634}, \'multiverseid\': 645634}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac le grandiloquent\', \'text\': \'Si un adversaire devait meuler au moins une carte, il meule deux fois ce nombre de cartes à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'« ... Et de plus... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740f4f63-3ca9-4f0b-bc10-734646c71453\', \'multiverseId\': 645748}, \'multiverseid\': 645748}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac il Magniloquente\', \'text\': \'Se un avversario sta per macinare una o più carte, ne macina invece il doppio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"... in aggiunta..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a04b51f-8fb0-411d-9cf7-f36f8d253e03\', \'multiverseId\': 645862}, \'multiverseid\': 645862}, {\'name\': \'文飾衒才のブルバック\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が１枚以上のカードを切削するなら、そのプレイヤーは代わりにその２倍の枚数のカードを切削する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「……また、さらに……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38fe909e-2539-4883-a599-986b4277315c\', \'multiverseId\': 645976}, \'multiverseid\': 645976}, {\'name\': \'Bruvac, o Grandiloquente\', \'text\': \'Se um oponente for triturar um ou mais cards, em vez disso, ele tritura o dobro daquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"... data venia..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'827b72fe-5fb0-43ae-9cec-f219730783e8\', \'multiverseId\': 646090}, \'multiverseid\': 646090}, {\'name\': \'浮夸的布鲁瓦\', \'text\': \'如果某对手将磨一张或数张牌，则改为其磨该数量两倍的牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「…此外…」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5b4d296-0c90-4e25-904a-8cc93b2127b1\', \'multiverseId\': 646204}, \'multiverseid\': 646204}]', "[{'name': 'Bruvac der Wortgewaltige', 'text': 'Falls ein Gegner eine oder mehrere Karten millen würde, millt er stattdessen doppelt so viele Karten.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646371&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea9e5fd2-4560-4314-beb2-88166e008313', 'multiverseId': 646371}, 'multiverseid': 646371}, {'name': 'Bruvac el Grandilocuente', 'text': 'Si un oponente fuera a moler una o más cartas, en vez de eso, muele el doble de esa cantidad de cartas.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646399&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0be6ca7a-8fad-4da3-adfb-5e33985f2d35', 'multiverseId': 646399}, 'multiverseid': 646399}, {'name': 'Bruvac le grandiloquent', 'text': 'Si un adversaire devait meuler au moins une carte, il meule deux fois ce nombre de cartes à la place.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — humain et conseiller', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646427&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a92f067-e772-4a51-a556-fb928f48b1ba', 'multiverseId': 646427}, 'multiverseid': 646427}, {'name': 'Bruvac il Magniloquente', 'text': 'Se un avversario sta per macinare una o più carte, ne macina invece il doppio.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646455&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf5e58d6-a758-4ca6-9d96-ed16793f7c13', 'multiverseId': 646455}, 'multiverseid': 646455}, {'name': '文飾衒才のブルバック', 'text': '対戦相手１人が１枚以上のカードを切削するなら、そのプレイヤーは代わりにその２倍の枚数のカードを切削する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646483&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13179aa1-9d19-4f1b-945a-c9470f1cfecd', 'multiverseId': 646483}, 'multiverseid': 646483}, {'name': 'Bruvac, o Grandiloquente', 'text': 'Se um oponente for triturar um ou mais cards, em vez disso, ele tritura o dobro daquela quantidade de cards.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646511&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '174da9e2-8f5e-4c93-b0c1-24c5d018c3e0', 'multiverseId': 646511}, 'multiverseid': 646511}, {'name': '浮夸的布鲁瓦', 'text': '如果某对手将磨一张或数张牌，则改为其磨该数量两倍的牌。', 'type': '传奇生物 — 人类／参谋', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646539&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fcb41f9-7fa8-4527-b6e6-bb2231edfd66', 'multiverseId': 646539}, 'multiverseid': 646539}]", '[{\'name\': \'Chamán rito mortal\', \'text\': \'{T}: Exilia la carta de tierra objetivo de un cementerio. Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{B}, {T}: Exilia la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de un cementerio. Cada oponente pierde 2 vidas.\\n{G}, {T}: Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3514cab5-f88c-4eed-9094-fca894edf6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 645688}, \'multiverseid\': 645688}, {\'name\': \'Shamane ritemort\', \'text\': "{T} : Exilez une carte de terrain ciblée d\'un cimetière. Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{B}, {T} : Exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée d\'un cimetière. Chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie.\\n{G}, {T} : Exilez une carte de créature ciblée d\'un cimetière. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efde2dc6-1933-4211-8242-80277bbfd077\', \'multiverseId\': 645802}, \'multiverseid\': 645802}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano Letalmago\', \'text\': \'{T}: Esilia una carta terra bersaglio da un cimitero. Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{B}, {T}: Esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio da un cimitero. Ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita.\\n{G}, {T}: Esilia una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b91b79de-cdfd-49bd-979f-12ef706db3ff\', \'multiverseId\': 645916}, \'multiverseid\': 645916}, {\'name\': \'死儀礼のシャーマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：墓地にある土地・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{B}, {T}：墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。\\n{G}, {T}：墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62a95b91-510d-49fe-862a-ef546ff70c42\', \'multiverseId\': 646030}, \'multiverseid\': 646030}, {\'name\': \'Xamã do Ritual Mortífero\', \'text\': \'{T}: Exile o card de terreno alvo de um cemitério. Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{B}, {T}: Exile o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de um cemitério. Cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida.\\n{G}, {T}: Exile o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério. Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d98ce6a4-6c68-4e55-9519-f267ddbce8f9\', \'multiverseId\': 646144}, \'multiverseid\': 646144}, {\'name\': \'丧仪祭师\', \'text\': \'{T}：将目标地牌从坟墓场放逐。加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{B}，{T}：将目标瞬间或法术牌从坟墓场放逐。每位对手各失去2点生命。\\n{G}，{T}：将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df6f4726-8a61-47db-a337-185405adbbc9\', \'multiverseId\': 646258}, \'multiverseid\': 646258}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosteufel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler ein Permanent opfert, fügt der Chaosteufel einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': \'Die Rakdos-Kultisten können einfach keine Gelegenheit ungenutzt lassen, Chaos zu stiften — auch nicht, wenn es um das Überleben der Stadt geht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643497&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4334132-48d5-4c56-8818-ed1520574a27\', \'multiverseId\': 643497}, \'multiverseid\': 643497}, {\'name\': \'Diablo del caos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador sacrifique un permanente, el Diablo del caos hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar de que la supervivencia de la ciudad estaba en juego, los cultistas de Rakdos son reacios a dejar pasar cualquier oportunidad de sembrar el caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69850a1b-e9f1-4e4d-9438-823e0862f61c\', \'multiverseId\': 643788}, \'multiverseid\': 643788}, {\'name\': \'Diable du carnage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur sacrifie un permanent, le Diable du carnage inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature — diable\', \'flavor\': "Bien qu\'ayant tout intérêt à ce que la cité survive, les cultistes de Rakdos répugnent à gâcher une occasion de semer le chaos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044bf0c5-916d-438d-9bf0-5a293ab1b71d\', \'multiverseId\': 644079}, \'multiverseid\': 644079}, {\'name\': \'Diavolo del Pandemonio\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore sacrifica un permanente, il Diavolo del Pandemonio infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': \'Nonostante il loro interesse per la sopravvivenza della città, i cultisti Rakdos sono riluttanti a lasciarsi sfuggire qualsiasi occasione per seminare il caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3bee4bc-f0fe-42f7-872d-075e25753e3d\', \'multiverseId\': 644370}, \'multiverseid\': 644370}, {\'name\': \'波乱の悪魔\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、１つを対象とする。波乱の悪魔はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': \'街の存続に利害があるにも関わらず、ラクドスの信者は混沌を巻き起こす機会を見逃さずにはいられなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148508e0-f15c-4d67-85c7-92db1f4a3121\', \'multiverseId\': 644661}, \'multiverseid\': 644661}, {\'name\': \'Diabo do Pandemônio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador sacrifica uma permanente, Diabo do Pandemônio causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo\', \'flavor\': \'A despeito do próprio interesse na sobrevivência da cidade, os cultistas de Rakdos odeiam deixar passar uma oportunidade de semear o caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00d0bd5e-7e35-4013-8469-4022ded06e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 644952}, \'multiverseid\': 644952}, {\'name\': \'破坏魔鬼\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手牺牲一个永久物时，破坏魔鬼对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'虽然城市存亡攸关拉铎司教众生死，但他们绝不愿放过任何制造混乱的机会。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb585736-107c-4048-b84e-2b519b5251c9\', \'multiverseId\': 645243}, \'multiverseid\': 645243}]', "[{'name': 'Chaosteufel', 'text': 'Immer wenn ein Spieler ein Permanent opfert, fügt der Chaosteufel einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Teufel', 'flavor': 'Die Rakdos-Kultisten können einfach keine Gelegenheit ungenutzt lassen, Chaos zu stiften — auch nicht, wenn es um das Überleben der Stadt geht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645585&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a9ad060-c988-4fcd-b6c2-054d935c821c', 'multiverseId': 645585}, 'multiverseid': 645585}, {'name': 'Diablo del caos', 'text': 'Siempre que un jugador sacrifique un permanente, el Diablo del caos hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Diablo', 'flavor': 'A pesar de que la supervivencia de la ciudad estaba en juego, los cultistas de Rakdos son reacios a dejar pasar cualquier oportunidad de sembrar el caos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645699&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cec42744-9e8c-4819-9355-5b73aeb28fba', 'multiverseId': 645699}, 'multiverseid': 645699}, {'name': 'Diavolo del Pandemonio', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore sacrifica un permanente, il Diavolo del Pandemonio infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Diavolo', 'flavor': 'Nonostante il loro interesse per la sopravvivenza della città, i cultisti Rakdos sono riluttanti a lasciarsi sfuggire qualsiasi occasione per seminare il caos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645927&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '142e255c-adab-4d82-9fbe-65ec7f56383b', 'multiverseId': 645927}, 'multiverseid': 645927}, {'name': '波乱の悪魔', 'text': 'プレイヤーがパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、１つを対象とする。波乱の悪魔はそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': '街の存続に利害があるにも関わらず、ラクドスの信者は混沌を巻き起こす機会を見逃さずにはいられなかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646041&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b4d5295-1cc3-4ac9-8327-a7c9049d271a', 'multiverseId': 646041}, 'multiverseid': 646041}, {'name': 'Diabo do Pandemônio', 'text': 'Toda vez que um jogador sacrifica uma permanente, Diabo do Pandemônio causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Diabo', 'flavor': 'A despeito do próprio interesse na sobrevivência da cidade, os cultistas de Rakdos odeiam deixar passar uma oportunidade de semear o caos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646155&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8893bca3-3987-4db2-8316-5590289055ba', 'multiverseId': 646155}, 'multiverseid': 646155}, {'name': '破坏魔鬼', 'text': '每当任一牌手牺牲一个永久物时，破坏魔鬼对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。', 'type': '生物 — 魔鬼', 'flavor': '虽然城市存亡攸关拉铎司教众生死，但他们绝不愿放过任何制造混乱的机会。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646269&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89f0eeef-69d9-4866-a691-4b1b54936235', 'multiverseId': 646269}, 'multiverseid': 646269}]", '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Dimir-Magier setzen die Lampen geschickt ein — aus dem ungewohnten Mana erschaffen sie Gestaltwandler und Schläfer-Agenten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e96198-40e9-4f9a-a863-77535790dcc5\', \'multiverseId\': 643551}, \'multiverseid\': 643551}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los magos dimir hicieron buen uso de las linternas, creando metamorfos y agentes durmientes a partir de un maná que les era extraño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56dd3de2-1ec5-425c-a22a-9d3fa6ed9c76\', \'multiverseId\': 643842}, \'multiverseid\': 643842}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les mages dimirs tirent parti des lanternes, créant des changeformes et des agents en sommeil à partir de mana dont ils ignorent tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644133&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbc29ddd-2211-493c-adab-80229a2796c1\', \'multiverseId\': 644133}, \'multiverseid\': 644133}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I maghi Dimir fanno buon uso delle lanterne, creando mutaforma e agenti infiltrati partendo da mana a loro estraneo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65052c9c-8fbf-46b1-96f3-1ba30859973a\', \'multiverseId\': 644424}, \'multiverseid\': 644424}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの魔道士は灯籠をうまく使い、異質のマナから多相の戦士や潜伏工作員を生み出している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51724fd8-383f-4fd2-9ab3-ed68902d0bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 644715}, \'multiverseid\': 644715}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os magos Dimir fazem bom uso das lanternas, criando metamorfos e agentes adormecidos com tipos de mana diferentes dos deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa74ddb4-7dda-4b6e-b574-50e351346a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 645006}, \'multiverseid\': 645006}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'底密尔法师充分利用宫灯，从他们不熟悉的法术力当中制造出变形兽和潜藏密探。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6466c117-97a6-456c-ba56-cd4a8ed8bdb7\', \'multiverseId\': 645297}, \'multiverseid\': 645297}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Dimir-Magier setzen die Lampen geschickt ein — aus dem ungewohnten Mana erschaffen sie Gestaltwandler und Schläfer-Agenten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3b93ec-7157-404e-974c-f8b0a84705c6\', \'multiverseId\': 645601}, \'multiverseid\': 645601}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los magos dimir hicieron buen uso de las linternas, creando metamorfos y agentes durmientes a partir de un maná que les era extraño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a449cd2a-05b4-4bd0-8b4d-1f1565d703b8\', \'multiverseId\': 645715}, \'multiverseid\': 645715}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les mages dimirs tirent parti des lanternes, créant des changeformes et des agents en sommeil à partir de mana dont ils ignorent tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81995344-2e22-4eac-98ae-27d22f4414bd\', \'multiverseId\': 645829}, \'multiverseid\': 645829}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I maghi Dimir fanno buon uso delle lanterne, creando mutaforma e agenti infiltrati partendo da mana a loro estraneo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05d27f90-6f00-4836-be43-419f38175b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 645943}, \'multiverseid\': 645943}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの魔道士は灯籠をうまく使い、異質のマナから多相の戦士や潜伏工作員を生み出している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901e9013-de07-42ca-810b-9ade94d33acc\', \'multiverseId\': 646057}, \'multiverseid\': 646057}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os magos Dimir fazem bom uso das lanternas, criando metamorfos e agentes adormecidos com tipos de mana diferentes dos deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc2e21f7-e38f-4257-8b3e-46f38ecf1946\', \'multiverseId\': 646171}, \'multiverseid\': 646171}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'底密尔法师充分利用宫灯，从他们不熟悉的法术力当中制造出变形兽和潜藏密探。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60f40469-25e3-4ce2-a247-6225145bedce\', \'multiverseId\': 646285}, \'multiverseid\': 646285}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7d56134-0e4a-4481-b33f-5d6e922c28eb\', \'multiverseId\': 646395}, \'multiverseid\': 646395}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8123f508-dd81-4d4b-abb3-f61249cb86e5\', \'multiverseId\': 646423}, \'multiverseid\': 646423}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6529b45e-a8e4-4c65-9751-0f5f2e8f4e01\', \'multiverseId\': 646451}, \'multiverseid\': 646451}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d16dfcd-b09b-4b08-a9e5-e404f24a8845\', \'multiverseId\': 646479}, \'multiverseid\': 646479}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8786ff1e-736f-44dc-8eba-95dbf5516344\', \'multiverseId\': 646507}, \'multiverseid\': 646507}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'618730cd-6799-4ed9-b826-f4c1a70ab0e5\', \'multiverseId\': 646535}, \'multiverseid\': 646535}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'605ff13f-cdf5-45b5-8efd-a45d16879b05\', \'multiverseId\': 646563}, \'multiverseid\': 646563}]', "[{'name': 'Dampfschlote', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.)\\nSowie die Dampfschlote ins Spiel kommen, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommen sie getappt ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643586&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2725c997-5e80-40a7-bb79-3b261a482ff2', 'multiverseId': 643586}, 'multiverseid': 643586}, {'name': 'Respiraderos de vapor', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.)\\nEn cuanto los Respiraderos de vapor entren al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, entran al campo de batalla girados.', 'type': 'Tierra — Isla montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643877&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8faebfe6-cd8a-42c7-971c-12a1aff78e51', 'multiverseId': 643877}, 'multiverseid': 643877}, {'name': 'Conduits de vapeur', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.)\\nAu moment où les Conduits de vapeur arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, ils arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.', 'type': 'Terrain — île et montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644168&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d6b8600-2f57-4cbf-9600-5bc09ac556c2', 'multiverseId': 644168}, 'multiverseid': 644168}, {'name': 'Fumarie di Vapore', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.)\\nMentre le Fumarie di Vapore entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644459&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73e94d88-4710-4f2a-85ff-157209cbd8e5', 'multiverseId': 644459}, 'multiverseid': 644459}, {'name': '蒸気孔', 'text': '（{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。）\\n蒸気孔が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 島・山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644750&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b559c5df-5014-45f3-b5c8-87681d1cbec6', 'multiverseId': 644750}, 'multiverseid': 644750}, {'name': 'Bueiros de Vapor', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}.)\\nConforme Bueiros de Vapor entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ele entrará no campo de batalha virado.', 'type': 'Terreno — Ilha Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645041&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b9a7f5c-9ebc-4b17-adde-e4535af1ab87', 'multiverseId': 645041}, 'multiverseid': 645041}, {'name': '蒸气喷发口', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}或{R}。）\\n于蒸气喷发口进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则蒸气喷发口须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 — 海岛／山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645332&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cca5af8-27e8-4648-8f5d-c24aa53235c9', 'multiverseId': 645332}, 'multiverseid': 645332}]", "[{'name': 'Dampfschlote', 'text': 'Sowie die Dampfschlote ins Spiel kommen, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommen sie getappt ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645623&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06658e5c-996e-4de8-ac22-7f50620b177c', 'multiverseId': 645623}, 'multiverseid': 645623}, {'name': 'Respiraderos de vapor', 'text': 'En cuanto los Respiraderos de vapor entren al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, entran al campo de batalla girados.', 'type': 'Tierra — Isla montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645737&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40960667-9981-413f-af14-cb9557c2ef79', 'multiverseId': 645737}, 'multiverseid': 645737}, {'name': 'Conduits de vapeur', 'text': 'Au moment où les Conduits de vapeur arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, ils arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.', 'type': 'Terrain — île et montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645851&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '347d2db3-abb7-4b69-9b15-a3a57b606912', 'multiverseId': 645851}, 'multiverseid': 645851}, {'name': 'Fumarie di Vapore', 'text': 'Mentre le Fumarie di Vapore entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645965&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b09cd27a-864f-42b5-bb8b-4c3a14a37fe6', 'multiverseId': 645965}, 'multiverseid': 645965}, {'name': '蒸気孔', 'text': '蒸気孔が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 島・山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646079&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd014dd8c-6eed-44f4-aaf5-f53702b3dfc3', 'multiverseId': 646079}, 'multiverseid': 646079}, {'name': 'Bueiros de Vapor', 'text': 'Conforme Bueiros de Vapor entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ele entrará no campo de batalha virado.', 'type': 'Terreno — Ilha Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646193&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02cd2e71-ee4b-424c-8727-69b893b0341e', 'multiverseId': 646193}, 'multiverseid': 646193}, {'name': '蒸气喷发口', 'text': '于蒸气喷发口进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则蒸气喷发口须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 — 海岛／山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646307&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66fc05d2-9463-43ee-b3cd-2729079aa795', 'multiverseId': 646307}, 'multiverseid': 646307}]", '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Jedes Stück Land, das sie uns nehmen, holen wir uns entweder zurück, oder wir verwüsten es. Sie sollen nichts haben."\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643404&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4886420e-1785-424d-ae7b-dcc8c0661197\', \'multiverseId\': 643404}, \'multiverseid\': 643404}, {\'name\': \'Demoler\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Por cada centímetro de tierra que nos quiten, lo recuperaremos o lo quemaremos. No se quedarán con nada".\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40770356-b157-490a-a46b-64458acea9d9\', \'multiverseId\': 643695}, \'multiverseid\': 643695}, {\'name\': \'Démolition\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, artefact ou terrain.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Chaque centimètre de terrain qu\'ils nous prennent, nous le reprenons ou nous le brûlons. Ne leur laissons rien. »\\n—Aurélia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643986&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e607720-7692-4ab4-a7bf-bf1f40f6befd\', \'multiverseId\': 643986}, \'multiverseid\': 643986}, {\'name\': \'Frantumare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Riconquistate ogni centimetro di terra che ci sottraggono, oppure datelo alle fiamme. Non lasciate loro niente."\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e367d4-144b-4396-acd0-a88e4e99b385\', \'multiverseId\': 644277}, \'multiverseid\': 644277}, {\'name\': \'破砕\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトや土地のうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「奪われた土地は必ず取り戻す。そうでなければ焼き尽くす。あいつらには何も渡してはならない。」\\n――オレリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48610687-adc6-4b26-85e7-0731d0edd993\', \'multiverseId\': 644568}, \'multiverseid\': 644568}, {\'name\': \'Demolir\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Reconquistem cada centímetro de terra que nos tomaram ou queimem tudo. Não deixem nada para eles."\\n— Aurélia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a5a1dba-8f59-41ce-a7b8-e94e74d55bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 644859}, \'multiverseid\': 644859}, {\'name\': \'毁坏\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们从我们手中夺走的每一寸土地，抢不回来的就给我烧干净。什么都不给他们留下。」\\n～欧瑞梨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'833d30f2-e988-4045-8a00-cebfb8a4aa07\', \'multiverseId\': 645150}, \'multiverseid\': 645150}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Spieß umdrehen\', \'text\': \'Spektakel {R} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Spektakel-Kosten anstelle seiner Manakosten wirken, falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat.)\\nDen Spieß umdrehen fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist gefährlich, eine Vorstellung der Rakdos anzusehen. Vorzeitig zu gehen kann sogar tödlich enden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca97561c-474f-4b3b-a457-8057351a196c\', \'multiverseId\': 643422}, \'multiverseid\': 643422}, {\'name\': \'Ensartar a los críticos\', \'text\': \'Espectáculo {R}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de espectáculo en vez de por su coste de maná si un oponente perdió vidas este turno.)\\nEnsartar a los críticos hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Asistir a un espectáculo rakdos es peligroso, pero intentar marcharse antes del final puede ser fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979e56bd-e368-4e8d-9dce-0f00c3a2304b\', \'multiverseId\': 643713}, \'multiverseid\': 643713}, {\'name\': \'Embrocher les critiques\', \'text\': "Spectacle {R} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de spectacle à la place de son coût de mana si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci.)\\nEmbrocher les critiques inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Assister à un spectacle de Rakdos est dangereux. Essayer de partir avant la fin peut être fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644004&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae93e55-d967-42eb-9a6a-35a9e824d04c\', \'multiverseId\': 644004}, \'multiverseid\': 644004}, {\'name\': \'Stroncare la Critica\', \'text\': \'Spettacolo {R} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di spettacolo invece del suo costo di mana se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno.)\\nStroncare la Critica infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Assistere a uno spettacolo dei Rakdos è pericoloso, ma tentare di andarsene prima della fine può essere letale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ba3ec9-78ff-4b13-afd3-af24cb081117\', \'multiverseId\': 644295}, \'multiverseid\': 644295}, {\'name\': \'批判家刺殺\', \'text\': \'絢爛{R}（このターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていたなら、あなたはこの呪文を、これのマナ・コストではなく絢爛コストで唱えてもよい。）\\n１つを対象とする。批判家刺殺はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ラクドスのショーに行くのは危険だ。早く出ようとすると命取りになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57164828-df2b-462b-972d-4b08d5778cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 644586}, \'multiverseid\': 644586}, {\'name\': \'Alfinetada nos Críticos\', \'text\': \'Espetáculo {R} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica por seu custo de espetáculo, em vez de seu custo de mana, se um oponente perdeu pontos de vida neste turno.)\\nAlfinetada nos Críticos causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ir a um espetáculo dos Rakdos é perigoso. Tentar ir embora antes do final pode ser fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4cad262-8b6b-4d27-bb22-fd789c930c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 644877}, \'multiverseid\': 644877}, {\'name\': \'遏止倒彩\', \'text\': \'揭幕{R}（如果本回合中有对手失去过生命，则你可以支付此咒语的揭幕费用而非法术力费用来施放它。）\\n遏止倒彩对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'观看拉铎司演出很危险。提早退场有丧命之虞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c388b2c-a938-437c-ba0b-bbd20fe79095\', \'multiverseId\': 645168}, \'multiverseid\': 645168}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Spieß umdrehen\', \'text\': \'Spektakel {R}\\nDen Spieß umdrehen fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist gefährlich, eine Vorstellung der Rakdos anzusehen. Vorzeitig zu gehen kann sogar tödlich enden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f23d647f-67e9-4054-919e-611fc062b8e1\', \'multiverseId\': 645551}, \'multiverseid\': 645551}, {\'name\': \'Ensartar a los críticos\', \'text\': \'Espectáculo {R}.\\nEnsartar a los críticos hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Asistir a un espectáculo rakdos es peligroso, pero intentar marcharse antes del final puede ser fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809ab9b7-8555-4a1f-81fe-934ff477c5b0\', \'multiverseId\': 645665}, \'multiverseid\': 645665}, {\'name\': \'Embrocher les critiques\', \'text\': "Spectacle {R}\\nEmbrocher les critiques inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Assister à un spectacle de Rakdos est dangereux. Essayer de partir avant la fin peut être fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'452d78f2-d07d-4204-8705-0e64e55ad431\', \'multiverseId\': 645779}, \'multiverseid\': 645779}, {\'name\': \'Stroncare la Critica\', \'text\': \'Spettacolo {R}\\nStroncare la Critica infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Assistere a uno spettacolo dei Rakdos è pericoloso, ma tentare di andarsene prima della fine può essere letale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343451ee-5394-4e6c-8463-617830ec04be\', \'multiverseId\': 645893}, \'multiverseid\': 645893}, {\'name\': \'批判家刺殺\', \'text\': \'絢爛{R}\\n１つを対象とする。批判家刺殺はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ラクドスのショーに行くのは危険だ。早く出ようとすると命取りになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ec91789-8947-40e9-9feb-ec66388e9f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 646007}, \'multiverseid\': 646007}, {\'name\': \'Alfinetada nos Críticos\', \'text\': \'Espetáculo {R}\\nAlfinetada nos Críticos causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ir a um espetáculo dos Rakdos é perigoso. Tentar ir embora antes do final pode ser fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1a5256-d44e-4418-bdcd-d6217b144064\', \'multiverseId\': 646121}, \'multiverseid\': 646121}, {\'name\': \'遏止倒彩\', \'text\': \'揭幕{R}\\n遏止倒彩对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'观看拉铎司演出很危险。提早退场有丧命之虞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'246c3f5f-afde-4453-a1a8-0e545ce02cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 646235}, \'multiverseid\': 646235}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebische Ratte\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Diebische Ratte ins Spiel kommt, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': \'„Sogar Ratten horten ihre Schätze. Sind deine Kostbarkeiten so anders?"\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c2f9c5-c586-4653-8267-5e71d586c27c\', \'multiverseId\': 643367}, \'multiverseid\': 643367}, {\'name\': \'Rata ladrona\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Rata ladrona entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata\', \'flavor\': \'"Incluso las ratas acumulan sus tesoros. ¿Tan distintos son tus objetos preciados?".\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'082d23b1-407d-485b-89cd-b30e35f81ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 643658}, \'multiverseid\': 643658}, {\'name\': \'Rat cambrioleur\', \'text\': "Quand le Rat cambrioleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — rat\', \'flavor\': \'« Même les rats accumulent des trésors. Vos objets précieux sont-ils vraiment si différents ? »\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5c6c76-29fe-4301-8144-368ec073611e\', \'multiverseId\': 643949}, \'multiverseid\': 643949}, {\'name\': \'Ratto Predatore\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ratto Predatore entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'"Persino i ratti accatastano i loro tesori. I tuoi preziosi gingilli sono poi così diversi?"\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cab9a49f-4d1e-49bb-9316-6d6b22da8634\', \'multiverseId\': 644240}, \'multiverseid\': 644240}, {\'name\': \'泥棒ネズミ\', \'text\': \'泥棒ネズミが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': \'「ネズミですらお宝をしまい込んでいます。あなたの大切な物というのは、それと何が違うのですか？」\\n――アイゾーニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf8cbe3f-fbc8-43b2-9c61-584a8713c490\', \'multiverseId\': 644531}, \'multiverseid\': 644531}, {\'name\': \'Rato Ladrão\', \'text\': \'Quando Rato Ladrão entra no campo de batalha, cada oponente descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rato\', \'flavor\': \'"Até os ratos amontoam os próprios tesouros. Suas coisas preciosas são assim tão diferentes?"\\n— Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e673c366-8357-4e72-94cd-aaf7135900a8\', \'multiverseId\': 644822}, \'multiverseid\': 644822}, {\'name\': \'窃物鼠\', \'text\': \'当窃物鼠进战场时，每位对手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'「连老鼠都会囤积财宝。你的珍贵宝贝又有什么特别呢？」\\n～依佐妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d1f71cb-c279-4757-8a66-d38d8d03ff85\', \'multiverseId\': 645113}, \'multiverseid\': 645113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebischer Schlüsselmeister\', \'text\': \'Der Diebische Schlüsselmeister kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nWenn der Diebische Schlüsselmeister ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieser öffnet das Gitter vor der Zelzo-Basis. Dieser ist für die Ismeri-Bibliothek. Dieser ist für eine unsichtbare Tür … Nein, ich habe schon zu viel gesagt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643345&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb02695-cc0e-4952-bb46-c319b327015e\', \'multiverseId\': 643345}, \'multiverseid\': 643345}, {\'name\': \'Bribón maestro de llaves\', \'text\': \'El Bribón maestro de llaves no puede ser bloqueado.\\nCuando el Bribón maestro de llaves entre al campo de batalla, regresa una criatura que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta abre la reja de fuera de la Base Zelzo. Esta es de la Biblioteca Ismeri. Esta es la de una puerta invisible… No, ya he dicho demasiado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c298c1e-b753-42ee-b1be-cb47fa198d07\', \'multiverseId\': 643636}, \'multiverseid\': 643636}, {\'name\': \'Gredin maître des clés\', \'text\': \'Le Gredin maître des clés ne peut pas être bloqué.\\nQuand le Gredin maître des clés arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une créature que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Celle-ci ouvre la grille, à l\'extérieur de la Base de Zelzo. Celle-là, c\'est pour la bibliothèque d\'Isméri. Cette troisième ouvre une porte invisible... Oups, j\'en ai trop dit. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643927&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdf2eff-81d4-4312-a21e-6c735e6b5bc3\', \'multiverseId\': 643927}, \'multiverseid\': 643927}, {\'name\': \'Farabutto Signore delle Chiavi\', \'text\': \'Il Farabutto Signore delle Chiavi non può essere bloccato.\\nQuando il Farabutto Signore delle Chiavi entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una creatura che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa apre la grata fuori dalla base Zelzo. Questa è per la biblioteca di Ismeri. Questa è per una porta invisibile… No, ho detto troppo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8efbff45-6755-4e33-821a-5a88a88ec0c5\', \'multiverseId\': 644218}, \'multiverseid\': 644218}, {\'name\': \'鍵達人のならず者\', \'text\': \'鍵達人のならず者はブロックされない。\\n鍵達人のならず者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「これはゼルゾー基地の鉄格子を開くやつ。これはイスメーリ図書館。これはあの見えない扉を……っと、喋りすぎたな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4daed90e-47ad-411a-9d3d-5b8c867c96cd\', \'multiverseId\': 644509}, \'multiverseid\': 644509}, {\'name\': \'Ladino Mestre das Chaves\', \'text\': \'Ladino Mestre das Chaves não pode ser bloqueado.\\nQuando Ladino Mestre das Chaves entrar no campo de batalha, devolva uma criatura que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta aqui abre a grade externa da Base Zelzo. Esta é da Biblioteca Ismeri. Esta é para uma porta invisível... Não. Já falei demais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4490aaca-ee6d-4125-820a-9db49ddfba9f\', \'multiverseId\': 644800}, \'multiverseid\': 644800}, {\'name\': \'开锁浪客\', \'text\': \'开锁浪客不能被阻挡。\\n当开锁浪客进战场时，将一个由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「这个用来打开介柯基地外的铁栅。这个用来打开依梅里图书馆。这个用来打开一道隐形门…不行，我说太多了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fbe0ee6-0a69-4772-b48b-ba068fe76bff\', \'multiverseId\': 645091}, \'multiverseid\': 645091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Dimir-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Tritt ein und lerne Täuschung, Spionieren sowie Lug und Trug.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffacc4bf-8f78-44de-90c0-3e401aa27a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 643574}, \'multiverseid\': 643574}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Dimir\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete y conviértete en un maestro de espías, del engaño y las mentiras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b7e5c5a-8043-4f43-84c2-ee26e51ab849\', \'multiverseId\': 643865}, \'multiverseid\': 643865}, {\'name\': \'Porte de la guilde de Dimir\', \'text\': \'La Porte de la guilde de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — porte\', \'flavor\': "Entrez pour devenir maître de l\'espionnage, du mensonge et de la tromperie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11396268-7e52-4b8c-916d-4cd4b9d5475e\', \'multiverseId\': 644156}, \'multiverseid\': 644156}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrate per diventare creatori di spie, inganni e trucchi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eac28888-61f1-4f50-a3c3-c8ef68638b3c\', \'multiverseId\': 644447}, \'multiverseid\': 644447}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアのギルド門\', \'text\': \'ディミーアのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'ここに入れ。それが諜報、謀略、詐欺の達人となる道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e129c495-36a2-4030-9b8b-cc0667f5f425\', \'multiverseId\': 644738}, \'multiverseid\': 644738}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Entre e associe-se à nossa seleta casta de espiões, ludibriadores e manipuladores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f479a470-5999-40cc-9275-c0f5b4a1e80c\', \'multiverseId\': 645029}, \'multiverseid\': 645029}, {\'name\': \'底密尔公会门\', \'text\': \'底密尔公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地 — 门\', \'flavor\': \'此门将助有志者成为谍报、谎言和欺骗大师。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'871a9e73-2fea-4439-96a1-c8cc7e1ba876\', \'multiverseId\': 645320}, \'multiverseid\': 645320}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Dimir-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Tritt ein und lerne Täuschung, Spionieren sowie Lug und Trug.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e54e999-70de-42e4-a4a6-f01f07e1c166\', \'multiverseId\': 645611}, \'multiverseid\': 645611}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Dimir\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete y conviértete en un maestro de espías, del engaño y las mentiras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8849e56a-b410-4146-804b-664ec134de9d\', \'multiverseId\': 645725}, \'multiverseid\': 645725}, {\'name\': \'Porte de la guilde de Dimir\', \'text\': \'La Porte de la guilde de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — porte\', \'flavor\': "Entrez pour devenir maître de l\'espionnage, du mensonge et de la tromperie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178ffec2-1065-43a9-bafa-3c1a42bb7ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 645839}, \'multiverseid\': 645839}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrate per diventare creatori di spie, inganni e trucchi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e393b41d-e474-437b-9909-03a94b9bccea\', \'multiverseId\': 645953}, \'multiverseid\': 645953}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアのギルド門\', \'text\': \'ディミーアのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'ここに入れ。それが諜報、謀略、詐欺の達人となる道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1382fd7e-57c6-48a6-8504-3293e660d401\', \'multiverseId\': 646067}, \'multiverseid\': 646067}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Entre e associe-se à nossa seleta casta de espiões, ludibriadores e manipuladores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e928d4b3-a606-4b2e-aa0b-49e46b23481d\', \'multiverseId\': 646181}, \'multiverseid\': 646181}, {\'name\': \'底密尔公会门\', \'text\': \'底密尔公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地 — 门\', \'flavor\': \'此门将助有志者成为谍报、谎言和欺骗大师。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40cc8d2b-15e1-44cd-8baf-0672a9f87262\', \'multiverseId\': 646295}, \'multiverseid\': 646295}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Gildenmagier\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\\n{3}{B}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft eine Karte ab. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d880b7-9066-459b-9a58-5263ecc85f73\', \'multiverseId\': 643476}, \'multiverseid\': 643476}, {\'name\': \'Mago del Gremio Dimir\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: El jugador objetivo roba una carta. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\\n{3}{B}: El jugador objetivo descarta una carta. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cf521cb-ffb3-4fc0-8e60-bddb92059cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 643767}, \'multiverseid\': 643767}, {\'name\': \'Ghildmage de Dimir\', \'text\': "{3}{U} : Un joueur ciblé pioche une carte. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\n{3}{B} : Un joueur ciblé se défausse d\'une carte. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644058&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cece6f19-c5cd-46f9-980f-c7c0581c423f\', \'multiverseId\': 644058}, \'multiverseid\': 644058}, {\'name\': \'Mago della Gilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Un giocatore bersaglio pesca una carta. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\\n{3}{B}: Un giocatore bersaglio scarta una carta. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9faf02f-6b11-4e0f-ae60-0eedc2c29e73\', \'multiverseId\': 644349}, \'multiverseid\': 644349}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアのギルド魔道士\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\\n{3}{B}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e984d6a8-42f5-4ba2-920f-486ce03a6bd8\', \'multiverseId\': 644640}, \'multiverseid\': 644640}, {\'name\': \'Mago da Guilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: O jogador alvo compra um card. Ative somente como um feitiço.\\n{3}{B}: O jogador alvo descarta um card. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e99dd0cc-b5da-4f3f-9f59-41584b7bdaf6\', \'multiverseId\': 644931}, \'multiverseid\': 644931}, {\'name\': \'底密尔公会法师\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：目标牌手抓一张牌。只能于法术时机起动。\\n{3}{B}：目标牌手弃一张牌。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c37afc-b0cd-458b-888a-1685b7ff6142\', \'multiverseId\': 645222}, \'multiverseid\': 645222}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Symbol der Dimir bekommen nur die eigenen Mitglieder als Erkennungszeichen der geheimen Gilde zu sehen — und die Verdammten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d283bcbd-6aef-411e-be18-d616af0ce911\', \'multiverseId\': 643554}, \'multiverseid\': 643554}, {\'name\': \'Sello dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Como emblema de un gremio secreto, la insignia dimir solo la conocen sus propios miembros... y los condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e76024a-e008-4cad-916a-0c1d5d3e2968\', \'multiverseId\': 643845}, \'multiverseid\': 643845}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'insigne de Dimir est l\'emblème d\'une guilde secrète, et seuls ses membres le voient — ses membres, mais aussi ses victimes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a865edf0-f62b-460b-9619-3fc0bdd9156c\', \'multiverseId\': 644136}, \'multiverseid\': 644136}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema di una gilda segreta, le insegne dei Dimir possono essere viste solo dai suoi membri e da coloro che sono condannati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e105786-239f-4a6e-aae7-a064c249c68d\', \'multiverseId\': 644427}, \'multiverseid\': 644427}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの印は秘密のギルドの紋章であり、それを見ることのできるのは自分たちの仲間たち、そして消し去られる運命の者だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce5fb0a-84d0-437f-a3eb-722c6172c834\', \'multiverseId\': 644718}, \'multiverseid\': 644718}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema de uma guilda secreta, a insígnia Dimir só é vista por seus próprios membros — e pelos condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8678b05c-96fb-48fe-b16d-93573462debb\', \'multiverseId\': 645009}, \'multiverseid\': 645009}, {\'name\': \'底密尔印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'秘密存在的底密尔公会，其徽记没有外人见过～除了手底亡魂之外。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a27ad3ba-3be2-4624-a859-addace93186a\', \'multiverseId\': 645300}, \'multiverseid\': 645300}]', '[{\'name\': \'Domri Rade\', \'text\': \'+1: Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, kannst du sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen.\\n−2: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n−7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Doppelschlag, Fluchsicherheit, Eile und verursachen Trampelschaden."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Domri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'573ef842-218f-420c-89b9-1aa6ea5c9420\', \'multiverseId\': 643477}, \'multiverseid\': 643477}, {\'name\': \'Domri Rade\', \'text\': \'+1: Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura, puedes mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano.\\n−2: La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra otra criatura objetivo.\\n−7: Obtienes un emblema con "Las criaturas que controlas tienen las habilidades de dañar dos veces, arrollar, antimaleficio y prisa".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Domri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799bfdfe-aefa-44d9-bc95-4580a6322f76\', \'multiverseId\': 643768}, \'multiverseid\': 643768}, {\'name\': \'Domri Rade\', \'text\': "+1: Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature, vous pouvez la révéler et la mettre dans votre main.\\n-2 : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une autre créature ciblée.\\n-7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la double initiative, le piétinement, la défense talismanique et la célérité. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire — Domri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644059&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e584627-4f34-4086-b366-ab386e95acc5\', \'multiverseId\': 644059}, \'multiverseid\': 644059}, {\'name\': \'Domri Rade\', \'text\': \'+1: Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura, puoi rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano.\\n−2: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con un\\\'altra creatura bersaglio.\\n−7: Ottieni un emblema con "Le creature che controlli hanno doppio attacco, travolgere, anti-malocchio e rapidità".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Domri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa3c20fd-a145-4ed7-87d0-e9f44a870a12\', \'multiverseId\': 644350}, \'multiverseid\': 644350}, {\'name\': \'ドムリ・ラーデ\', \'text\': \'＋1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。\\n－２：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。\\n－７：あなたは「あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃とトランプルと呪禁と速攻を持つ。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ドムリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a678734-ec1f-40f2-934f-106fc813e270\', \'multiverseId\': 644641}, \'multiverseid\': 644641}, {\'name\': \'Domri Rade\', \'text\': \'+1: Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura, você poderá revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão.\\n−2: A criatura alvo que você controla luta com outra criatura alvo.\\n−7: Você recebe um emblema com "As criaturas que você controla têm golpe duplo, atropelar, resistência a magia e ímpeto."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Domri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1807be05-c908-4779-a840-5be4a1920a40\', \'multiverseId\': 644932}, \'multiverseid\': 644932}, {\'name\': \'多密雷德\', \'text\': \'+1：检视你的牌库顶牌。如果它是生物牌，则你可以展示该牌并置于你手上。\\n−2：目标由你操控的生物与另一个目标生物互斗。\\n−7：你获得具有以下异能的徽记～「由你操控的生物具有连击、践踏、辟邪与敏捷异能。」\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 — 多密\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'513b2022-6125-4df5-80b7-72f2f8333405\', \'multiverseId\': 645223}, \'multiverseid\': 645223}]', "[{'name': 'Dreschen // Drohen // Dreschen // Drohen', 'text': 'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber // Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dreschen // Drohen', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643544&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'babd5c56-bd9e-4b56-bbf3-4eb222daa425', 'multiverseId': 643544}, 'multiverseid': 643544}, {'name': 'Apalear // Aprestar // Apalear // Aprestar', 'text': 'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que no controlas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo // Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Apalear // Aprestar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643835&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fc5c0aa-fdb4-4ab4-9efc-48a807dd64a0', 'multiverseId': 643835}, 'multiverseid': 643835}, {'name': 'Briser // Braver // Briser // Braver', 'text': 'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, que vous ne contrôlez pas.', 'type': 'Éphémère // Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Briser // Braver', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644126&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d70afd3-bb0c-4b9c-986a-daaa049e7424', 'multiverseId': 644126}, 'multiverseid': 644126}, {'name': 'Percuotere // Pericolo // Percuotere // Pericolo', 'text': 'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio che non controlli.', 'type': 'Istantaneo // Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Percuotere // Pericolo', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644417&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37009e20-f104-462d-b4b2-fb9d2249c013', 'multiverseId': 644417}, 'multiverseid': 644417}, {'name': '強撃 // 脅威 // 強撃 // 脅威', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしていない１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント // ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '強撃 // 脅威', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644708&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57a85886-8d48-4621-a79d-d339fd1c7602', 'multiverseId': 644708}, 'multiverseid': 644708}, {'name': 'Arruinar // Ameaçar // Arruinar // Ameaçar', 'text': 'A criatura alvo que você controla causa dano igual ao seu poder à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que você não controla.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea // Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Arruinar // Ameaçar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644999&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b5073b1-6e6c-4529-940e-78442cd97154', 'multiverseId': 644999}, 'multiverseid': 644999}, {'name': '威击 // 威胁 // 威击 // 威胁', 'text': '目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。', 'type': '瞬间 // 法术', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '威击 // 威胁', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645290&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '698b94f7-5356-4248-9a93-d17cc5759638', 'multiverseId': 645290}, 'multiverseid': 645290}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunkler Mitwisser\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments deckst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf und nimmst sie auf deine Hand. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Erhabenheit um jeden Preis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7642e626-c983-4aa0-aac6-302a6600d3ef\', \'multiverseId\': 643369}, \'multiverseid\': 643369}, {\'name\': \'Confidente oscuro\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca y ponla en tu mano. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Grandeza, cueste lo que cueste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8bf1f4a-00cc-40c1-bfcb-a44a2422e934\', \'multiverseId\': 643660}, \'multiverseid\': 643660}, {\'name\': \'Obscur confident\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et mettez-la dans votre main. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'La noblesse, à tout prix.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643951&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'596853d8-ce6f-4a2b-bd5c-dc27ea18c829\', \'multiverseId\': 643951}, \'multiverseid\': 643951}, {\'name\': \'Confidente Oscuro\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio e aggiungila alla tua mano. Perdi punti vita pari al suo valore di mana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gloria, a ogni costo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92828295-dd11-4d25-8db6-6a2bc5d83fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 644242}, \'multiverseid\': 644242}, {\'name\': \'闇の腹心\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加え、あなたはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'あらゆる犠牲が払われた偉大さ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402cbb65-0666-47f3-8021-19fa96e4c2b0\', \'multiverseId\': 644533}, \'multiverseid\': 644533}, {\'name\': \'Confidente Sombrio\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, revele o card do topo de seu grimório e coloque-o em sua mão. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana dele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Grandeza a qualquer custo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc94d5c5-a434-4e9e-8550-bfdd95012cf5\', \'multiverseId\': 644824}, \'multiverseid\': 644824}, {\'name\': \'黑暗亲信\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，展示你的牌库顶牌，并将该牌置于你手上。你失去等同于其法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'追求卓越，不计代价。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07946b50-d04b-44e6-877c-ff882519d408\', \'multiverseId\': 645115}, \'multiverseid\': 645115}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkler Mitwisser\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments deckst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf und nimmst sie auf deine Hand. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Erhabenheit um jeden Preis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7afd66-1c98-4028-a2e5-3cf2f1ef3ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 645534}, \'multiverseid\': 645534}, {\'name\': \'Confidente oscuro\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca y ponla en tu mano. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Grandeza, cueste lo que cueste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5396dfed-c02c-421f-8b80-46b3bae21974\', \'multiverseId\': 645648}, \'multiverseid\': 645648}, {\'name\': \'Obscur confident\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et mettez-la dans votre main. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'La noblesse, à tout prix.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31acf00-640e-4b70-91ee-12c6f71d6073\', \'multiverseId\': 645762}, \'multiverseid\': 645762}, {\'name\': \'Confidente Oscuro\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio e aggiungila alla tua mano. Perdi punti vita pari al suo valore di mana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gloria, a ogni costo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c812e0-7809-4e57-814e-507bcd722dae\', \'multiverseId\': 645876}, \'multiverseid\': 645876}, {\'name\': \'闇の腹心\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加え、あなたはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'あらゆる犠牲が払われた偉大さ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d573dc-481d-40cc-baaa-3ac23cd5da9d\', \'multiverseId\': 645990}, \'multiverseid\': 645990}, {\'name\': \'Confidente Sombrio\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, revele o card do topo de seu grimório e coloque-o em sua mão. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana dele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Grandeza a qualquer custo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbb9f1c-4ae0-421a-97ae-3fb716c6a114\', \'multiverseId\': 646104}, \'multiverseid\': 646104}, {\'name\': \'黑暗亲信\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，展示你的牌库顶牌，并将该牌置于你手上。你失去等同于其法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'追求卓越，不计代价。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af8cc77b-0e4c-48cc-b244-713afca455b5\', \'multiverseId\': 646218}, \'multiverseid\': 646218}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonenfeuer\', \'text\': \'Das Dämonenfeuer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu. Falls eine Kreatur, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\\nVersessenheit — Falls du keine Karten auf der Hand hast, kann dieser Zauberspruch nicht neutralisiert und der Schaden nicht verhindert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643405&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f2f20d9-2775-431c-a947-7076587a9203\', \'multiverseId\': 643405}, \'multiverseid\': 643405}, {\'name\': \'Fuego demoníaco\', \'text\': \'El Fuego demoníaco hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. Si una criatura que recibió daño de esta manera fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\\nTemerario — Si no tienes cartas en tu mano, este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado y el daño no puede ser prevenido.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5938b166-7c06-4112-a8ce-a8a49a164c94\', \'multiverseId\': 643696}, \'multiverseid\': 643696}, {\'name\': \'Feu démoniaque\', \'text\': "Le Feu démoniaque inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. Si une créature ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.\\nAcharnement — Si vous n\'avez pas de carte en main, ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré et les blessures ne peuvent pas être prévenues.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643987&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e072569-7132-4cee-86e8-7eca5e4c3495\', \'multiverseId\': 643987}, \'multiverseid\': 643987}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco Demoniaco\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco Demoniaco infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Se una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\\nDeterminazione — Se non hai carte in mano, questa magia non può essere neutralizzata e il danno non può essere prevenuto.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5588c52a-db9e-4f44-9cf7-123178bdffd9\', \'multiverseId\': 644278}, \'multiverseid\': 644278}, {\'name\': \'悪魔火\', \'text\': \'１つを対象とする。悪魔火はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを受けたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\n暴勇 ― あなたの手札にカードが無いなら、この呪文は打ち消されず、そのダメージは軽減されない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a435fa-cdf5-4db9-ae6b-1abbb3497b86\', \'multiverseId\': 644569}, \'multiverseid\': 644569}, {\'name\': \'Fogueira Demoníaca\', \'text\': \'Fogueira Demoníaca causa X pontos de dano a qualquer alvo. Se uma criatura que sofreu dano dessa maneira morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\\nDeterminação — Se você não tiver nenhum card na mão, esta mágica não poderá ser anulada e o dano não poderá ser prevenido.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b59c80-e4b6-4300-94f8-c73c38520943\', \'multiverseId\': 644860}, \'multiverseid\': 644860}, {\'name\': \'恶魔焰\', \'text\': \'恶魔焰对任意一个目标造成X点伤害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\\n背水战～如果你没有手牌，则此咒语不能被反击且伤害不能被防止。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e138ae-0cec-4012-abb7-d97e709b2d73\', \'multiverseId\': 645151}, \'multiverseid\': 645151}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eifer des Ordnungshüters\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nAddendum — Falls du diesen Zauberspruch während deiner Hauptphase gewirkt hast, erhält die Kreatur Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gesetze sind die Leuchtfeuer der Zivilisation."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643302&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'295ce755-2d61-4854-945c-1dd9eb2c64e2\', \'multiverseId\': 643302}, \'multiverseid\': 643302}, {\'name\': \'Fervor del encarcelador\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\\nAdenda — Si lanzas este hechizo durante tu fase principal, esa criatura gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La ley es la luz de la civilización".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e611a0-039f-4c2e-ae1f-f58d6410e870\', \'multiverseId\': 643593}, \'multiverseid\': 643593}, {\'name\': \'Zèle du courtier\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nAddenda — Si vous avez lancé ce sort pendant votre phase principale, cette créature acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La loi est le phare de la civilisation. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e8894f0-fe61-466a-acc8-668788b8eabc\', \'multiverseId\': 643884}, \'multiverseid\': 643884}, {\'name\': "Zelo dell\'Agente di Polizia", \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nAppendice — Se hai lanciato questa magia durante la tua fase principale, quella creatura ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La legge è la luce della civiltà."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e01cae3-863b-47e4-977b-692246b34f12\', \'multiverseId\': 644175}, \'multiverseid\': 644175}, {\'name\': \'拘引者の熱情\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n附則 ― あなたがこの呪文をあなたのメイン・フェイズ中に唱えたなら、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「法は文明の光だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73718d1-6403-45dc-ba0a-85c9180fdf58\', \'multiverseId\': 644466}, \'multiverseid\': 644466}, {\'name\': \'Zelo do Encarcerador\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\\nAdendo — Se você conjurou esta mágica durante sua fase principal, aquela criatura ganhará voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A lei é a luz da civilização."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2c15c43-730e-43cf-854e-0eb2c1d26a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 644757}, \'multiverseid\': 644757}, {\'name\': \'逮捕人热忱\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\\n附案～如果你是在你的行动阶段施放此咒语，则该生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「律法是文明之光。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9891b7fb-9860-4250-9f84-bfb6e48eee18\', \'multiverseId\': 645048}, \'multiverseid\': 645048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engelsgleicher Edelmut\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn uns der Friede nicht vergönnt ist, werden wir zumindest Gerechtigkeit haben."\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643300&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'597e6090-695a-4931-9e1c-1da7760b4c49\', \'multiverseId\': 643300}, \'multiverseid\': 643300}, {\'name\': \'Exaltación angélica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Si no podemos tener la paz, tendremos justicia".\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a8a033-338e-4aab-8e35-8db1b5b76486\', \'multiverseId\': 643591}, \'multiverseid\': 643591}, {\'name\': \'Exaltation angélique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Si nous ne pouvons obtenir la paix, nous obtiendrons justice. »\\n—Aurélia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe702c5-adff-4fc3-abfa-01a615f64fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 643882}, \'multiverseid\': 643882}, {\'name\': \'Esaltazione Angelica\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non possiamo portare la pace, porteremo la giustizia."\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb9f998b-71cf-43f9-9b34-6809be37b7a4\', \'multiverseId\': 644173}, \'multiverseid\': 644173}, {\'name\': \'天使の称賛\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「平和を手にできないとしても、我々の手には正義がある。」\\n――オレリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d913d730-6ba3-4a31-a09e-c46cd56b1265\', \'multiverseId\': 644464}, \'multiverseid\': 644464}, {\'name\': \'Exaltação Angelical\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X o número de criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Se não pudermos ter paz, teremos justiça."\\n— Aurélia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582e1bb9-a018-4e27-968a-c47df1caf1db\', \'multiverseId\': 644755}, \'multiverseid\': 644755}, {\'name\': \'天使颂赞\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，它得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为由你操控的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「如果和平不保，我们必将昭彰正义。」\\n～欧瑞梨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3178169-f7fd-422c-9315-690bdd14f79f\', \'multiverseId\': 645046}, \'multiverseid\': 645046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entzweiender Schamane\', \'text\': \'Der Entzweiende Schamane kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn der Entzweiende Schamane einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ihr uns die Wildnis nehmt, nehmen wir euch eure Stadt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d919593c-ba32-42e5-94f6-c9aa5df3ef33\', \'multiverseId\': 643528}, \'multiverseid\': 643528}, {\'name\': \'Chamán desgarrador\', \'text\': \'El Chamán desgarrador no puede ser bloqueado por más de una criatura.\\nSiempre que el Chamán desgarrador haga daño de combate a un jugador, destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Ustedes conquistaron nuestros bosques; nosotros conquistamos su ciudad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d44982bd-6db0-4d7a-bd58-262e3b84ca24\', \'multiverseId\': 643819}, \'multiverseid\': 643819}, {\'name\': \'Shamane de scission\', \'text\': "Le Shamane de scission ne peut pas être bloqué par plus d\'une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Shamane de scission inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement, que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature — géant et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous prenez nos contrées sauvages, nous prenons votre ville. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa64cad-2aa0-41ae-8bf0-6cff8fd46cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 644110}, \'multiverseid\': 644110}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano della Demolizione\', \'text\': \'Lo Sciamano della Demolizione non può essere bloccato da più di una creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta lo Sciamano della Demolizione infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Voi vi prendete le nostre terre selvagge, noi ci prendiamo la vostra città."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e63d0fb-aada-4636-8115-29374a76a900\', \'multiverseId\': 644401}, \'multiverseid\': 644401}, {\'name\': \'引き裂くシャーマン\', \'text\': \'引き裂くシャーマンは、２体以上のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\\n引き裂くシャーマンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうちそのプレイヤーがコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「お前ら、俺たちの自然奪う。俺たち、お前らの街奪う。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb25695-e4dd-4aa5-b6d0-07c4246b41a3\', \'multiverseId\': 644692}, \'multiverseid\': 644692}, {\'name\': \'Xamã Rachador\', \'text\': \'Xamã Rachador não pode ser bloqueado por mais de uma criatura.\\nToda vez que Xamã Rachador causar dano de combate a um jogador, destrua o artefato ou o encantamento alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Vocês tomaram nossas matas, nós tomamos sua cidade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146294af-b813-4726-9d9c-1f6ae2323953\', \'multiverseId\': 644983}, \'multiverseid\': 644983}, {\'name\': \'粉碎祭师\', \'text\': \'粉碎祭师不能被多于一个生物阻挡。\\n每当粉碎祭师对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，消灭目标由该牌手操控的神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「你们夺走我们的荒野，我们就夺走你们的城市。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77578e4-2bf4-4935-b237-68e99a626422\', \'multiverseId\': 645274}, \'multiverseid\': 645274}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erschleichen // Ersinnen // Erschleichen // Ersinnen\', \'text\': \'Übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 2 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei // Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Erschleichen // Ersinnen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e9b94f-c02b-4f2c-a6a7-ec30b10cd48a\', \'multiverseId\': 643540}, \'multiverseid\': 643540}, {\'name\': \'Confabular // Confeccionar // Confabular // Confeccionar\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 2 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro // Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Confabular // Confeccionar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf492f1b-da7e-4609-9667-9d9c16f5c068\', \'multiverseId\': 643831}, \'multiverseid\': 643831}, {\'name\': \'Connivence // Concoction // Connivence // Concoction\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée avec une force inférieure ou égale à 2.", \'type\': \'Rituel // Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Connivence // Concoction\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4aa82cf-344c-4a24-9507-7b781e3585bb\', \'multiverseId\': 644122}, \'multiverseid\': 644122}, {\'name\': \'Mistificare // Mistura // Mistificare // Mistura\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria // Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Mistificare // Mistura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3065be37-a0cd-4799-a1b3-188595999135\', \'multiverseId\': 644413}, \'multiverseid\': 644413}, {\'name\': \'詭謀 // 奇策 // 詭謀 // 奇策\', \'text\': \'パワーが２以下であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー // ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'詭謀 // 奇策\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13d3f65b-d08f-4b52-8168-3b02493f1d89\', \'multiverseId\': 644704}, \'multiverseid\': 644704}, {\'name\': \'Conivente // Concoctante // Conivente // Concoctante\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço // Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Conivente // Concoctante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f2d3fcf-de54-4e28-98c3-1b787fb9e775\', \'multiverseId\': 644995}, \'multiverseid\': 644995}, {\'name\': \'研谋 // 研药\', \'text\': \'获得目标力量等于或小于2之生物的操控权。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'研谋\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32a4dd54-4227-48e9-9e09-34ee9ffd070e\', \'multiverseId\': 645286}, \'multiverseid\': 645286}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzwungene Anpassung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf die verzauberte Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir säen die Samen der Veränderung. Manchmal säen wir sie in Menschen."\\n—Vorel von der Hülsenklade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643438&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e84f228a-9141-4538-8236-0f31c7761961\', \'multiverseId\': 643438}, \'multiverseid\': 643438}, {\'name\': \'Adaptación forzosa\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Plantamos las semillas del cambio. A veces, las plantamos en personas".\\n—Vorel del Clado de la Vaina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0898647a-e796-4083-a828-67b58ca9e6df\', \'multiverseId\': 643729}, \'multiverseid\': 643729}, {\'name\': \'Adaptation forcée\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature enchantée.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous plantons les graines du changement. Parfois, nous les plantons dans des gens. »\\n—Vorel du Cladus Coque\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644020&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdfe2b32-7d0a-4a75-981d-f3380b75c63f\', \'multiverseId\': 644020}, \'multiverseid\': 644020}, {\'name\': \'Adattamento Forzato\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla creatura incantata.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Stiamo piantando i semi del cambiamento. Qualche volta li piantiamo nelle persone."\\n—Vorel del Clade del Carapace\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47fbaa99-c0c0-4dfd-9352-854e3a3e16f5\', \'multiverseId\': 644311}, \'multiverseid\': 644311}, {\'name\': \'強制順応\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、エンチャントしているクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は変革の種を植えているのだ。ときにはその種を人体にも植える。」\\n――育殻組のヴォレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1032eaa-169f-4614-bcd9-015418a93bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 644602}, \'multiverseid\': 644602}, {\'name\': \'Adaptação Forçada\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos plantando as sementes da mudança. Às vezes, as plantamos nas pessoas."\\n— Vorel da Cepa do Casco\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c711086-8c16-4633-a4bb-58d75615c305\', \'multiverseId\': 644893}, \'multiverseid\': 644893}, {\'name\': \'受迫适应\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n在你的维持开始时，在所结附的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「我们正在散播改变的种子。有时候，我们会种在人身上。」\\n～壳进化组的沃瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7119d1e-86c0-401b-8287-7a953cddbe3a\', \'multiverseId\': 645184}, \'multiverseid\': 645184}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzwungene Landung\', \'text\': \'Lege eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Druidin kannte nur einen Zauberspruch, der das Wachstum von Pflanzen anregte. Als fliegende Verewigte ihren Garten angriffen, wurde sie kreativ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643439&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5646ea2b-d015-4abc-8bcb-127ac0a17608\', \'multiverseId\': 643439}, \'multiverseid\': 643439}, {\'name\': \'Aterrizaje forzado\', \'text\': \'Pon la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La druida solo conocía un hechizo: un encantamiento para que las plantas crecieran más rápido. Cuando los eternos voladores invadieron su arboreto, tuvo que emplear su creatividad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e36991-af61-47d2-83aa-0b3d781fb6fa\', \'multiverseId\': 643730}, \'multiverseid\': 643730}, {\'name\': \'Atterrissage forcé\', \'text\': \'Mettez une créature avec le vol ciblée au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La druidesse ne connaissait qu\'un seul sort : un charme pour stimuler la croissance des plantes. Quand les Éternels envahirent son arboretum par les airs, elle dut se montrer créative.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644021&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf997810-0b75-4917-b425-d123be40f913\', \'multiverseId\': 644021}, \'multiverseid\': 644021}, {\'name\': \'Atterraggio Forzato\', \'text\': \'Metti una creatura bersaglio con volare in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La druida conosceva solo una magia, un incantesimo per favorire la rapida crescita delle piante. Quando gli Eterni volanti invasero il suo arboreto, dovette ricorrere alla creatività.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41c20a2-b32a-4575-ab52-2da700890bd4\', \'multiverseId\': 644312}, \'multiverseid\': 644312}, {\'name\': \'強制着陸\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'そのドルイドが知る呪文はただ一つ、植物を急速に育む魔法であった。永遠衆が空から樹木園を襲ったとき、彼女は必死に知恵を絞った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64fc9a85-b114-40bc-9eaf-8c5b6b541170\', \'multiverseId\': 644603}, \'multiverseid\': 644603}, {\'name\': \'Aterrissagem Forçada\', \'text\': \'Coloque a criatura alvo com voar no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A druida só conhecia uma mágica, um encanto para incentivar o crescimento rápido de plantas. Quando os Eternos voadores invadiram seu arboreto, ela precisou ser criativa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e3e769-d79e-46c5-8834-bbff618549c3\', \'multiverseId\': 644894}, \'multiverseid\': 644894}, {\'name\': \'强令着陆\', \'text\': \'将目标具飞行异能的生物置于其拥有者的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'看护植物园的德鲁伊只晓得一种咒语：滋养植物快速生长的符咒。当飞空永生者入侵她的地界时，她必须发挥创意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6171d55-3533-46bd-b78e-d122a79df9e0\', \'multiverseId\': 645185}, \'multiverseid\': 645185}]', '[{\'name\': \'Expansion // Explosion // Expansion // Explosion\', \'text\': \'Kopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 4 oder weniger. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber // Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Expansion // Explosion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbea3a5a-6bfc-4bc8-a1f5-4aea8424dee5\', \'multiverseId\': 643541}, \'multiverseid\': 643541}, {\'name\': \'Expansión // Explosión // Expansión // Explosión\', \'text\': \'Copia el hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo con valor de maná de 4 o menos. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo // Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Expansión // Explosión\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c60bdc-442f-496a-9e34-634c3eec32c0\', \'multiverseId\': 643832}, \'multiverseid\': 643832}, {\'name\': \'Expansion // Explosion // Expansion // Explosion\', \'text\': "Copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 4. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère // Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Expansion // Explosion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44be9565-5460-4c7e-b14e-8eac670d4185\', \'multiverseId\': 644123}, \'multiverseid\': 644123}, {\'name\': \'Espansione // Esplosività // Espansione // Esplosività\', \'text\': \'Copia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 4. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo // Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Espansione // Esplosività\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8df2ed0-ceef-45eb-8452-7b33875d75c3\', \'multiverseId\': 644414}, \'multiverseid\': 644414}, {\'name\': \'発展 // 発破 // 発展 // 発破\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が４以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント // インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'発展 // 発破\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41be5916-d0ab-41b3-ac5c-13d7de73d9bd\', \'multiverseId\': 644705}, \'multiverseid\': 644705}, {\'name\': \'Expansão // Explosão // Expansão // Explosão\', \'text\': \'Copie a mágica instantânea ou o feitiço alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 4. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea // Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Expansão // Explosão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37063ac-764f-45f8-aa90-f35422c1122b\', \'multiverseId\': 644996}, \'multiverseid\': 644996}, {\'name\': \'迸增 // 迸裂 // 迸增 // 迸裂\', \'text\': \'复制目标法术力值等于或小于4的瞬间或法术咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'瞬间 // 瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'迸增 // 迸裂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'586fb694-b6fe-4c8f-a7d3-dbfe6634da3d\', \'multiverseId\': 645287}, \'multiverseid\': 645287}]', '[{\'name\': \'Experiment Eins\', \'text\': \'Weiterentwicklung (Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt und falls deren Stärke oder Widerstandskraft höher ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur.)\\nEntferne zwei +1/+1-Marken von Experiment Eins: Regeneriere Experiment Eins. (Das nächste Mal, dass diese Kreatur zerstört würde, tappe sie stattdessen, entferne sie aus dem Kampf und heile allen auf ihr vermerkten Schaden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643435&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'153dd18c-d9c5-41a0-8dd6-40e779476b85\', \'multiverseId\': 643435}, \'multiverseid\': 643435}, {\'name\': \'Experimento uno\', \'text\': \'Evolucionar. (Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, si la fuerza o la resistencia de esa criatura es mayor que la de esta criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura.)\\nRemover dos contadores +1/+1 del Experimento uno: Regenera el Experimento uno. (La próxima vez que esta criatura fuese a ser destruida, en vez de eso, gírala, remuévela del combate y cura todo el daño que haya recibido.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'037b6c9a-b976-4589-bc34-75ca86d18ac6\', \'multiverseId\': 643726}, \'multiverseid\': 643726}, {\'name\': \'Expérience Un\', \'text\': "Évolution (À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, si sa force ou son endurance est supérieure à celle de cette créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.)\\nRetirez deux marqueurs +1/+1 de l\'Expérience Un : Régénérez l\'Expérience Un. (La prochaine fois que cette créature devrait être détruite, à la place, engagez-la, retirez-la du combat et soignez toutes ses blessures.)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644017&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbb5d053-3361-4d39-8608-7da5599d3712\', \'multiverseId\': 644017}, \'multiverseid\': 644017}, {\'name\': \'Primo Esperimento\', \'text\': \'Evoluzione (Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, se quella creatura ha forza o costituzione maggiori di questa creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura.)\\nRimuovi due segnalini +1/+1 dal Primo Esperimento: Rigenera il Primo Esperimento. (La prossima volta che questa creatura sta per essere distrutta, invece TAPpala, rimuovila dal combattimento e cura tutti i suoi danni.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'884a7052-1052-4dc1-b4cb-10859107fc3e\', \'multiverseId\': 644308}, \'multiverseid\': 644308}, {\'name\': \'実験体\', \'text\': \'進化（クリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーのパワーかタフネスがこのクリーチャーよりも大きい場合、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n実験体の上から＋１/＋１カウンター２個を取り除く：実験体を再生する。（このクリーチャーが次に破壊されるなら、代わりに、これをタップし、戦闘から取り除き、これが負っているすべてのダメージを回復する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb98adb8-309e-4803-bfc7-bcb7cdaed1b1\', \'multiverseId\': 644599}, \'multiverseid\': 644599}, {\'name\': \'Experimento Um\', \'text\': \'Evoluir (Toda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, se ela tiver poder ou resistência maior que o desta criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura.)\\nRemova dois marcadores +1/+1 de Experimento Um: Regenere Experimento Um. (Na próxima vez em que esta criatura seria destruída, em vez disso, vire-a, remova-a do combate e cure todo o dano marcado nela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lodo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'422fbbcf-f841-458c-87fd-c93b97fb143b\', \'multiverseId\': 644890}, \'multiverseid\': 644890}, {\'name\': \'首号实验体\', \'text\': \'进化（每当一个生物在你操控下进战场时，若该生物的力量或防御力大于此生物，则在后者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n从首号实验体上移去两个+1/+1指示物：重生首号实验体。（此生物下一次将被消灭时，改为将它横置、移出战斗，并治愈其上所有伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／流浆\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d18a4643-e0e9-4e44-82b0-9ed2f750234c\', \'multiverseId\': 645181}, \'multiverseid\': 645181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Experiment Eins\', \'text\': \'Weiterentwicklung\\nEntferne zwei +1/+1-Marken von Experiment Eins: Regeneriere Experiment Eins.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78527d46-5ccb-4f5e-947e-e49869eace29\', \'multiverseId\': 645557}, \'multiverseid\': 645557}, {\'name\': \'Experimento uno\', \'text\': \'Evolucionar.\\nRemover dos contadores +1/+1 del Experimento uno: Regenera el Experimento uno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cce4e9a-b287-44e7-92ab-488c8ccc88c8\', \'multiverseId\': 645671}, \'multiverseid\': 645671}, {\'name\': \'Expérience Un\', \'text\': "Évolution\\nRetirez deux marqueurs +1/+1 de l\'Expérience Un : Régénérez l\'Expérience Un.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8255c0ff-4bc8-4bfb-8a56-756bf3f03130\', \'multiverseId\': 645785}, \'multiverseid\': 645785}, {\'name\': \'Primo Esperimento\', \'text\': \'Evoluzione\\nRimuovi due segnalini +1/+1 dal Primo Esperimento: Rigenera il Primo Esperimento.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b277f6-ad1e-4e7c-9116-0a2838f0270e\', \'multiverseId\': 645899}, \'multiverseid\': 645899}, {\'name\': \'実験体\', \'text\': \'進化\\n実験体の上から＋１/＋１カウンター２個を取り除く：実験体を再生する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'036e00b6-70fc-43af-8eb1-5a12501655f9\', \'multiverseId\': 646013}, \'multiverseid\': 646013}, {\'name\': \'Experimento Um\', \'text\': \'Evoluir\\nRemova dois marcadores +1/+1 de Experimento Um: Regenere Experimento Um.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lodo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60bf0878-a8d1-4d94-b06f-fa539898f811\', \'multiverseId\': 646127}, \'multiverseid\': 646127}, {\'name\': \'首号实验体\', \'text\': \'进化\\n从首号实验体上移去两个+1/+1指示物：重生首号实验体。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／流浆\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b24f9eab-b185-4e4c-97de-42f5a6ba0175\', \'multiverseId\': 646241}, \'multiverseid\': 646241}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fblzzp der Irrläufer\', \'text\': \'Wenn Fblzzp der Irrläufer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte. Falls er aus deiner Bibliothek ins Spiel gekommen ist oder aus deiner Bibliothek gewirkt wurde, ziehe stattdessen zwei Karten.\\nWenn Fblzzp das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs wird, mische Fblzzp in die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Homunkulus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d08c5a6-ce62-4fb5-9486-5679ab9bf0b9\', \'multiverseId\': 643342}, \'multiverseid\': 643342}, {\'name\': \'Fblthp, el Perdido\', \'text\': \'Cuando Fblthp, el Perdido entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta. Si entró desde tu biblioteca o fue lanzado desde tu biblioteca, en vez de eso, roba dos cartas.\\nCuando Fblthp sea objetivo de un hechizo, baraja a Fblthp en la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Homúnculo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ac8d8b-3326-40b2-b0ef-613076859628\', \'multiverseId\': 643633}, \'multiverseid\': 643633}, {\'name\': "Fblthp, l\'égaré", \'text\': "Quand Fblthp, l\'égaré arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte. S\'il est arrivé ou qu\'il a été lancé depuis votre bibliothèque, piochez deux cartes à la place.\\nQuand Fblthp devient la cible d\'un sort, mélangez Fblthp dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — homoncule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a299a3fa-66b8-4733-a192-00746019b0a6\', \'multiverseId\': 643924}, \'multiverseid\': 643924}, {\'name\': \'Fblthp, il Disperso\', \'text\': \'Quando Fblthp, il Disperso entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta. Se è entrato dal tuo grimorio o è stato lanciato dal tuo grimorio, pesca invece due carte.\\nQuando Fblthp diventa bersaglio di una magia, rimescola Fblthp nel grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Omuncolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4172637-47a1-4736-b05a-741cd1465680\', \'multiverseId\': 644215}, \'multiverseid\': 644215}, {\'name\': \'迷い子、フブルスプ\', \'text\': \'迷い子、フブルスプが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。これがあなたのライブラリーから戦場に出たかあなたのライブラリーから唱えられていたなら、代わりに、カード２枚を引く。\\n迷い子、フブルスプが呪文の対象になったとき、迷い子、フブルスプをオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ホムンクルス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895183de-3937-45f2-95b0-514bade73d93\', \'multiverseId\': 644506}, \'multiverseid\': 644506}, {\'name\': \'Fblthp, o Perdido\', \'text\': \'Quando Fblthp, o Perdido, entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card. Se ele entrou vindo de seu grimório ou foi conjurado do seu grimório, em vez disso, compre dois cards.\\nQuando Fblthp se tornar alvo de uma mágica, embaralhe Fblthp no grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Homúnculo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88bb0827-c7b2-4eb3-9359-9d08eb98875d\', \'multiverseId\': 644797}, \'multiverseid\': 644797}, {\'name\': \'迷途的夫毕佐\', \'text\': \'当迷途的夫毕佐进战场时，抓一张牌。若它是从你的牌库进战场或从你的牌库施放，则改为抓两张牌。\\n当夫毕佐成为咒语的目标时，将夫毕佐洗入其拥有者的牌库。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 造妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b0a9f5d-159a-41af-8296-644e9a16ac33\', \'multiverseId\': 645088}, \'multiverseid\': 645088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fblzzp der Irrläufer\', \'text\': \'Wenn Fblzzp der Irrläufer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte. Falls er aus deiner Bibliothek ins Spiel gekommen ist oder aus deiner Bibliothek gewirkt wurde, ziehe stattdessen zwei Karten.\\nWenn Fblzzp das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs wird, mische Fblzzp in die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Homunkulus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3e1e4c-1f9c-406c-891d-949cee91bafa\', \'multiverseId\': 646373}, \'multiverseid\': 646373}, {\'name\': \'Fblthp, el Perdido\', \'text\': \'Cuando Fblthp, el Perdido entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta. Si entró desde tu biblioteca o fue lanzado desde tu biblioteca, en vez de eso, roba dos cartas.\\nCuando Fblthp sea objetivo de un hechizo, baraja a Fblthp en la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Homúnculo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfedaba-6932-481a-ba3e-d0dc226212e5\', \'multiverseId\': 646401}, \'multiverseid\': 646401}, {\'name\': "Fblthp, l\'égaré", \'text\': "Quand Fblthp, l\'égaré arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte. S\'il est arrivé ou qu\'il a été lancé depuis votre bibliothèque, piochez deux cartes à la place.\\nQuand Fblthp devient la cible d\'un sort, mélangez Fblthp dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — homoncule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea0c660-752d-4f06-8192-db0cf2e3ed3c\', \'multiverseId\': 646429}, \'multiverseid\': 646429}, {\'name\': \'Fblthp, il Disperso\', \'text\': \'Quando Fblthp, il Disperso entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta. Se è entrato dal tuo grimorio o è stato lanciato dal tuo grimorio, pesca invece due carte.\\nQuando Fblthp diventa bersaglio di una magia, rimescola Fblthp nel grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Omuncolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc4bd162-df4f-4f64-b1e9-a77457baaeb3\', \'multiverseId\': 646457}, \'multiverseid\': 646457}, {\'name\': \'迷い子、フブルスプ\', \'text\': \'迷い子、フブルスプが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。これがあなたのライブラリーから戦場に出たかあなたのライブラリーから唱えられていたなら、代わりに、カード２枚を引く。\\n迷い子、フブルスプが呪文の対象になったとき、迷い子、フブルスプをオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ホムンクルス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e937aa2b-647d-4548-823e-a2d3278b1a63\', \'multiverseId\': 646485}, \'multiverseid\': 646485}, {\'name\': \'Fblthp, o Perdido\', \'text\': \'Quando Fblthp, o Perdido, entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card. Se ele entrou vindo de seu grimório ou foi conjurado do seu grimório, em vez disso, compre dois cards.\\nQuando Fblthp se tornar alvo de uma mágica, embaralhe Fblthp no grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Homúnculo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8e09a0d-1dbc-4dff-9faa-ddc2bef98161\', \'multiverseId\': 646513}, \'multiverseid\': 646513}, {\'name\': \'迷途的夫毕佐\', \'text\': \'当迷途的夫毕佐进战场时，抓一张牌。若它是从你的牌库进战场或从你的牌库施放，则改为抓两张牌。\\n当夫毕佐成为咒语的目标时，将夫毕佐洗入其拥有者的牌库。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 造妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfadce67-8e3c-4bee-a85b-661b36587492\', \'multiverseId\': 646541}, \'multiverseid\': 646541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fernsuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-, Insel-, Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Stadt muss wirklich riesig sein, denn ich bin weit gereist und habe doch noch keinen Ort gefunden, wo die Gebäude aufhören."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643436&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f6283d3-e5ef-49e0-aafb-5d13524792ab\', \'multiverseId\': 643436}, \'multiverseid\': 643436}, {\'name\': \'Visión lejana\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, Isla, Pantano o Montaña, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es realmente tan vasta esta ciudad, que con todo lo que he viajado y visto, todavía no he encontrado un lugar donde no haya edificios".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3764d47d-beae-4f27-abfd-c04d4b8eabaf\', \'multiverseId\': 643727}, \'multiverseid\': 643727}, {\'name\': \'Cherchauloin\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, d\'île, de marais ou de montagne, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Que cette cité est vaste... J\'ai tant voyagé, j\'ai vu tant de choses, et pourtant, jamais je n\'ai trouvé un lieu où les constructions s\'arrêtent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644018&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b74a02-ec0b-402a-8497-d610415b9dd5\', \'multiverseId\': 644018}, \'multiverseid\': 644018}, {\'name\': \'Lungosguardo\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, Isola, Palude o Montagna, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Deve essere davvero vasta questa città, dato che l\\\'ho attraversata in lungo e in largo e non ho mai visto un punto in cui non ci fossero edifici."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de8b5c45-56e4-4038-a86a-a4f30f30fe25\', \'multiverseId\': 644309}, \'multiverseid\': 644309}, {\'name\': \'遥か見\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから平地や島や沼や山であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この都市は本当になんて巨大なんだろう。あちこちを旅して様々な物を見てきたけれど、どこを見ても建物が続いているよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13414db2-c744-4bca-a73b-b6dca1b58360\', \'multiverseId\': 644600}, \'multiverseid\': 644600}, {\'name\': \'Busca Longínqua\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, Ilha, Pântano ou Montanha, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O quão vasta pode realmente ser esta cidade? Eu já viajei para tão longe e vi tantas coisas e nunca cheguei ao lugar onde os prédios acabam."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41722db-d85f-4813-b0b8-77fd0744884e\', \'multiverseId\': 644891}, \'multiverseid\': 644891}, {\'name\': \'远眺\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张平原，海岛，沼泽或山脉牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这城市究竟广大到什么地步呢？我已旅行了那么远，看了那么多，却还没找到毫无建物的地方。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bfd16c8-27a7-4f49-98e1-a616fdbc96c8\', \'multiverseId\': 645182}, \'multiverseid\': 645182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fernsuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-, Insel-, Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Stadt muss wirklich riesig sein, denn ich bin weit gereist und habe doch noch keinen Ort gefunden, wo die Gebäude aufhören."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'677b7058-ad99-4311-a077-59b01cae1e67\', \'multiverseId\': 645558}, \'multiverseid\': 645558}, {\'name\': \'Visión lejana\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, Isla, Pantano o Montaña, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es realmente tan vasta esta ciudad, que con todo lo que he viajado y visto, todavía no he encontrado un lugar donde no haya edificios".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a0eff6a-ce81-4f3f-9c5e-0c579d164792\', \'multiverseId\': 645672}, \'multiverseid\': 645672}, {\'name\': \'Cherchauloin\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, d\'île, de marais ou de montagne, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Que cette cité est vaste... J\'ai tant voyagé, j\'ai vu tant de choses, et pourtant, jamais je n\'ai trouvé un lieu où les constructions s\'arrêtent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645786&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8efa93e5-ba8d-4692-b406-6b82b55f7203\', \'multiverseId\': 645786}, \'multiverseid\': 645786}, {\'name\': \'Lungosguardo\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, Isola, Palude o Montagna, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Deve essere davvero vasta questa città, dato che l\\\'ho attraversata in lungo e in largo e non ho mai visto un punto in cui non ci fossero edifici."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0579ca1-48b8-46ba-b968-ae43ae0abbe8\', \'multiverseId\': 645900}, \'multiverseid\': 645900}, {\'name\': \'遥か見\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから平地や島や沼や山であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この都市は本当になんて巨大なんだろう。あちこちを旅して様々な物を見てきたけれど、どこを見ても建物が続いているよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c389119e-f183-4093-8744-a26e3ba437c9\', \'multiverseId\': 646014}, \'multiverseid\': 646014}, {\'name\': \'Busca Longínqua\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, Ilha, Pântano ou Montanha, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O quão vasta pode realmente ser esta cidade? Eu já viajei para tão longe e vi tantas coisas e nunca cheguei ao lugar onde os prédios acabam."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ba27be-ea76-4ced-b595-5bbf816cabce\', \'multiverseId\': 646128}, \'multiverseid\': 646128}, {\'name\': \'远眺\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张平原，海岛，沼泽或山脉牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这城市究竟广大到什么地步呢？我已旅行了那么远，看了那么多，却还没找到毫无建物的地方。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4ce9e49-caa0-4204-91d4-c58c98e1d1ad\', \'multiverseId\': 646242}, \'multiverseid\': 646242}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fesseln des Glaubens\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Permanent\\nWenn die Fesseln des Glaubens ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nDas verzauberte Permanent kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, und seine aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden, es sei denn, es sind Manafähigkeiten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643316&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c9747e-f109-4bc6-95bf-58bccb1a4d42\', \'multiverseId\': 643316}, \'multiverseid\': 643316}, {\'name\': \'Grilletes de fe\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente.\\nCuando los Grilletes de fe entren al campo de batalla, ganas 4 vidas.\\nEl permanente encantado no puede atacar ni bloquear y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas, a menos que sean habilidades de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ed14aa-9129-4c7f-9bd7-c8804a2f6448\', \'multiverseId\': 643607}, \'multiverseid\': 643607}, {\'name\': \'Fers de la foi\', \'text\': "Enchanter : permanent\\nQuand les Fers de la foi arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\nLe permanent enchanté ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées à moins qu\'elles ne soient des capacités de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643898&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'122b00e9-bee6-4ca8-aea7-5020b525dc9d\', \'multiverseId\': 643898}, \'multiverseid\': 643898}, {\'name\': \'Pastoie della Fede\', \'text\': \'Incanta permanente\\nQuando le Pastoie della Fede entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 4 punti vita.\\nIl permanente incantato non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate a meno che non siano abilità di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e003bf37-b4d9-4916-8ccc-9f357ab67a01\', \'multiverseId\': 644189}, \'multiverseid\': 644189}, {\'name\': \'信仰の足枷\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\n信仰の足枷が戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力はマナ能力でないかぎり起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d9be5f-b652-47bf-bae0-d337792f7432\', \'multiverseId\': 644480}, \'multiverseid\': 644480}, {\'name\': \'Correntes da Fé\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente\\nQuando Correntes da Fé entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\\nA permanente encantada não pode atacar nem bloquear e suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas, a menos que sejam habilidades de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380fe3fc-ce5a-49d8-aad2-9d0aebe50bcf\', \'multiverseId\': 644771}, \'multiverseid\': 644771}, {\'name\': \'信念拘锁\', \'text\': \'结附于永久物\\n当信念拘锁进战场时，你获得4点生命。\\n所结附的永久物不能进行攻击或阻挡，且除了法术力异能之外，其起动式异能也不能起动。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb89d45-5cd0-42c7-a0fc-617bf093853a\', \'multiverseId\': 645062}, \'multiverseid\': 645062}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fesseln des Glaubens\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Permanent\\nWenn die Fesseln des Glaubens ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nDas verzauberte Permanent kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, und seine aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden, es sei denn, es sind Manafähigkeiten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11778e48-6914-4ceb-8533-cda7385bd5f6\', \'multiverseId\': 645518}, \'multiverseid\': 645518}, {\'name\': \'Grilletes de fe\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente.\\nCuando los Grilletes de fe entren al campo de batalla, ganas 4 vidas.\\nEl permanente encantado no puede atacar ni bloquear y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas, a menos que sean habilidades de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f110c9e-cfab-4feb-89c1-406597d4100a\', \'multiverseId\': 645632}, \'multiverseid\': 645632}, {\'name\': \'Fers de la foi\', \'text\': "Enchanter : permanent\\nQuand les Fers de la foi arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\nLe permanent enchanté ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées à moins qu\'elles ne soient des capacités de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fe4bb1d-7167-49c0-8c13-3bbe37a7f15c\', \'multiverseId\': 645746}, \'multiverseid\': 645746}, {\'name\': \'信仰の足枷\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\n信仰の足枷が戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力はマナ能力でないかぎり起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f396ed2c-4970-46ed-bf75-c865aeac8e3f\', \'multiverseId\': 645974}, \'multiverseid\': 645974}, {\'name\': \'Correntes da Fé\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente\\nQuando Correntes da Fé entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\\nA permanente encantada não pode atacar nem bloquear e suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas, a menos que sejam habilidades de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a4c30b2-4fa3-4581-9af5-9175163a84ee\', \'multiverseId\': 646088}, \'multiverseid\': 646088}, {\'name\': \'信念拘锁\', \'text\': \'结附于永久物\\n当信念拘锁进战场时，你获得4点生命。\\n所结附的永久物不能进行攻击或阻挡，且除了法术力异能之外，其起动式异能也不能起动。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d0acda-df2e-4b23-bd87-a208718fdc53\', \'multiverseId\': 646202}, \'multiverseid\': 646202}]', "[{'name': 'Feuertreu-Feldherrin', 'text': 'Mentor (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, deren Stärke niedriger ist.)\\nImmer wenn der Feuertreu-Feldherrin Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie einem Spieler deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643533&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a587b71d-a46c-47b9-b679-d6cedf161b43', 'multiverseId': 643533}, 'multiverseid': 643533}, {'name': 'Capitana Fuego Auténtico', 'text': 'Mentor. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura atacante objetivo con menor fuerza.)\\nSiempre que la Capitana Fuego Auténtico reciba daño, hace esa misma cantidad de daño al jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Caballero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643824&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21c58292-3ebe-402a-b839-aa5fa767668a', 'multiverseId': 643824}, 'multiverseid': 643824}, {'name': 'Capitaine de Feuréal', 'text': 'Mentor (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature attaquante ciblée de force inférieure.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Capitaine de Feuréal subit des blessures, elle inflige autant de blessures à un joueur ciblé.', 'type': 'Créature — humain et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644115&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3dd8572-c8de-4c0b-bcb8-973c5036e1ae', 'multiverseId': 644115}, 'multiverseid': 644115}, {'name': 'Capitana del Fuocovero', 'text': 'Mentore (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura attaccante bersaglio con forza inferiore.)\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno alla Capitana del Fuocovero, essa infligge altrettanti danni a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644406&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a65fb85a-41e9-4c2d-81d6-d1668ae7ecc9', 'multiverseId': 644406}, 'multiverseid': 644406}, {'name': '真火の隊長', 'text': '教導（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、パワーがこれよりも小さい攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n真火の隊長がダメージを受けるたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。これはそのプレイヤーにそれに等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644697&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b031d71-da24-4a17-9e4f-443d3661cd6c', 'multiverseId': 644697}, 'multiverseid': 644697}, {'name': 'Capitã do Fogo Genuíno', 'text': 'Mentor (Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura atacante alvo com poder inferior.)\\nToda vez que Capitã do Fogo Genuíno sofre dano, ela causa a mesma quantidade de dano ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644988&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be07f450-b2d2-44a9-b602-ab60753d3344', 'multiverseId': 644988}, 'multiverseid': 644988}, {'name': '精炎队长', 'text': '训导（每当此生物攻击时，在目标进行攻击且力量小于它的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当精炎队长受到伤害时，它对目标牌手造成等量的伤害。', 'type': '生物 — 人类／骑士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645279&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '613e9bd9-4879-45c3-905b-a4a8ed81d2cf', 'multiverseId': 645279}, 'multiverseid': 645279}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feurige Prophetin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält die Feurige Prophetin +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Wende dann Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieser Tag endet mit dem Tod, aber nicht mit dem erhofften. Dieser Tag endet mit einem Sieg, aber nicht mit dem erwarteten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afd90a62-3166-48fa-aa53-8f8cceb28151\', \'multiverseId\': 643402}, \'multiverseid\': 643402}, {\'name\': \'Profetisa ardiente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, la Profetisa ardiente obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Luego, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Este día terminará con una muerte, pero no la que esperabas. También acabará con una victoria, pero tampoco es la que esperabas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b9e8a8f-899f-4ec8-95b0-b82d08ac82cc\', \'multiverseId\': 643693}, \'multiverseid\': 643693}, {\'name\': \'Prophétesse brûlante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, la Prophétesse brûlante gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, puis regard 1.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Ce jour s\'achèvera dans la mort, mais pas celle que vous espériez. Ce jour s\'achèvera dans la victoire, mais pas celle que vous attendiez. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643984&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92159835-eca7-4637-82b1-18120110eeb0\', \'multiverseId\': 643984}, \'multiverseid\': 643984}, {\'name\': \'Profetessa Ardente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, la Profetessa Ardente prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno, poi profetizza 1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo giorno terminerà con la morte, ma non quella che speravate. Questo giorno terminerà con la vittoria, ma non quella che vi aspettavate."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395c3ac1-9f92-416b-a4e9-a3ce23588298\', \'multiverseId\': 644275}, \'multiverseid\': 644275}, {\'name\': \'燃え立つ預言者\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、燃え立つ預言者は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。その後、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「その日は死で終わるだろう。だがそれはお前の願った死ではない。その日は勝利で終わるだろう。だがそれはお前の望んだ勝利ではない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8922d0d4-c78e-44bb-b9fe-294a592facb7\', \'multiverseId\': 644566}, \'multiverseid\': 644566}, {\'name\': \'Profeta Incandescente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica não de criatura, Profeta Incandescente recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno. Depois, use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Este dia terminará em morte, mas não a que você anseia. Este dia terminará em vitória, mas não a que você espera."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef4ebd5-3498-4fa2-827a-2449c2815fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 644857}, \'multiverseid\': 644857}, {\'name\': \'灼热先知\', \'text\': \'每当你施放非生物咒语时，灼热先知得+1/+0直到回合结束，然后占卜1。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「这天终会有人丧生，但非你所愿之日。这日终会有人得胜，但非你所料之时。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134f42b2-466f-459c-8dc0-78626e4873ad\', \'multiverseId\': 645148}, \'multiverseid\': 645148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fiese Sabotage\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\\nÜberwachen 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben Informationen darüber, dass einige Gilden von einer unbekannten Macht unterwandert wurden. Bis wir Sicherheit haben, wird kein Plan erfolgreich sein."\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643359&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d08c96db-ed7e-4af9-9cd4-40d480fe5533\', \'multiverseId\': 643359}, \'multiverseid\': 643359}, {\'name\': \'Sabotaje siniestro\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\\nEscruta 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes ponerla en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Según ciertas informaciones, algunos gremios cayeron bajo la influencia de un invasor. Hasta que estemos seguros, nada que emprendamos saldrá bien".\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27628594-7f62-4bb4-a137-3c79b3e9e078\', \'multiverseId\': 643650}, \'multiverseid\': 643650}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre sabotage\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé.\\nSurveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« D\'après nos renseignements, certaines guildes subissent une influence importune. Tant que nous n\'en aurons pas le cœur net, aucune entreprise ne pourra réussir. »\\n—Lazav", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643941&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'604bc7ca-ff0f-4d98-9dac-f7d09d43b23f\', \'multiverseId\': 643941}, \'multiverseid\': 643941}, {\'name\': \'Sabotaggio Sinistro\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\\nSorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Secondo le nostre informazioni, alcune gilde sono cadute sotto l\\\'influenza di un invasore. Finché non ce ne saremo assicurati, nessun progetto andrà in porto."\\n—Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c135cd5-b983-4ef1-9d7b-33831b6d6446\', \'multiverseId\': 644232}, \'multiverseid\': 644232}, {\'name\': \'悪意ある妨害\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\\n諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。そのカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「侵入者の影響によって陥落したギルドが出たという情報がある。確認が取れるまで冒険は控えるのだ。」\\n――ラザーヴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c3c87a7-c870-49f0-ba66-0509e11d8c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 644523}, \'multiverseid\': 644523}, {\'name\': \'Sabotagem Sinistra\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\\nVigiar 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocá-lo em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Temos informações de que algumas guildas estão sofrendo uma influência invasora. Até termos certeza, nenhuma iniciativa terá sucesso."\\n— Lazav\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd5148f4-6319-4990-a5e3-cc57881bdd07\', \'multiverseId\': 644814}, \'multiverseid\': 644814}, {\'name\': \'恶意破坏\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\\n刺探1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将其置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们收到情报，某些公会已经受到了外来入侵者的影响。直到我们调查清楚之前，务必挡下一切恶意行为。」\\n～拉札夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d423240-f8fd-4489-a799-75c55bb7acc6\', \'multiverseId\': 645105}, \'multiverseid\': 645105}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammender Archon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKreaturen können dich nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'„Durch den Staub der Schlacht sah ich das Glitzern der Sonne auf goldenen Mähnen, den Glanz von Ruhm auf Rüstungen — da warf ich mein Schwert weg und weinte ob der Dummheit von Kriegen."\\n—Dravin, Gruul-Deserteur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19f03c7b-4af9-47ce-af05-b38ce7a74952\', \'multiverseId\': 643306}, \'multiverseid\': 643306}, {\'name\': \'Arconte llameante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"A través de la bruma de la batalla divisé el fulgor del sol en una melena dorada, el resplandor de la gloria en armadura; solté mi espada y lloré por la idiotez que es la guerra".\\n—Drávin, desertor gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'354ea5da-f8e3-4e84-a472-973c86780640\', \'multiverseId\': 643597}, \'multiverseid\': 643597}, {\'name\': \'Archonte brûlant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer.\', \'type\': \'Créature — archonte\', \'flavor\': "« Dans la poussière du combat, je vis soudain le reflet du soleil sur une crinière d\'or, la gloire revêtue d\'une cotte de mailles ; je lâchai mon épée et sanglotai devant l\'idiotie de la guerre. »\\n—Dravin, déserteur gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90ee8ea-3c59-4424-8dab-5fb335138c86\', \'multiverseId\': 643888}, \'multiverseid\': 643888}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Sfavillante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLe creature non possono attaccarti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"Attraverso la furia della battaglia vidi il bagliore del sole su una chioma dorata, lo splendore della gloria vestito di una corazza; lasciai cadere la mia spada e piansi per la stupidità della guerra."\\n—Dravin, disertore Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d714bf-7be9-4237-a19d-9358b84d7f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 644179}, \'multiverseid\': 644179}, {\'name\': \'魅力的な執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nクリーチャーではあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'「戦いの喧騒の中に、黄金の髪の上に輝く太陽と、鎧に映る栄光が見えました。私は思わず剣を落とし、戦争の愚かしさに泣き崩れたのです。」\\n――グルールの脱走者、ドレイヴィン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668906e9-0429-4229-ac8c-f4cbf11b42e6\', \'multiverseId\': 644470}, \'multiverseid\': 644470}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs criaturas não podem atacá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"Através da névoa da batalha pude ver o brilho do sol na crina dourada, o resplendor da glória coberto com uma malha, então abaixei minha espada e chorei a estupidez da guerra."\\n— Dravin, desertor Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f84a9bb-35ef-4968-9877-479ad819a2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 644761}, \'multiverseid\': 644761}, {\'name\': \'辉光统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n生物不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 统领\', \'flavor\': \'「在滚滚战尘中，我见到金色鬃毛上闪耀的阳光，荣誉之光辉披甲现身；我于是丢下了剑，为身处这愚蠢战争而流泪。」\\n～古鲁叛逃者卓文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77b79429-448d-46a1-b1c2-24762c9cfbf9\', \'multiverseId\': 645052}, \'multiverseid\': 645052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammender Archon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKreaturen können dich nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'„Durch den Staub der Schlacht sah ich das Glitzern der Sonne auf goldenen Mähnen, den Glanz von Ruhm auf Rüstungen — da warf ich mein Schwert weg und weinte ob der Dummheit von Kriegen."\\n—Dravin, Gruul-Deserteur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2fd860-4f18-40f7-a670-492efbe73c1a\', \'multiverseId\': 645513}, \'multiverseid\': 645513}, {\'name\': \'Arconte llameante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"A través de la bruma de la batalla divisé el fulgor del sol en una melena dorada, el resplandor de la gloria en armadura; solté mi espada y lloré por la idiotez que es la guerra".\\n—Drávin, desertor gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22113936-1c19-40fd-9ea1-03842e2686c0\', \'multiverseId\': 645627}, \'multiverseid\': 645627}, {\'name\': \'Archonte brûlant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer.\', \'type\': \'Créature — archonte\', \'flavor\': "« Dans la poussière du combat, je vis soudain le reflet du soleil sur une crinière d\'or, la gloire revêtue d\'une cotte de mailles ; je lâchai mon épée et sanglotai devant l\'idiotie de la guerre. »\\n—Dravin, déserteur gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b788f36e-1329-4852-b041-13d5a1c5403f\', \'multiverseId\': 645741}, \'multiverseid\': 645741}, {\'name\': \'魅力的な執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nクリーチャーではあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'「戦いの喧騒の中に、黄金の髪の上に輝く太陽と、鎧に映る栄光が見えました。私は思わず剣を落とし、戦争の愚かしさに泣き崩れたのです。」\\n――グルールの脱走者、ドレイヴィン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020200a3-0ada-4eb9-ad12-8861612eb727\', \'multiverseId\': 645969}, \'multiverseid\': 645969}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs criaturas não podem atacá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"Através da névoa da batalha pude ver o brilho do sol na crina dourada, o resplendor da glória coberto com uma malha, então abaixei minha espada e chorei a estupidez da guerra."\\n— Dravin, desertor Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e321f89f-480e-45b1-82a7-4b5716d6d19f\', \'multiverseId\': 646083}, \'multiverseid\': 646083}, {\'name\': \'辉光统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n生物不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 统领\', \'flavor\': \'「在滚滚战尘中，我见到金色鬃毛上闪耀的阳光，荣誉之光辉披甲现身；我于是丢下了剑，为身处这愚蠢战争而流泪。」\\n～古鲁叛逃者卓文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4edd0f5e-6110-4008-b2c8-f076da7c32c1\', \'multiverseId\': 646197}, \'multiverseid\': 646197}]', '[{\'name\': \'Froschodil\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWeiterentwicklung (Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt und falls deren Stärke oder Widerstandskraft höher ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krokodil, Frosch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643433&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a90328d-56c8-47d2-81a9-4a78940b8cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 643433}, \'multiverseid\': 643433}, {\'name\': \'Cocoanuro\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nEvolucionar. (Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, si la fuerza o la resistencia de esa criatura es mayor que la de esta criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rana cocodrilo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ec56873-bd33-4bd7-ba25-4a9d05914f02\', \'multiverseId\': 643724}, \'multiverseid\': 643724}, {\'name\': \'Crocanura\', \'text\': "Portée\\nÉvolution (À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, si sa force ou son endurance est supérieure à celle de cette créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature — crocodile et grenouille\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644015&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb1053a4-4007-4ba4-8f0d-316a694d8c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 644015}, \'multiverseid\': 644015}, {\'name\': \'Anfidrillo\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nEvoluzione (Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, se quella creatura ha forza o costituzione maggiori di questa creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Rana Coccodrillo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3bfebf2-5a99-460e-ad56-6083fcf6bc6b\', \'multiverseId\': 644306}, \'multiverseid\': 644306}, {\'name\': \'両生鰐\', \'text\': \'到達\\n進化（クリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーのパワーかタフネスがこのクリーチャーよりも大きい場合、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クロコダイル・カエル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a314dc53-3118-4885-bfd1-905b6d5c2014\', \'multiverseId\': 644597}, \'multiverseid\': 644597}, {\'name\': \'Crocanuro\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nEvoluir (Toda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, se ela tiver poder ou resistência maior que o desta criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Crocodilo Sapo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ffd49b-6b2a-4e7f-90d1-9a7b127b1d45\', \'multiverseId\': 644888}, \'multiverseid\': 644888}, {\'name\': \'鳄蛙\', \'text\': \'延势\\n进化（每当一个生物在你操控下进战场时，若该生物的力量或防御力大于此生物，则在后者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鳄鱼／蛙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f925ba-fcdc-4224-a4d0-730e87795963\', \'multiverseId\': 645179}, \'multiverseid\': 645179}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funken-Doppelgänger\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Funken-Doppelgänger als Kopie einer Kreatur oder eines Planeswalkers, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass er mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommt, falls er eine Kreatur ist, mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke ins Spiel kommt, falls er ein Planeswalker ist, und nicht legendär ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643360&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f813cd-c758-413d-84f5-3607cabd7f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 643360}, \'multiverseid\': 643360}, {\'name\': \'Doble de chispa\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Doble de chispa entre al campo de batalla como una copia de una criatura o planeswalker que controlas, excepto que entra con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre él si es una criatura, con un contador de lealtad adicional sobre él si es un planeswalker y no es legendario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eeaef61-2e92-46d8-a59e-cc2d64d8a591\', \'multiverseId\': 643651}, \'multiverseid\': 643651}, {\'name\': "Doublure d\'étincelles", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que la Doublure d\'étincelles arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie d\'une créature ou d\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'elle arrive avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire si c\'est une créature, un marqueur « loyauté » supplémentaire si c\'est un planeswalker, et qu\'elle n\'est pas légendaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643942&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccbbd8e9-0d20-4b9e-b01f-90351cee6201\', \'multiverseId\': 643942}, \'multiverseid\': 643942}, {\'name\': \'Clone della Scintilla\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare il Clone della Scintilla nel campo di battaglia come una copia di una creatura o di un planeswalker che controlli, tranne che entra con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale se è una creatura, con un segnalino fedeltà addizionale se è un planeswalker e non è leggendario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ecefb5-8c02-4c6f-8ae1-3e1bfa7f5d54\', \'multiverseId\': 644233}, \'multiverseid\': 644233}, {\'name\': \'灯の分身\', \'text\': \'灯の分身を、これがクリーチャーなら追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、これがプレインズウォーカーなら追加で忠誠カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、伝説でないことを除き、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしている１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7649179c-efd9-4055-99b6-fcc22f3e4103\', \'multiverseId\': 644524}, \'multiverseid\': 644524}, {\'name\': \'Duplicata de Centelha\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Duplicata de Centelha entre no campo de batalha como cópia de uma criatura ou planeswalker que você controla, com a exceção de entrar com um marcador +1/+1 adicional se for uma criatura e um marcador de lealdade adicional se for um planeswalker, e de não ser lendária.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a543f1-d5dd-48fc-801c-71ec428c5108\', \'multiverseId\': 644815}, \'multiverseid\': 644815}, {\'name\': \'火花替身\', \'text\': \'你可以使火花替身当成任一由你操控之生物或鹏洛客的复制品来进入战场，但它不是传奇，且于其进战场时，如果是生物，则上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物，如果是鹏洛客，则上面额外有一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 虚影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f330c2-53d0-48f6-9f1b-81809d402d9c\', \'multiverseId\': 645106}, \'multiverseid\': 645106}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funken-Doppelgänger\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Funken-Doppelgänger als Kopie einer Kreatur oder eines Planeswalkers, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass er mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommt, falls er eine Kreatur ist, mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke ins Spiel kommt, falls er ein Planeswalker ist, und nicht legendär ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c895b1b2-7689-4f84-afea-41a43f44ba28\', \'multiverseId\': 645530}, \'multiverseid\': 645530}, {\'name\': \'Doble de chispa\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Doble de chispa entre al campo de batalla como una copia de una criatura o planeswalker que controlas, excepto que entra con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre él si es una criatura, con un contador de lealtad adicional sobre él si es un planeswalker y no es legendario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4100c76c-aa6c-4a32-93e9-4ac03f5ea6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 645644}, \'multiverseid\': 645644}, {\'name\': "Doublure d\'étincelles", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que la Doublure d\'étincelles arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie d\'une créature ou d\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'elle arrive avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire si c\'est une créature, un marqueur « loyauté » supplémentaire si c\'est un planeswalker, et qu\'elle n\'est pas légendaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645758&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64443246-75e1-48a9-aac2-a5536e1401fe\', \'multiverseId\': 645758}, \'multiverseid\': 645758}, {\'name\': \'Clone della Scintilla\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare il Clone della Scintilla nel campo di battaglia come una copia di una creatura o di un planeswalker che controlli, tranne che entra con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale se è una creatura, con un segnalino fedeltà addizionale se è un planeswalker e non è leggendario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'271937de-731f-45d8-82ea-ad9be1cb4302\', \'multiverseId\': 645872}, \'multiverseid\': 645872}, {\'name\': \'灯の分身\', \'text\': \'灯の分身を、これがクリーチャーなら追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、これがプレインズウォーカーなら追加で忠誠カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、伝説でないことを除き、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしている１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7795ad3-a795-44e4-b5ab-5a4c4a681f91\', \'multiverseId\': 645986}, \'multiverseid\': 645986}, {\'name\': \'Duplicata de Centelha\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Duplicata de Centelha entre no campo de batalha como cópia de uma criatura ou planeswalker que você controla, com a exceção de entrar com um marcador +1/+1 adicional se for uma criatura e um marcador de lealdade adicional se for um planeswalker, e de não ser lendária.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6867542-0b62-44b8-9483-f783d20b4edf\', \'multiverseId\': 646100}, \'multiverseid\': 646100}, {\'name\': \'火花替身\', \'text\': \'你可以使火花替身当成任一由你操控之生物或鹏洛客的复制品来进入战场，但它不是传奇，且于其进战场时，如果是生物，则上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物，如果是鹏洛客，则上面额外有一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 虚影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29b24b4a-254a-4606-8532-d248eeca3f30\', \'multiverseId\': 646214}, \'multiverseid\': 646214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funken-Doppelgänger\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Funken-Doppelgänger als Kopie einer Kreatur oder eines Planeswalkers, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass er mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommt, falls er eine Kreatur ist, mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke ins Spiel kommt, falls er ein Planeswalker ist, und nicht legendär ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646374&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2021d2c2-5c46-4666-ae5b-cf869afdf59a\', \'multiverseId\': 646374}, \'multiverseid\': 646374}, {\'name\': \'Doble de chispa\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Doble de chispa entre al campo de batalla como una copia de una criatura o planeswalker que controlas, excepto que entra con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre él si es una criatura, con un contador de lealtad adicional sobre él si es un planeswalker y no es legendario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0e31174-ed2f-48e7-9f6b-9886d560cd93\', \'multiverseId\': 646402}, \'multiverseid\': 646402}, {\'name\': "Doublure d\'étincelles", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que la Doublure d\'étincelles arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie d\'une créature ou d\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'elle arrive avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire si c\'est une créature, un marqueur « loyauté » supplémentaire si c\'est un planeswalker, et qu\'elle n\'est pas légendaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ad2342-ed6d-47df-b049-69db462b469a\', \'multiverseId\': 646430}, \'multiverseid\': 646430}, {\'name\': \'Clone della Scintilla\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare il Clone della Scintilla nel campo di battaglia come una copia di una creatura o di un planeswalker che controlli, tranne che entra con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale se è una creatura, con un segnalino fedeltà addizionale se è un planeswalker e non è leggendario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1ae900-1241-47bf-8b7a-c62d65952cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 646458}, \'multiverseid\': 646458}, {\'name\': \'灯の分身\', \'text\': \'灯の分身を、これがクリーチャーなら追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、これがプレインズウォーカーなら追加で忠誠カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、伝説でないことを除き、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしている１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3254e3d2-1c7c-4d0b-984f-293829b286b9\', \'multiverseId\': 646486}, \'multiverseid\': 646486}, {\'name\': \'Duplicata de Centelha\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Duplicata de Centelha entre no campo de batalha como cópia de uma criatura ou planeswalker que você controla, com a exceção de entrar com um marcador +1/+1 adicional se for uma criatura e um marcador de lealdade adicional se for um planeswalker, e de não ser lendária.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c0ef11-fa6a-43ed-9a97-a5125ff98985\', \'multiverseId\': 646514}, \'multiverseid\': 646514}, {\'name\': \'火花替身\', \'text\': \'你可以使火花替身当成任一由你操控之生物或鹏洛客的复制品来进入战场，但它不是传奇，且于其进战场时，如果是生物，则上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物，如果是鹏洛客，则上面额外有一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 虚影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a84d111-c1b4-4b2c-bfc3-a88d4832a2ea\', \'multiverseId\': 646542}, \'multiverseid\': 646542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäuste aus Eisenholz\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Fäuste aus Eisenholz ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge zwei 1/1 grüne Saproling-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nur wenige unterschätzen einen Saproling zweimal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'268c86d3-5291-47c1-969e-9354ce1720f4\', \'multiverseId\': 643437}, \'multiverseid\': 643437}, {\'name\': \'Puños de maderacero\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando los Puños de maderacero entren al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Saprolín verdes 1/1.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Los saprolines agregan el tres y el cuatro al "puñetazo uno dos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f958d96-77b2-410c-a9fc-cea458bf71ff\', \'multiverseId\': 643728}, \'multiverseid\': 643728}, {\'name\': \'Poings de ferbois\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand les Poings de ferbois arrivent sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.\\nLa créature enchantée a le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "Les saprobiontes n\'y vont pas avec des gants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644019&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac702714-7e4d-4782-87d3-d4e25f3f3860\', \'multiverseId\': 644019}, \'multiverseid\': 644019}, {\'name\': \'Pugni di Ferrobosco\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando i Pugni di Ferrobosco entrano nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verdi.\\nLa creatura incantata ha travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'I saprolingi aggiungono il tre e il quattro alla combinazione di pugni "uno-due".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d35a6ba6-8213-4bee-a0b5-8c44d8ac36c2\', \'multiverseId\': 644310}, \'multiverseid\': 644310}, {\'name\': \'鉄の樹の拳\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n鉄の樹の拳が戦場に出たとき、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'苗木どもは、左右の連打に上下を加えてくる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906355ae-9d8c-4e64-8ff9-874290999546\', \'multiverseId\': 644601}, \'multiverseid\': 644601}, {\'name\': \'Punhos de Carvalho\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Punhos de Carvalho entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura Saprófita verde 1/1.\\nA criatura encantada tem atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Depois de socar "um-dois", as saprófitas adicionam também o três e o quatro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93d6a7f-6db6-41ee-aa42-002ba6053289\', \'multiverseId\': 644892}, \'multiverseid\': 644892}, {\'name\': \'铁木拳\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当铁木拳进战场时，派出两个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物。\\n所结附的生物具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'连续重击之后，腐生物再补个两拳。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a6560b-c132-4a7d-8620-cf5647a14afa\', \'multiverseId\': 645183}, \'multiverseid\': 645183}]', "[{'name': 'Fürst der Leere', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Fürst der Leere einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die obersten sieben Karten der Bibliothek des Spielers ins Exil und bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte davon unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dämon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643379&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce9651c1-9896-4021-bcb5-d31a2658f96a', 'multiverseId': 643379}, 'multiverseid': 643379}, {'name': 'Señor del vacío', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Señor del vacío haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia las siete primeras cartas de la biblioteca de ese jugador, luego pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura de entre ellas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demonio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643670&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8719823-9d86-419b-b068-c22dfb517466', 'multiverseId': 643670}, 'multiverseid': 643670}, {'name': 'Seigneur du vide', 'text': 'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Seigneur du vide inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez les sept cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature parmi elles.', 'type': 'Créature — démon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643961&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db9cc0b6-a8b4-4623-863d-b246a27023e3', 'multiverseId': 643961}, 'multiverseid': 643961}, {'name': 'Signore del Vuoto', 'text': 'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Signore del Vuoto infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esili le prime sette carte del grimorio di quel giocatore, poi metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura scelta tra esse.', 'type': 'Creatura — Demone', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644252&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0a0c70f-17bc-46f8-b0f6-0008d8f3642a', 'multiverseId': 644252}, 'multiverseid': 644252}, {'name': '虚無の王', 'text': '飛行\\n虚無の王がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を追放する。その後、その中からクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644543&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '165f9745-062e-477e-9e16-002419ff5e09', 'multiverseId': 644543}, 'multiverseid': 644543}, {'name': 'Senhor do Vácuo', 'text': 'Voar\\nToda vez que Senhor do Vácuo causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile os sete cards do topo do grimório daquele jogador e depois coloque um card de criatura dentre eles no campo de batalha sob seu controle.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demônio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644834&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5173e6d1-fa8e-453b-b0db-400beb43d3f4', 'multiverseId': 644834}, 'multiverseid': 644834}, {'name': '虚空领主', 'text': '飞行\\n每当虚空领主对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐该牌手牌库顶的七张牌，然后将其中一张生物牌在你操控下放进战场。', 'type': '生物 — 恶魔', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645125&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '225300c5-d849-4bf6-a7a0-bf21fee9a57a', 'multiverseId': 645125}, 'multiverseid': 645125}]", "[{'name': 'Fürst der Leere', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Fürst der Leere einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die obersten sieben Karten der Bibliothek des Spielers ins Exil und bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte davon unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dämon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645538&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75a068cd-31b9-4303-8af2-00afa117dc56', 'multiverseId': 645538}, 'multiverseid': 645538}, {'name': 'Señor del vacío', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Señor del vacío haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia las siete primeras cartas de la biblioteca de ese jugador, luego pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura de entre ellas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demonio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645652&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '633c4319-970a-4305-811c-aa39cc4d1457', 'multiverseId': 645652}, 'multiverseid': 645652}, {'name': 'Seigneur du vide', 'text': 'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Seigneur du vide inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez les sept cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature parmi elles.', 'type': 'Créature — démon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645766&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd32b63eb-782a-4f11-9a86-328940e16413', 'multiverseId': 645766}, 'multiverseid': 645766}, {'name': 'Signore del Vuoto', 'text': 'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Signore del Vuoto infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esili le prime sette carte del grimorio di quel giocatore, poi metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura scelta tra esse.', 'type': 'Creatura — Demone', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645880&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f161f26d-4a39-46b4-9ff5-b2dacf3cfbc0', 'multiverseId': 645880}, 'multiverseid': 645880}, {'name': '虚無の王', 'text': '飛行\\n虚無の王がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を追放する。その後、その中からクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645994&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd56048a7-1d5e-47a4-824a-313821e4c30e', 'multiverseId': 645994}, 'multiverseid': 645994}, {'name': 'Senhor do Vácuo', 'text': 'Voar\\nToda vez que Senhor do Vácuo causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile os sete cards do topo do grimório daquele jogador e depois coloque um card de criatura dentre eles no campo de batalha sob seu controle.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demônio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646108&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ab795f5-6df7-42cc-ac53-f9e7115aedd5', 'multiverseId': 646108}, 'multiverseid': 646108}, {'name': '虚空领主', 'text': '飞行\\n每当虚空领主对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐该牌手牌库顶的七张牌，然后将其中一张生物牌在你操控下放进战场。', 'type': '生物 — 恶魔', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646222&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '852148c3-fb62-4281-a93c-8630ce45bc34', 'multiverseId': 646222}, 'multiverseid': 646222}]", "[{'name': 'Fürst der Leere', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Fürst der Leere einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die obersten sieben Karten der Bibliothek des Spielers ins Exil und bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte davon unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dämon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646377&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab80326d-164d-46f8-9c70-4d8bd72ed77b', 'multiverseId': 646377}, 'multiverseid': 646377}, {'name': 'Señor del vacío', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Señor del vacío haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia las siete primeras cartas de la biblioteca de ese jugador, luego pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura de entre ellas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demonio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646405&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e36bc028-65cd-402f-8164-d9c1aa08e75a', 'multiverseId': 646405}, 'multiverseid': 646405}, {'name': 'Seigneur du vide', 'text': 'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Seigneur du vide inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez les sept cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature parmi elles.', 'type': 'Créature — démon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646433&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a49a5dd5-0338-4760-992e-5aa0a89094af', 'multiverseId': 646433}, 'multiverseid': 646433}, {'name': 'Signore del Vuoto', 'text': 'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Signore del Vuoto infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esili le prime sette carte del grimorio di quel giocatore, poi metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura scelta tra esse.', 'type': 'Creatura — Demone', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646461&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83f57442-9a63-4fb9-9b49-2246bfbeed61', 'multiverseId': 646461}, 'multiverseid': 646461}, {'name': '虚無の王', 'text': '飛行\\n虚無の王がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を追放する。その後、その中からクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646489&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89497ecd-d09d-4853-93b3-647e2449ecb6', 'multiverseId': 646489}, 'multiverseid': 646489}, {'name': 'Senhor do Vácuo', 'text': 'Voar\\nToda vez que Senhor do Vácuo causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile os sete cards do topo do grimório daquele jogador e depois coloque um card de criatura dentre eles no campo de batalha sob seu controle.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demônio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646517&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f72eaf28-830b-4552-9bc8-64a40ef4f846', 'multiverseId': 646517}, 'multiverseid': 646517}, {'name': '虚空领主', 'text': '飞行\\n每当虚空领主对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐该牌手牌库顶的七张牌，然后将其中一张生物牌在你操控下放进战场。', 'type': '生物 — 恶魔', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646545&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42791209-0dde-4181-b47d-8ccdeaeda07f', 'multiverseId': 646545}, 'multiverseid': 646545}]", "[{'name': 'Geheiligter Springbrunnen', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nSowie der Geheiligte Springbrunnen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt er getappt ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643578&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4adac027-f7e5-4285-a0db-44489bd35336', 'multiverseId': 643578}, 'multiverseid': 643578}, {'name': 'Fuente consagrada', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.)\\nEn cuanto la Fuente consagrada entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, entra al campo de batalla girada.', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643869&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e893bba0-6b72-4b10-8efa-c9de738afaf0', 'multiverseId': 643869}, 'multiverseid': 643869}, {'name': 'Fontaine sacrée', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nAu moment où la Fontaine sacrée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.', 'type': 'Terrain — plaine et île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644160&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f491338f-8489-4a15-b77d-f8d9cdb978ba', 'multiverseId': 644160}, 'multiverseid': 644160}, {'name': 'Fontana Santificata', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nMentre la Fontana Santificata entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644451&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07a124ed-576f-43be-a473-5a42bf2e27db', 'multiverseId': 644451}, 'multiverseid': 644451}, {'name': '神聖なる泉', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\n神聖なる泉が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644742&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d2a6e3c-5b00-4e26-971f-ce7ac2a24209', 'multiverseId': 644742}, 'multiverseid': 644742}, {'name': 'Fonte Santificada', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.)\\nConforme Fonte Santificada entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ela entrará no campo de batalha virada.', 'type': 'Terreno — Planície Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645033&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a5c924d-f592-4cfa-a819-d403f48c5ee4', 'multiverseId': 645033}, 'multiverseid': 645033}, {'name': '崇圣喷泉', 'text': '（{T}：加{W}或{U}。）\\n于崇圣喷泉进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则崇圣喷泉须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 — 平原／海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645324&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcaf21a0-95ae-4289-9eb0-12cf242dc9d4', 'multiverseId': 645324}, 'multiverseid': 645324}]", "[{'name': 'Geheiligter Springbrunnen', 'text': 'Sowie der Geheiligte Springbrunnen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt er getappt ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645615&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8061d897-4877-4028-ba65-a34d49ed9c50', 'multiverseId': 645615}, 'multiverseid': 645615}, {'name': 'Fuente consagrada', 'text': 'En cuanto la Fuente consagrada entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, entra al campo de batalla girada.', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645729&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f525dc7-8fe5-4a66-9d12-0869a85faad7', 'multiverseId': 645729}, 'multiverseid': 645729}, {'name': 'Fontaine sacrée', 'text': 'Au moment où la Fontaine sacrée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.', 'type': 'Terrain — plaine et île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645843&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '936f68cb-fb66-4ef9-8236-9b51acb3a6c9', 'multiverseId': 645843}, 'multiverseid': 645843}, {'name': 'Fontana Santificata', 'text': 'Mentre la Fontana Santificata entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645957&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34d399cf-72ee-447a-9fbe-42cb6413e1dd', 'multiverseId': 645957}, 'multiverseid': 645957}, {'name': '神聖なる泉', 'text': '神聖なる泉が戦場に出るに際し、２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646071&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebbe0f9e-9bf7-40f2-9b7c-e2bc5731e0f9', 'multiverseId': 646071}, 'multiverseid': 646071}, {'name': 'Fonte Santificada', 'text': 'Conforme Fonte Santificada entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ela entrará no campo de batalha virada.', 'type': 'Terreno — Planície Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646185&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c394068e-8cc9-4fa1-a79a-0eb45a7865ea', 'multiverseId': 646185}, 'multiverseid': 646185}, {'name': '崇圣喷泉', 'text': '于崇圣喷泉进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，则崇圣喷泉须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 — 平原／海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646299&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b94efa5e-52a5-405b-b5d7-20b195e60857', 'multiverseId': 646299}, 'multiverseid': 646299}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geröllstreifen-Maaka\', \'text\': \'Blutrausch — {R}, wirf die Geröllstreifen-Maaka ab: Eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Maaka bleiben uns gegenüber in dieser Zeit der Zwietracht loyal. Wir müssen sie nicht einmal füttern — das besorgen schon unsere Feinde."\\n—Nedja, Gruul-Schamanin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643419&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6d10a4-f569-4ee6-b028-ff9ae798ca71\', \'multiverseId\': 643419}, \'multiverseid\': 643419}, {\'name\': \'Maaka de Barrioescombros\', \'text\': \'Empujón — {R}, descartar el Maaka de Barrioescombros: La criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Los maaka nos siguen siendo leales en esta época de conflictos. Ni siquiera tenemos que alimentarlos; ya lo hacen nuestros enemigos".\\n—Nedja, chamán gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff13e03e-1005-4313-afae-e6669c58366c\', \'multiverseId\': 643710}, \'multiverseid\': 643710}, {\'name\': \'Maaka des Éboulis\', \'text\': "Coup de sang — {R}, défaussez-vous du Maaka des Éboulis : Une créature attaquante ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — chat\', \'flavor\': "« En ces temps de conflit, les maakas nous restent fidèles. Et nous n\'avons pas à les nourrir : nos ennemis s\'en chargent. »\\n—Nedja, shamane gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644001&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360025af-cf91-427b-b4ab-9ba39396e270\', \'multiverseId\': 644001}, \'multiverseid\': 644001}, {\'name\': \'Maaka della Zona di Macerie\', \'text\': \'Impeto sanguinario — {R}, Scarta il Maaka della Zona di Macerie: Una creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"I maaka ci sono sempre fedeli in questi tempi di tumulti. Non dobbiamo neppure nutrirli… ci pensano i nostri nemici."\\n—Nedja, sciamana Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d78632-25ae-480c-8f47-b427dc42b993\', \'multiverseId\': 644292}, \'multiverseid\': 644292}, {\'name\': \'瓦礫帯のマーカ\', \'text\': \'湧血 ― {R}, 瓦礫帯のマーカを捨てる：攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'「争いが続く中、マーカはあたしたちによく従ってくれるよ。あの子には餌を与える必要すらないんだ。敵が餌になってくれるからね。」\\n――グルールのシャーマン、ネジャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41970e77-d4a4-4cbc-83b7-771e371ee160\', \'multiverseId\': 644583}, \'multiverseid\': 644583}, {\'name\': \'Maaka da Faixa de Escombros\', \'text\': \'Impulso sanguinário — {R}, descarte Maaka da Faixa de Escombros: A criatura atacante alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"As maakas continuam leais a nós nessa época violenta. Nem precisamos dar de comer a elas. Nossos inimigos cuidam disso."\\n— Nedja, xamã Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04bb70e1-32f2-4198-a89b-7d0c29622398\', \'multiverseId\': 644874}, \'multiverseid\': 644874}, {\'name\': \'瓦砾区玛卡兽\', \'text\': \'血激～{R}，弃掉瓦砾区玛卡兽：目标进行攻击的生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'「现在时机不好，但玛卡兽依然对我们忠心耿耿。我们甚至不必喂它们，因为靠敌人就行了。」\\n～古鲁祭师娜恰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c437e1f-9aaf-417c-aaa0-ee1236f768da\', \'multiverseId\': 645165}, \'multiverseid\': 645165}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesang der Hörnerruferin\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 4/4 grünen Nashorn-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht, und führe dann Bevölkern durch. (Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Kreaturenspielsteins ist, den du kontrollierst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Selesnija sammeln ihre Truppen. Glaubst du immer noch, dass sie sich nicht auf einen Krieg vorbereiten?"\\n—Teysa zu Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643445&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546909c3-5280-4865-a0a3-6d5946548b47\', \'multiverseId\': 643445}, \'multiverseid\': 643445}, {\'name\': \'Canto del llamacuernos\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Rinoceronte verde 4/4 con la habilidad de arrollar, luego repuebla. (Crea una ficha que es una copia de una ficha de criatura que controlas.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los selesnya están reuniendo ejércitos. ¿Todavía crees que no están preparándose para la guerra?".\\n—Teysa, a Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5ded175-8a5d-4a51-9eb4-ed54db123d80\', \'multiverseId\': 643736}, \'multiverseid\': 643736}, {\'name\': \'Chant du meneur de corne\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Rhinocéros avec le piétinement, puis peuplez. (Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un jeton de créature que vous contrôlez.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les Selesnya rassemblent leurs armées. Croyez-vous encore qu\'ils ne préparent pas la guerre ? »\\n—Teysa, à Isperia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfff1077-848f-4b4f-aeab-f90a52115db8\', \'multiverseId\': 644027}, \'multiverseid\': 644027}, {\'name\': "Canto dell\'Evocacorno", \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Rinoceronte 4/4 verde con travolgere, poi popola. (Crea una pedina che è una copia di una pedina creatura che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I Selesnya stanno radunando eserciti. Credi ancora che non si stiano preparando alla guerra?"\\n—Teysa a Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac54fb06-cee4-47b5-a916-0b68fbf63a14\', \'multiverseId\': 644318}, \'multiverseid\': 644318}, {\'name\': \'角呼びの詠唱\', \'text\': \'トランプルを持つ緑の４/４のサイ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成し、居住を行う。（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・トークン１体のコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「セレズニア議事会は軍隊を召集しています。それでもまだ彼らが戦争を企てているわけではないと信じるのですか？」\\n――テイサからイスペリアへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d476aea-7f9f-4e26-a69b-a4fde5f6c0a1\', \'multiverseId\': 644609}, \'multiverseid\': 644609}, {\'name\': \'Cântico do Invocador de Chifres\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Rinoceronte verde 4/4 com atropelar e depois povoe. (Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia de uma ficha de criatura que você controla.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Selesnya estão reunindo exércitos. Você ainda acha que eles não estão se preparando para a guerra?"\\n— Teysa, a Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3251686e-cd8d-4213-99aa-e05506706089\', \'multiverseId\': 644900}, \'multiverseid\': 644900}, {\'name\': \'唤角师吟颂\', \'text\': \'派出一个4/4绿色，具践踏异能的犀牛衍生生物，然后殖民。（派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为由你操控的某衍生生物之复制品。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「瑟雷尼亚正在召集军队。你是否仍然相信他们并非准备发动战争？」\\n～泰莎告诉伊佩利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7422a9e9-7320-4600-b66c-3079a86157c0\', \'multiverseId\': 645191}, \'multiverseid\': 645191}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewundenes Orakel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Gewundene Orakel ins Spiel kommt, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, bringe sie ins Spiel. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Das Orakel verkörpert alles, was für Simic typisch ist: Häutung bedeutet ewigen Fortschritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643470&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'071af271-a0e2-4df8-a2c7-f770c0ae6fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 643470}, \'multiverseid\': 643470}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo serpenteante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Oráculo serpenteante entre al campo de batalla, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra, ponla en el campo de batalla. De lo contrario, pon esa carta en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo víbora\', \'flavor\': \'Restos serpentinos de la naturaleza dirigidos por un cuerpo de pensamiento y progreso, los oráculos son la viva representación de todo lo simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df826d22-f98c-4614-b74c-3990bf8a0371\', \'multiverseId\': 643761}, \'multiverseid\': 643761}, {\'name\': \'Oracle annelé\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Oracle annelé arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Sinon, mettez cette carte dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature — serpent et elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "Une nature reptilienne et un corps de pensées et de progrès : les oracles étaient à l\'image de Simic.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644052&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b181425-8f73-4a18-9b27-ce3a0edecdc0\', \'multiverseId\': 644052}, \'multiverseid\': 644052}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo Acciambellato\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Oracolo Acciambellato entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta terra, mettila sul campo di battaglia. Altrimenti, aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'Sinuose vestigia della natura controllate da un corpo di pensieri e sviluppo; gli oracoli incarnano tutto ciò che è Simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d166aa-2b7a-48f5-b2fd-70c3e4ebab04\', \'multiverseId\': 644343}, \'multiverseid\': 644343}, {\'name\': \'とぐろ巻きの巫女\', \'text\': \'とぐろ巻きの巫女が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それが土地・カードであるなら、それを戦場に出す。そうでないなら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'曲がりくねる自然の面影が思考と進歩へとつながっている巫女の姿は、まさしくシミックそのものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'082a9893-a0dc-463d-aff7-3ff184b8caa0\', \'multiverseId\': 644634}, \'multiverseid\': 644634}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo Enroscado\', \'text\': \'Quando Oráculo Enroscado entrar no campo de batalha, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de terreno, coloque-o no campo de batalha. Do contrário, coloque aquele card em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cobra Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Remanescentes anguiformes da natureza dominados por um corpo de pensamentos e progresso, os oráculos representam tudo o que é simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe2b90a-9d95-43b8-ae8b-1a9d248c6b47\', \'multiverseId\': 644925}, \'multiverseid\': 644925}, {\'name\': \'盘卷先知\', \'text\': \'当盘卷先知进战场时，展示你的牌库顶牌。若它是地牌，则将之放进战场。若否，则将该牌置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 蛇／妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'可思考与创造的身体引导着阴险的自然残存者；此先知正是析米克的具现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c46e34d-0223-48de-b560-f28931a86469\', \'multiverseId\': 645216}, \'multiverseid\': 645216}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewundenes Orakel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Gewundene Orakel ins Spiel kommt, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, bringe sie ins Spiel. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Das Orakel verkörpert alles, was für Simic typisch ist: Häutung bedeutet ewigen Fortschritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645572&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94978650-f427-415b-98c2-f28e7c3d707d\', \'multiverseId\': 645572}, \'multiverseid\': 645572}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo serpenteante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Oráculo serpenteante entre al campo de batalla, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra, ponla en el campo de batalla. De lo contrario, pon esa carta en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo víbora\', \'flavor\': \'Restos serpentinos de la naturaleza dirigidos por un cuerpo de pensamiento y progreso, los oráculos son la viva representación de todo lo simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df592c6b-6951-4fec-bad1-4d895508b2c6\', \'multiverseId\': 645686}, \'multiverseid\': 645686}, {\'name\': \'Oracle annelé\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Oracle annelé arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Sinon, mettez cette carte dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature — serpent et elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "Une nature reptilienne et un corps de pensées et de progrès : les oracles étaient à l\'image de Simic.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e4aaf51-5ad3-45e0-a330-5f8340b3d9d5\', \'multiverseId\': 645800}, \'multiverseid\': 645800}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo Acciambellato\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Oracolo Acciambellato entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta terra, mettila sul campo di battaglia. Altrimenti, aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'Sinuose vestigia della natura controllate da un corpo di pensieri e sviluppo; gli oracoli incarnano tutto ciò che è Simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e21a8d-baaa-406b-b7e7-4c06f132e07f\', \'multiverseId\': 645914}, \'multiverseid\': 645914}, {\'name\': \'とぐろ巻きの巫女\', \'text\': \'とぐろ巻きの巫女が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それが土地・カードであるなら、それを戦場に出す。そうでないなら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'曲がりくねる自然の面影が思考と進歩へとつながっている巫女の姿は、まさしくシミックそのものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f003e9d6-3db5-4daa-b5ab-d7bac78dcad2\', \'multiverseId\': 646028}, \'multiverseid\': 646028}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo Enroscado\', \'text\': \'Quando Oráculo Enroscado entrar no campo de batalha, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de terreno, coloque-o no campo de batalha. Do contrário, coloque aquele card em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cobra Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Remanescentes anguiformes da natureza dominados por um corpo de pensamentos e progresso, os oráculos representam tudo o que é simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebaa7aca-4cf6-4d90-8f87-113be8fa022b\', \'multiverseId\': 646142}, \'multiverseid\': 646142}, {\'name\': \'盘卷先知\', \'text\': \'当盘卷先知进战场时，展示你的牌库顶牌。若它是地牌，则将之放进战场。若否，则将该牌置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 蛇／妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'可思考与创造的身体引导着阴险的自然残存者；此先知正是析米克的具现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d21e4a37-9f16-48dd-b525-350ac972920b\', \'multiverseId\': 646256}, \'multiverseid\': 646256}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gezielter Blitz\', \'text\': \'Der Gezielte Blitz fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl und jeder anderen Kreatur mit demselben Namen wie jene Kreatur 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sehe zahllose Welten. Warum glauben sie, ich könnte sie in nur einer einzigen nicht finden?"\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ce177d-f5ce-410a-af05-16e47f4fef11\', \'multiverseId\': 643410}, \'multiverseid\': 643410}, {\'name\': \'Relámpago preciso\', \'text\': \'El Relámpago preciso hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo y a cada otra criatura con el mismo nombre que esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Veo incontables mundos. ¿Qué les hace pensar que no los encontraré en uno solo?".\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66013d85-deec-475b-a6de-890e5eca91ef\', \'multiverseId\': 643701}, \'multiverseid\': 643701}, {\'name\': \'Éclair chercheur\', \'text\': "L\'Éclair chercheur inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée et à chaque autre créature ayant le même nom que cette créature.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je distingue des mondes innombrables. Qu\'est-ce qui les pousse à croire que je ne les trouverai pas dans un seul ? »\\n—Ral Zarek", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643992&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d12ed9-09b1-45c2-a33a-0fa38791bf01\', \'multiverseId\': 643992}, \'multiverseid\': 643992}, {\'name\': \'Fulmine Autoguidato\', \'text\': \'Il Fulmine Autoguidato infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio e a ogni altra creatura con lo stesso nome.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio sguardo abbraccia mondi infiniti. Credono davvero che non riuscirò a individuarli in uno solo?"\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1574ff5f-3c1c-474d-81fc-7d7f7797f1fd\', \'multiverseId\': 644283}, \'multiverseid\': 644283}, {\'name\': \'誘導稲妻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。誘導稲妻はそれ、およびそれと同じ名前を持ちそれでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺には無数の世界が見えている。あいつらひとつの世界に留まってるくせに、見つからないとでも思ってるのかね？」\\n――ラル・ザレック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56457873-7eff-48cc-adaf-4ef4c638e732\', \'multiverseId\': 644574}, \'multiverseid\': 644574}, {\'name\': \'Relâmpago Guiado\', \'text\': \'Relâmpago Guiado causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo e a cada outra criatura com o mesmo nome que aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vejo mundos incontáveis. O que os faz pensar que não conseguirei encontrá-los em apenas um?"\\n— Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3309114-9bd5-4f3c-95ee-b04346d5f5e5\', \'multiverseId\': 644865}, \'multiverseid\': 644865}, {\'name\': \'导向闪电\', \'text\': \'导向闪电对目标生物和每个与之同名的其他生物各造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我能看到的世界数之不尽。它们怎么会觉得我无法在一个世界中将其尽寻？」\\n～拉尔查雷克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcb7a2a3-51e6-4c2f-b227-32c556d2c61e\', \'multiverseId\': 645156}, \'multiverseid\': 645156}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideon Schwarzklinge\', \'text\': \'Solange es dein Zug ist, ist Gideon Schwarzklinge eine 4/4 Mensch-Soldat-Kreatur mit Unzerstörbarkeit, die immer noch ein Planeswalker ist.\\nVerhindere allen Schaden, der Gideon Schwarzklinge in deinem Zug zugefügt würde.\\n+1: Bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges entweder Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung oder Unzerstörbarkeit (du entscheidest).\\n−6: Schicke ein Nichtland-Permanent deiner Wah ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643318&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e9900c5-fdb2-40a3-a564-ef9cea82ab1a\', \'multiverseId\': 643318}, \'multiverseid\': 643318}, {\'name\': \'Gideon Blackblade\', \'text\': \'Mientras sea tu turno, Gideon Blackblade es una criatura Soldado Humano 4/4 con la habilidad de indestructible que sigue siendo un planeswalker.\\nPrevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer a Gideon Blackblade durante tu turno.\\n+1: Hasta una otra criatura objetivo que controlas gana a tu elección la habilidad de vigilancia, vínculo vital o indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n−6: Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aeb3758-5ebc-40fe-a2e9-5b9a500c94c7\', \'multiverseId\': 643609}, \'multiverseid\': 643609}, {\'name\': \'Gideon Lamenoire\', \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, Gideon Lamenoire est une créature 4/4 Humain et Soldat avec l\'indestructible qui est toujours un planeswalker.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à Gideon Lamenoire pendant votre tour.\\n+1: Jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert, selon votre choix, la vigilance, le lien de vie ou l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-6: Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4f6766-ba02-4d9f-83fd-dbd7036d915f\', \'multiverseId\': 643900}, \'multiverseid\': 643900}, {\'name\': \'Gideon della Blackblade\', \'text\': "Fintanto che è il tuo turno, Gideon della Blackblade è una creatura Soldato Umano 4/4 con indistruttibile che è ancora un planeswalker.\\nPrevieni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto a Gideon della Blackblade durante il tuo turno.\\n+1: Scegli tra cautela, legame vitale e indistruttibile. Fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli ha quell\'abilità fino alla fine del turno.\\n−6: Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'436662b8-e7ab-41a0-99f6-581bfbf57111\', \'multiverseId\': 644191}, \'multiverseid\': 644191}, {\'name\': \'黒き剣のギデオン\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの間、黒き剣のギデオンは破壊不能を持つ４/４の人間・兵士・クリーチャーである。これはプレインズウォーカーでもある。\\nあなたのターン中に黒き剣のギデオンが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\n＋１：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは警戒や絆魂や破壊不能のうち、あなたが選んだ１つを得る。\\n-6：土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ギデオン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c1c898-d1ef-4419-b409-551a327fce93\', \'multiverseId\': 644482}, \'multiverseid\': 644482}, {\'name\': \'Gideon Lâmina Negra\', \'text\': \'Enquanto for o seu turno, Gideon Lâmina Negra será uma criatura Humano Soldado 4/4 com indestrutível que ainda é um planeswalker.\\nPrevina todo o dano que seria causado a Gideon Lâmina Negra durante seu turno.\\n+1: Até uma outra criatura alvo que você controla ganha, à sua escolha, vigilância, vínculo com a vida ou indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n−6: Exile a permanente alvo não de terreno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ec1577d-862a-46c5-bbe6-d6be004eb58e\', \'multiverseId\': 644773}, \'multiverseid\': 644773}, {\'name\': \'乌锋基定\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，乌锋基定便是4/4，具不灭异能的人类／士兵生物，且仍然是鹏洛客。\\n防止于你的回合中将对乌锋基定造成的所有伤害。\\n+1：选择警戒，系命或不灭。至多另一个目标由你操控的生物获得该异能直到回合结束。\\n−6：放逐目标非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 — 基定\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5118d259-0223-4c32-a2f4-44fb4770ffa9\', \'multiverseId\': 645064}, \'multiverseid\': 645064}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glühende Ranken\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkt, fügen ihm die Glühenden Ranken 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{1}, opfere die Glühenden Ranken: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl. Die Glühenden Ranken fügen dem Beherrscher des Permanents 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643469&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a91a94-94c3-4e58-9821-0ad860cb8377\', \'multiverseId\': 643469}, \'multiverseid\': 643469}, {\'name\': \'Lianas de ceniza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance un hechizo que no sea de criatura, las Lianas de ceniza hacen 1 punto de daño a ese jugador.\\n{1}, sacrificar las Lianas de ceniza: Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo. Las Lianas de ceniza hacen 2 puntos de daño al controlador de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d606511d-9021-4a53-8f85-ee4cbad05140\', \'multiverseId\': 643760}, \'multiverseid\': 643760}, {\'name\': \'Cendrelianes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort non-créature, les Cendrelianes infligent 1 blessure à ce joueur.\\n{1}, sacrifiez les Cendrelianes : Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement. Les Cendrelianes infligent 2 blessures au contrôleur de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32a2e82-e733-4658-9597-4a7aac269e35\', \'multiverseId\': 644051}, \'multiverseid\': 644051}, {\'name\': \'Liane di Cenere\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia non creatura, le Liane di Cenere infliggono 1 danno a quel giocatore.\\n{1}, Sacrifica le Liane di Cenere: Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio. Le Liane di Cenere infliggono 2 danni al controllore di quel permanente.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46adbba9-168b-4d8f-9a05-c55f0af03278\', \'multiverseId\': 644342}, \'multiverseid\': 644342}, {\'name\': \'燃えがら蔦\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人がクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、燃えがら蔦はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{1}, 燃えがら蔦を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。燃えがら蔦はそのパーマネントのコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7285070d-5d60-45a8-a865-8ed94dcf5d42\', \'multiverseId\': 644633}, \'multiverseid\': 644633}, {\'name\': \'Lianas Ardentes\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente conjura uma mágica não de criatura, Lianas Ardentes causa 1 ponto de dano àquele jogador.\\n{1}, sacrifique Lianas Ardentes: Destrua o artefato ou o encantamento alvo. Lianas Ardentes causa 2 pontos de dano ao controlador daquela permanente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adae97df-830d-4084-9165-13b627c8dd57\', \'multiverseId\': 644924}, \'multiverseid\': 644924}, {\'name\': \'烬火藤蔓\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手施放非生物咒语时，烬火藤蔓对该牌手造成1点伤害。\\n{1}，牺牲烬火藤蔓：消灭目标神器或结界。烬火藤蔓对该永久物的操控者造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8695c61-0ea6-4c66-8b09-b962e1b766fa\', \'multiverseId\': 645215}, \'multiverseid\': 645215}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glühende Ranken\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkt, fügen ihm die Glühenden Ranken 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{1}, opfere die Glühenden Ranken: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl. Die Glühenden Ranken fügen dem Beherrscher jenes Permanents 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef191791-6db1-4f5e-ac41-0c0497c49e79\', \'multiverseId\': 645571}, \'multiverseid\': 645571}, {\'name\': \'Lianas de ceniza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance un hechizo que no sea de criatura, las Lianas de ceniza hacen 1 punto de daño a ese jugador.\\n{1}, sacrificar las Lianas de ceniza: Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo. Las Lianas de ceniza hacen 2 puntos de daño al controlador de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0bff38d-f82a-4182-a849-45b16320416a\', \'multiverseId\': 645685}, \'multiverseid\': 645685}, {\'name\': \'Cendrelianes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort non-créature, les Cendrelianes infligent 1 blessure à ce joueur.\\n{1}, sacrifiez les Cendrelianes : Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement. Les Cendrelianes infligent 2 blessures au contrôleur de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f244662b-5bfd-4e73-bcf3-6ddb7637888c\', \'multiverseId\': 645799}, \'multiverseid\': 645799}, {\'name\': \'Liane di Cenere\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia non creatura, le Liane di Cenere infliggono 1 danno a quel giocatore.\\n{1}, Sacrifica le Liane di Cenere: Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio. Le Liane di Cenere infliggono 2 danni al controllore di quel permanente.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3290e092-c044-4d2b-b09d-3268e680bcda\', \'multiverseId\': 645913}, \'multiverseid\': 645913}, {\'name\': \'燃えがら蔦\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人がクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、燃えがら蔦はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{1}, 燃えがら蔦を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。燃えがら蔦はそのパーマネントのコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c77b5a-9cf8-45c2-9ac5-3474ffe9f94f\', \'multiverseId\': 646027}, \'multiverseid\': 646027}, {\'name\': \'Lianas Ardentes\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente conjura uma mágica não de criatura, Lianas Ardentes causa 1 ponto de dano àquele jogador.\\n{1}, sacrifique Lianas Ardentes: Destrua o artefato ou o encantamento alvo. Lianas Ardentes causa 2 pontos de dano ao controlador daquela permanente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b56aca56-41a7-4843-a37b-d56d644bcd75\', \'multiverseId\': 646141}, \'multiverseid\': 646141}, {\'name\': \'烬火藤蔓\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手施放非生物咒语时，烬火藤蔓对该牌手造成1点伤害。\\n{1}，牺牲烬火藤蔓：消灭目标神器或结界。烬火藤蔓对该永久物的操控者造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ba2b8b-1851-4110-a2e4-7f594f5c3610\', \'multiverseId\': 646255}, \'multiverseid\': 646255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Elektromagier\', \'text\': \'Spontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Auf die Frage, wie viel Macht erforderlich ist, antworten Izzet-Magier immer nur „mehr".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046c69c9-f876-4492-ab24-aab00d2d47ea\', \'multiverseId\': 643484}, \'multiverseid\': 643484}, {\'name\': \'Electromante trasgo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de instantáneo o de conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se les pregunta cuánto poder hace falta, los magos ízzet siempre responden "más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41700a8e-1c3b-4caa-bedf-0960d360d38b\', \'multiverseId\': 643775}, \'multiverseid\': 643775}, {\'name\': \'Électromancien gobelin\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Quand on leur demande quelle quantité d\'énergie il faut, les mages d\'Izzet répondent toujours « davantage ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644066&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c0a6d3-dcda-404b-8738-df6efbca2b68\', \'multiverseId\': 644066}, \'multiverseid\': 644066}, {\'name\': \'Elettromante Goblin\', \'text\': \'Le magie istantaneo e stregoneria che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Alla domanda "Quanto potere serve?", i maghi Izzet rispondono sempre: "Di più!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd6c6d3-da15-4108-a9e9-abe7893e1d13\', \'multiverseId\': 644357}, \'multiverseid\': 644357}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの電術師\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'どれだけのパワーが必要かと訊かれれば、必ず「もっとだ」と答えるのがイゼットの魔道士である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daae8219-8e52-4186-a9ea-15a584e6cf1e\', \'multiverseId\': 644648}, \'multiverseid\': 644648}, {\'name\': \'Eletromante Goblin\', \'text\': \'As mágicas instantâneas e os feitiços que você conjura custam {1} a menos para conjurar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Quando lhes perguntam quanto poder é necessário, os magos Izzet sempre respondem "mais".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3952c9a9-5ab9-4d20-801b-5270e828cf8e\', \'multiverseId\': 644939}, \'multiverseid\': 644939}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪电流术士\', \'text\': \'你施放的瞬间与法术咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'当被问到需要多强的力量时，伊捷的法师只会回答「更多」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8d38be7-db5e-4a99-9a3b-ae14674e320d\', \'multiverseId\': 645230}, \'multiverseid\': 645230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Elektromagier\', \'text\': \'Spontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Auf die Frage, wie viel Macht erforderlich ist, antworten Izzet-Magier immer nur „mehr".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645578&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'010ec24b-e246-444d-9a88-0b77cbb7da02\', \'multiverseId\': 645578}, \'multiverseid\': 645578}, {\'name\': \'Electromante trasgo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de instantáneo o de conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se les pregunta cuánto poder hace falta, los magos ízzet siempre responden "más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe396bc-f9d1-43ac-aa84-0688226e2ebf\', \'multiverseId\': 645692}, \'multiverseid\': 645692}, {\'name\': \'Électromancien gobelin\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Quand on leur demande quelle quantité d\'énergie il faut, les mages d\'Izzet répondent toujours « davantage ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b34d17c-3cf2-4288-ad4a-d224f74479f4\', \'multiverseId\': 645806}, \'multiverseid\': 645806}, {\'name\': \'Elettromante Goblin\', \'text\': \'Le magie istantaneo e stregoneria che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Alla domanda "Quanto potere serve?", i maghi Izzet rispondono sempre: "Di più!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d6c025-61bc-4fc3-8b6d-e517f8622419\', \'multiverseId\': 645920}, \'multiverseid\': 645920}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの電術師\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'どれだけのパワーが必要かと訊かれれば、必ず「もっとだ」と答えるのがイゼットの魔道士である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53bd2a25-86e3-42e9-8a0b-7d5703e3d57c\', \'multiverseId\': 646034}, \'multiverseid\': 646034}, {\'name\': \'Eletromante Goblin\', \'text\': \'As mágicas instantâneas e os feitiços que você conjura custam {1} a menos para conjurar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Quando lhes perguntam quanto poder é necessário, os magos Izzet sempre respondem "mais".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3ffcab-5d89-46de-b41f-43ee59732d52\', \'multiverseId\': 646148}, \'multiverseid\': 646148}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪电流术士\', \'text\': \'你施放的瞬间与法术咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'当被问到需要多强的力量时，伊捷的法师只会回答「更多」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a2419b-69b6-4645-89ca-acb9fbca38e6\', \'multiverseId\': 646262}, \'multiverseid\': 646262}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golgari-Bandit\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Golgari-Bandit stirbt, lege eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek.\\nAusgraben 4 (Falls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, kannst du stattdessen vier Karten millen. Falls du dies tust, bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643374&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f1ded0a-efe3-4b62-8f51-1cc9c9c1f535\', \'multiverseId\': 643374}, \'multiverseid\': 643374}, {\'name\': \'Malhechor golgari\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Malhechor golgari muera, pon la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nDragar 4. (Si fueras a robar una carta, en vez de eso, puedes moler cuatro cartas. Si lo haces, regresa esta carta de tu cementerio a tu mano.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31d1b09-e667-40f0-9ec1-ee774ff5ecd1\', \'multiverseId\': 643665}, \'multiverseid\': 643665}, {\'name\': \'Étrangleur golgari\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Étrangleur golgari meurt, mettez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nDragage 4 (Si vous deviez piocher une carte, vous pouvez meuler quatre cartes à la place. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez cette carte depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643956&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b6feb2-cf5f-449a-872d-dfc655845299\', \'multiverseId\': 643956}, \'multiverseid\': 643956}, {\'name\': \'Thug Golgari\', \'text\': \'Quando il Thug Golgari muore, metti in cima al tuo grimorio una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nDragare 4 (Se stai per pescare una carta, puoi invece macinare quattro carte. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano questa carta dal tuo cimitero.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a8b5a1-e3bd-44f6-b833-ffac2bb0adee\', \'multiverseId\': 644247}, \'multiverseid\': 644247}, {\'name\': \'ゴルガリの凶漢\', \'text\': \'ゴルガリの凶漢が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\\n発掘４（あなたがカード１枚を引くなら、代わりにカード４枚を切削してもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地にあるこのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05ae12b-fd59-4be0-b405-3ce4c5910c15\', \'multiverseId\': 644538}, \'multiverseid\': 644538}, {\'name\': \'Rufia Golgari\', \'text\': \'Quando Rufia Golgari morrer, coloque o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\\nEscavação 4 (Se você compraria um card, em vez disso, você pode triturar quatro cards. Se fizer isso, devolva este card de seu cemitério para sua mão.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b006c5e-e665-4774-b008-b3ec68cf12dd\', \'multiverseId\': 644829}, \'multiverseid\': 644829}, {\'name\': \'葛加理流氓\', \'text\': \'当葛加理流氓死去时，将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。\\n发掘4（若你将抓一张牌，则你可以改为磨四张牌。如果你如此作，则将此牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c91f4954-b0ad-4912-8b17-11012ee6a479\', \'multiverseId\': 645120}, \'multiverseid\': 645120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golgari-Bandit\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Golgari-Bandit stirbt, lege eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek.\\nAusgraben 4\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9899ce6f-244d-48b0-84a9-2f38e89d88dc\', \'multiverseId\': 645536}, \'multiverseid\': 645536}, {\'name\': \'Malhechor golgari\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Malhechor golgari muera, pon la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nDragar 4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38a8b20a-2ac7-4b24-baf7-b69e67bc080d\', \'multiverseId\': 645650}, \'multiverseid\': 645650}, {\'name\': \'Étrangleur golgari\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Étrangleur golgari meurt, mettez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nDragage 4", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645764&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3823ee8f-e8a8-462a-82c5-d5ef22fff1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 645764}, \'multiverseid\': 645764}, {\'name\': \'Thug Golgari\', \'text\': \'Quando il Thug Golgari muore, metti in cima al tuo grimorio una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nDragare 4\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fdaeaff-e6bf-4e69-99f9-9250c710a9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 645878}, \'multiverseid\': 645878}, {\'name\': \'ゴルガリの凶漢\', \'text\': \'ゴルガリの凶漢が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\\n発掘4\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f61f2b01-f850-40e2-92e8-65faa3281e89\', \'multiverseId\': 645992}, \'multiverseid\': 645992}, {\'name\': \'Rufia Golgari\', \'text\': \'Quando Rufia Golgari morrer, coloque o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\\nEscavação 4\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'137c5893-5d40-484e-9998-d931881f4315\', \'multiverseId\': 646106}, \'multiverseid\': 646106}, {\'name\': \'葛加理流氓\', \'text\': \'当葛加理流氓死去时，将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。\\n发掘4\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52b9a801-42f2-4da8-b7a4-9b55df75fd37\', \'multiverseId\': 646220}, \'multiverseid\': 646220}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golgari-Fundhändler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Golgari-Fundhändler ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sammeln die Vergangenheit der Oberflächenbewohner ein und verkaufen sie ihnen erneut."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4d87d5-4ae8-4e23-bbeb-a5920efc390f\', \'multiverseId\': 643485}, \'multiverseid\': 643485}, {\'name\': \'Bajomercante golgari\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Bajomercante golgari entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de permanente objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Reunimos el pasado de los de la superficie y se lo vendemos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb79f8dc-8f93-42b8-9484-e20ce12e4fce\', \'multiverseId\': 643776}, \'multiverseid\': 643776}, {\'name\': "Négociant d\'objets trouvés golgari", \'text\': "Quand le Négociant d\'objets trouvés golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte de permanent ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous récupérons le passé des habitants de la surface et nous le leur revendons. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644067&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f848d0be-a545-41b3-b49b-ec47c4e882c9\', \'multiverseId\': 644067}, \'multiverseid\': 644067}, {\'name\': \'Esumareperti Golgari\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Esumareperti Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano una carta permanente bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Raccogliamo il passato degli abitanti della superficie e lo rivendiamo loro tale e quale."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963d5ff0-4635-4c6f-8754-c3d1772851bc\', \'multiverseId\': 644358}, \'multiverseid\': 644358}, {\'name\': \'ゴルガリの拾売人\', \'text\': \'ゴルガリの拾売人が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は地上に住む者たちの過去を集め、それを売り返すのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b367c85a-a395-44dc-aacf-91d0a798b988\', \'multiverseId\': 644649}, \'multiverseid\': 644649}, {\'name\': \'Achadista Golgari\', \'text\': \'Quando Achadista Golgari entrar no campo de batalha, devolva o card de permanente alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Recolhemos o passado dos habitantes da superfície e vendemos de volta para eles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f4041e6-d4ff-49d7-8dc2-d874b0fdc709\', \'multiverseId\': 644940}, \'multiverseid\': 644940}, {\'name\': \'葛加理弃物贩商\', \'text\': \'当葛加理弃物贩商进战场时，将目标永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们收集地上居民的过往，再卖回给他们。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862d2f1d-070a-4b37-9b13-663fb14b1c82\', \'multiverseId\': 645231}, \'multiverseid\': 645231}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golgari-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Golgari-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Ort für Hungernde und Kranke, denn im Schwarm sind alle willkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3939675f-6172-4330-8462-b476b3e49727\', \'multiverseId\': 643576}, \'multiverseid\': 643576}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Golgari\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Golgari entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete al gremio de los que sufren el hambre y la enfermedad. Eres bienvenido en el Enjambre cuando el resto de Rávnica te rechaza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c46c1524-6667-4f3d-afff-dd99745ab4c2\', \'multiverseId\': 643867}, \'multiverseid\': 643867}, {\'name\': \'Porte de la guilde de Golgari\', \'text\': \'La Porte de la guilde de Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — porte\', \'flavor\': "Entrez chez les Golgari, affamés et malades. Vous êtes les bienvenus dans l\'Essaim quand le reste de Ravnica vous rejette.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644158&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90dfc1e1-7900-4e56-942d-d17977062985\', \'multiverseId\': 644158}, \'multiverseid\': 644158}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Golgari\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrino coloro che sono affamati e ammalati. Siate i benvenuti nello Sciame, quando il resto di Ravnica vi respinge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1738e912-9b40-4bbd-bcd6-f398bba972e3\', \'multiverseId\': 644449}, \'multiverseid\': 644449}, {\'name\': \'ゴルガリのギルド門\', \'text\': \'ゴルガリのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'飢える人、病める人よ。ラヴニカの誰もにはじかれたあなたを街路衆は迎え入れる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6e3d4e9-9930-40e4-8f1d-bfe85dabf8a3\', \'multiverseId\': 644740}, \'multiverseid\': 644740}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Golgari\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Golgari entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Que entrem os famintos e os doentes. Sejam bem-vindos ao Enxame quando o restante de Ravnica vos rejeita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2181be1-fa3f-4fa7-846c-7d21a2690dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 645031}, \'multiverseid\': 645031}, {\'name\': \'葛加理公会门\', \'text\': \'葛加理公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。\', \'type\': \'地 — 门\', \'flavor\': \'此门收容饥病交迫者；即使在各公会都无处容身，群落也愿接纳。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a16dcffd-7deb-4f63-8511-48afefe15385\', \'multiverseId\': 645322}, \'multiverseid\': 645322}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golgari-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Golgari-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Ort für Hungernde und Kranke, denn im Schwarm sind alle willkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645613&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce4660c-b33c-447b-bd51-71736a6a49eb\', \'multiverseId\': 645613}, \'multiverseid\': 645613}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Golgari\', \'text\