 \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb842cf4-574d-46dd-9dcc-d02137e2ed78\', \'multiverseId\': 643817}, \'multiverseid\': 643817}, {\'name\': \'Révélation du sphinx\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez X points de vie et vous piochez X cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Puisse la connaissance de la loi absolue t\'inciter à mener une existence d\'ordre absolu. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85aefa7c-5629-4590-88c6-b615ea51e9a6\', \'multiverseId\': 644108}, \'multiverseid\': 644108}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione della Sfinge\', \'text\': \'Guadagni X punti vita e peschi X carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Che la conoscenza della legge assoluta vi ispiri a vivere una vita di ordine assoluto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa848074-193a-40bd-a8d6-813d531b684a\', \'multiverseId\': 644399}, \'multiverseid\': 644399}, {\'name\': \'スフィンクスの啓示\', \'text\': \'あなたはＸ点のライフを得、カードＸ枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「汝、絶対の法を知り、絶対の秩序に従い生涯を歩め。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5771dc91-3dfb-41b3-9b17-5338aed25248\', \'multiverseId\': 644690}, \'multiverseid\': 644690}, {\'name\': \'Revelação da Esfinge\', \'text\': \'Você ganha X pontos de vida e compra X cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Deixe que o conhecimento da lei absoluta inspire você a viver uma vida de ordem absoluta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1940ed9c-7223-4e45-af5d-b45e362b1fb1\', \'multiverseId\': 644981}, \'multiverseid\': 644981}, {\'name\': \'史芬斯的启示\', \'text\': \'你获得X点生命且抓X张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「让绝对律法的知识启迪你绝对守序地过活。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b9f0ba-277a-4413-b0ff-3ef1d95aff55\', \'multiverseId\': 645272}, \'multiverseid\': 645272}]', '[{\'name\': \'Offenbarung der Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst X Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Möge das Wissen um das absolute Gesetz dich zu einem Leben der absoluten Ordnung inspirieren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79fbd095-5b05-41a1-9d66-00251b3f2b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 645594}, \'multiverseid\': 645594}, {\'name\': \'Revelación de la esfinge\', \'text\': \'Ganas X vidas y robas X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que el conocimiento de la ley absoluta te inspire para vivir una vida de orden absoluto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e19940-ceb0-424c-8cc2-1eed31ae73c7\', \'multiverseId\': 645708}, \'multiverseid\': 645708}, {\'name\': \'Révélation du sphinx\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez X points de vie et vous piochez X cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Puisse la connaissance de la loi absolue t\'inciter à mener une existence d\'ordre absolu. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1747e271-0ad3-41f6-a363-2f8e970e5d9f\', \'multiverseId\': 645822}, \'multiverseid\': 645822}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione della Sfinge\', \'text\': \'Guadagni X punti vita e peschi X carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Che la conoscenza della legge assoluta vi ispiri a vivere una vita di ordine assoluto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97844957-8250-4e9b-bb8e-553e6f0784d1\', \'multiverseId\': 645936}, \'multiverseid\': 645936}, {\'name\': \'スフィンクスの啓示\', \'text\': \'あなたはＸ点のライフを得、カードＸ枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「汝、絶対の法を知り、絶対の秩序に従い生涯を歩め。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294cd199-94a9-49e6-a118-07283f54b084\', \'multiverseId\': 646050}, \'multiverseid\': 646050}, {\'name\': \'Revelação da Esfinge\', \'text\': \'Você ganha X pontos de vida e compra X cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Deixe que o conhecimento da lei absoluta inspire você a viver uma vida de ordem absoluta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17b838c-3c99-4000-a6b9-b3d565f41801\', \'multiverseId\': 646164}, \'multiverseid\': 646164}, {\'name\': \'史芬斯的启示\', \'text\': \'你获得X点生命且抓X张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「让绝对律法的知识启迪你绝对守序地过活。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=646278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8979649a-5cd1-46cd-b523-f49b31e06b56\', \'multiverseId\': 646278}, \'multiverseid\': 646278}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oktokrabbenhai\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}{U}: Adaptieren 1. (Falls keine +1/+1-Marken auf dieser Kreatur liegen, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf den Oktokrabbenhai gelegt werden, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Die Kreatur enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hai, Oktopus, Krabbe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a346eb-17b1-4752-8c6b-8420312cdf19\', \'multiverseId\': 643520}, \'multiverseid\': 643520}, {\'name\': \'Crustacefaloburón\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}{U}: Adaptar 1. (Si esta criatura no tiene contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nSiempre que uno o más contadores +1/+1 se pongan sobre el Crustacefaloburón, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cangrejo pulpo tiburón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b79dbd5-cadb-49e2-896f-a175284cd7f0\', \'multiverseId\': 643811}, \'multiverseid\': 643811}, {\'name\': \'Crabe céphalosquale\', \'text\': "{2}{G}{U} : Adaptez 1. (Si cette créature n\'a pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un marqueur +1/+1 est mis sur le Crabe céphalosquale, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Cette créature ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature — requin et pieuvre et crabe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13fc6f06-0663-4549-b934-cb15e381bb92\', \'multiverseId\': 644102}, \'multiverseid\': 644102}, {\'name\': \'Squovranchio\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}{U}: Adattamento 1. (Se questa creatura non ha segnalini +1/+1, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nOgniqualvolta vengono messi uno o più segnalini +1/+1 sullo Squovranchio, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Granchio Piovra Squalo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f73722f-221c-4c18-85db-0803d4725d87\', \'multiverseId\': 644393}, \'multiverseid\': 644393}, {\'name\': \'ヒレバサミダコ\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}{U}：順応１を行う。（このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターがないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\nヒレバサミダコの上に１個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれるたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。そのクリーチャーは、次のそれのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サメ・タコ・カニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1753add-5ba1-4bb2-8d29-a3ad13b3db0a\', \'multiverseId\': 644684}, \'multiverseid\': 644684}, {\'name\': \'Tubaropolvoguejo\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}{U}: Adaptar 1. (Se esta criatura não tiver marcadores +1/+1, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela.)\\nToda vez que um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 forem colocados em Tubaropolvoguejo, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Aquela criatura não é desvirada durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tubarão Polvo Caranguejo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f7e16bc-d5b9-4ff3-a531-60ed10eda782\', \'multiverseId\': 644975}, \'multiverseid\': 644975}, {\'name\': \'鲨蛸蟹\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}{U}：演化1。（如果此生物上没有+1/+1指示物，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当在鲨蛸蟹上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。该生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鲨鱼／章鱼／蟹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5d54c3-11ee-4c3a-97f9-a78cb9a363cb\', \'multiverseId\': 645266}, \'multiverseid\': 645266}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Orzhov-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Tritt ein: Wohlstand, Sicherheit und ewiges Leben warten … und es kostet dich nur wenig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2473db-5988-4401-9e91-d65304c128af\', \'multiverseId\': 643580}, \'multiverseid\': 643580}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Orzhov\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Orzhov entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete y encuentra riqueza, seguridad y la vida eterna… por un pequeño pago adelantado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=643871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'292a3eec-c429-40ea-8cd1-076e35735496\', \'multiverseId\': 643871}, \'multiverseid\': 643871}, {\'name\': "Porte de la guilde d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "La Porte de la guilde d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain — porte\', \'flavor\': "Entrez pour trouver richesse, sécurité et vie éternelle... payables d\'avance bien sûr.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'566374b8-83b7-4a82-8e3b-f7e3b2d91f9a\', \'multiverseId\': 644162}, \'multiverseid\': 644162}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrate per scoprire tesori, protezione e vita eterna… per un piccolo prezzo da pagare subito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddf57e6e-6051-48d6-8ca7-655315b11626\', \'multiverseId\': 644453}, \'multiverseid\': 644453}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフのギルド門\', \'text\': \'オルゾフのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'この中で、富、安全、そしてたえなき命を手に入れよ。必要なのはわずかな投資。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=644744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3dce37-4c72-42fa-9906-64ed86b9ec63\', \'multiverseId\': 644744}, \'multiverseid\': 644744}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Orzhov entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Entre para encontrar riqueza, segurança e vida eterna... Mediante uma singela contribuição antecipada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6ed2250-8b7d-49c1-bb14-1a9846ba115a\', \'multiverseId\': 645035}, \'multiverseid\': 645035}, {\'name\': \'欧佐夫公会门\', \'text\': \'欧佐夫公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地 — 门\', \'flavor\': \'此门背后藏有终身财富、安全保障和无尽永生…只要你肯先付点小钱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=645326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28740771-e4ae-4f28-ae7b-c31f7e9695b4\', \'multiverseId\': 645326}, \'multiverseid\': 645326}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Orzhov-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Tritt ein: Wohlstand, Sicherheit und ewiges Leben warten … und es kostet dich nur wenig.\', \'imageUr